<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK› - Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luuk'aasa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luuk'aasi S'aafeedda Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luuk'aasa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk'.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luuk'aasi S'aafeedda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuk'aasi s'aafeedda mishiraachchuu, Yesuusa koyro yaanawaa yaagetti nabatuwaan aabay odetteeddawaa, daro wodiyaappe naagetteedda hidootaw huup'e gideeddawe, Israa'eeliyaa Asay naagiidde de'iyaa S'oossaan Oketteeddawe, asaa zeretsaa ubbaa ashshiyaawaa gidiyaawaa k'onc'c'issee. Yesuusi S'oossaa Aawuwaappe hiyyeesatoo mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odanaw kiitetteeddawaa gidiyaawaanne ha Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalay asaw de'iyaa dumma dumma metuwaa k'aariyaa wolk'k'aa oyk'k'eeddawaa gidiyaawaa Luuk'aasi odee. Luuk'aasa Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa giddon, Yesuusa yuussaabaa odiyaa koyro shemppatuwaaninne k'aykka Yesuusi saluwaa pude keseeddawaa odiyaa wurssetsaa shemppatuwaan loytsiide, odetteeddawe nashechchaabaa. Yesuusi saluwaa keseeddawaappe guyyiyaan ammanuwaabay waan dic'c'eeddenttonne waan aakkeeddentto odiyaa taarikiyaa ha mas'aafaa s'aafeedda bitanii Yesuusi Kiitteeddawanttu Oosuwaa mas'aafaan odeedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiitanchchatuwaa yetsaabay, Yesuusi yeletteedda wode wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu biide be'eeddawaa odiyaa taarikii, Yesuusi na'atetsaan de'iidde Geeshsha Golliyaa beeddabay, k'aretanchcha Saamiraawiyaanne bayiide beetteedda na'aa taarikii Luuk'aasa Mishiraachchuwaa s'alalaan beettiyaawantta. Ha Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa giddon ha gas'aappe hini gas'aa gakkanaw huup'e gidiide s'eeletteeddabay woosaabaa, Geeshsha Ayaanaabaa, Yesuusa oosuwaa giddon mac'c'a asaw de'iyaa sabaanne S'oossay nagaraa atto yaagiyaabaa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisanne Yesuusa yeletaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa oosuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa s'ink'k'ataanne paac'iyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi oosuwaa Galiilaan doommowaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi Galiilaappe Yerusaalame boowaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusaalameninne izi yuushshuwaan Yesuusa wurssetsaa saaminttaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa Yesuusa dendduwaa, k'onc'c'etsaanne saluwaa buussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1-4"/>Bonchchetteedda Toofiloosa, koyro barenttu ayfiyaan be'eeddawanttunne barenttu k'aalaan markkatteeddawanttu nuw odeeddino. S'aafetteedda yewuwaa ta baggan ubbaa S'ap'uwaappe bidda s'eellowaappe guyye, taarikiyaa maaraa naageedda ogiyaan new s'aafanaw lo"a gideeddawe taw beetteedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:1-4"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa Yeletay Koyro Odetteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Yihudaa gadiyaa Kaatiyaa Heroodisa wodiyaan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yihudaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaan Yihudaa gadiyaa geetetteeddawe Filss's'eeme gadiyaa ubbaa bessiyaawaa.</char></note> Aabiyaa k'eesatetsaa oosuwaa baggappe gideedda Zakkaraasa geetettiyaa itti k'eesay de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Od. 24:10</ref></char></note> Machchattakka Elssaabees'o geetettiyaa Aaroone yaraappe yeletteeddawunno. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Laa"atuukka Godaa azazuwaanne seeraa darissiide naagiyaawanttanne kad'ee banttaan S'oossaa sintsan de'iyaa s'illatuwaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Gidoppe attin Elssaabees'a mantsa gido diraw, yeluu unttunttoo baawa. Laa"atuukka laytsaa sugeeddawantta.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Itti gallassi Zakkaraasi bare bagga kaallaan S'oossaa sintsan K'eesatetsan ootsiyaa wode, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>bare K'eesatetsaa wogaa dooyaadan Geeshsha Golliyaa geliide is'aanaa c'uwissuwaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Is'aanaa c'uwissuwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay c'uway woosaa kotaa S'oossaakko gakkee giide wonttanne omarssi wode c'uwissiyaa wogaa.</char></note> saamay Aa gakkeedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Is'aanay c'uwiyaa wode Asay ubbay karen ek'k'iide woossi de'ee.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Godaa kiitanchchay is'aanaa yarshshuwaa saappe ushechchanna ek'k'iide aw beetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakkaraasikka be'eedda wode dagammiide yashshaan mitetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Kiitanchchaykka k'ay yaageedda, «Zakkaraasaa, yayyoppa; ne woosay sisetteedda, ne machchata Elssaabees'a attuma na'aa yelanawunnu. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Aa yeletaan nashetaynne ishaluu new hananawaa; c'oratuukka I yeletto diraw hashshu gaanawantta; <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Ikka Godaa sintsan dara gidanawaa. Matsoyiyaa woyniyaa ushshaa gido haraa matsoyiyaa ushshaa ayinne ushenna; bare daay uluwaan de'ishshin Ayaanaa Geeshshay aan kumanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Pay. 6:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>«Israa'eeliyaa asatuwaappekka c'oratuwaa unttunttu Godaa S'oossaakko, I zaaranawaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Ikka giigenna asaa Godaw giigissanaw, aawotuwaa wozanaa naanatuwaakko, azazettenawanttakka s'illotetsaa eraakko zaaranaw, Eelaasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eelaasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe geetetteeddawe, kase Ec'a C'aak'uwaa mas'aafaan Nabiyaa Eelaas ooratsabaa ootsiyaa wolk'k'aan eretteeddawaa diraassa.</char></note> ayyaanaaninne wolk'k'aan Godaappe sintsanna bee.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakkaraasikka kiitanchchaa, «Taani c'imaad, tamachchattakka bare laytsaan sugeeddawunno, hawaa taani ayaan eranitaa?» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Kiitanchchaykka zaariide, «Taani S'oossaa sintsan ek'k'iyaa Gabreela; hawaa mishiraachchuwaa new odanaw neekko kiitettaad;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Hekko he wodiyaan hanana ta k'aalaa ne ammanabeenna diraw, ha yewuu hanana gallassay gakkanaw neeni duude gidanaassa; haasayanawukka danddayakka» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>He wode asay, Zakkaraasi Geeshsha Golliyaappe kesennaan ayaw gam"eeddentto maalalettiidde naagiino. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Keseedda wodiyaankka haasayanaw danddaybbeenna; Geeshsha Golliyaan sas'aa I be'eeddawaa akeekeeddino; ikka haasayanaw danddayibeennawaa s'orssi bessiide, duude gidiide de'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Zakkaraasikka bare oosuwaa wodiyaa wursso wode, bare golle simmeedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Aa machchata Elssaabees'a shahaaraade ichcheshu agenaa barena gentsaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Elssaabees'akka, «Ta tooshiyaa asaa giddoppe digganaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ta tooshiyaa asaa giddoppe digganaw: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asinaa geleedda mishiratta na'aa yelennaan attooppe, Isiraa'eeliyaa asaa k'ofaan, «S'oossay izo muri de'ee» yaagettaw.</char></note> Goday bare maarotetsaan taana s'eello wode, hawaadan taw ootseedda» gaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Yeletay Kasetiide Odetteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Usuppuntsa agenaan S'oossaa kiitanchchaa Gabreel Galiilaa gadiyaan Naazireete Katamaa <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Daawita yaraappe gideedda Yooseefo geetettiyaa bitanew ooshetta k'ashetteedda wodorattikko S'oossaa matappe kiitetteedda; wodoratti suntsaykka Mayraamo geetettee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat. 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Kiitanchchaykka Mayraamikko yiide, «Darissaade dosettawunnee, sarotetsay new gido; Godaykka neenanna gatso de'ee; Neenikka mac'c'awanttu giddon anjjetteeddawunno»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Neenikka mac'c'awanttu giddon anjjetteeddawunno: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'ofay beni c'imeedda Giriikiyaa mas'aafaan baynnawaa gidiyaa diraw, itti itti Inggilizeetsuwaaninne Amaaraatsuwaa mas'aafaankka baawa.</char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mayraamakka Aa haasayaappe denddowaan darissa dagamaade, «Hawe ayaa mala sarotaa gidanee» gaade yewuwaa k'oppaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Kiitanchchay izo, «Hanne Mayraamee, S'oossaa matan sabaa demmaadda yayyoppa. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Neeni shahaaraade, attuma na'aa yelanaassa; Aa suntsaakka Yesuusa gaanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat. 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Ikka dara gidanawaa; Ubbaappe D'ok'k'a S'oossaa Na'aa geetettana; Godaa S'oossay Aa aabbu Daawita kawutetsaa oydiyaa aw immanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Ikka Yaak'ooba gollen med'inaw kawutanawaa; Aa kawutetsawukka wurssetsay baawa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam. 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mayraamakka kiitanchchaa, «Taani wodoratto gido diraw, hawe wooti hananawee?» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Kiitanchchaykka zaariide iziw, «Ayaanaa Geeshshay ne bolla yaanawaa; D'ok'k'a S'oossaa wolk'k'ay neenan shemppanawaa. Hewaa diraw, neeppe yelettiyaawe geeshsha S'oossaa Na'aa geetettana. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ne dabbatta Elssaabees'a bare c'imatetsaa wodiyaan attuma na'aa shahaaraaddu. Mantsa geetetteeddawunna Elssaabees'a shahaaroodeppe usuppuntsa agenaa oyk'k'aaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>S'oossaa s'ooniyaa yewuu baawa»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Dom. 18:14</ref></char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mayraamakka, «Taani Godaa ayilatto; neeni goowaadan hano» gaaddu. Hewaappe guyyiyaan kiitanchchay izi matappe beedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mayraamakka Elssaabees'o Oochchanaw Baaddu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mayraamakka he agenaa giddon denddaade killi zoozetiyaa Yihudaa gaden de'iyaa itti katamaa elleella kesaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakkaraasa golle gelaade Elssaabees'o sarotaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elssaabees'akka Mayraami sarotaa siseedda wode, izi uluwaan de'iyaa shahaaray guppeedda; Elssaabees'akka Ayaanaa Geeshshaan kumaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Bare kooshshaakka d'ok'k'u ootsaade, «Neeni mac'c'awanttu giddoppe anjjetteeddawunno. Neeppe yelettiyaawekka anjjettowaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Neeni ta Godaa daaya taakko yaanaw taani oonee? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Hekko ne sarotaa kooshshay ta haytsaan sisetteedda wode, ta uluwaan de'iyaa shahaaray nashechchaan guppeedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Goday polettee giide iziw odeeddawaa ammaneeddawunna iza anjjetteeddawunno» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mayraami Galataa Yetsaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 1:46-53">1:46-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mayraamakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:46">«Ta shemppatta ta Godaa bonchchaw,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Ta ayyaanaykka ta S'oossaa, ta d'aliyaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">loytsa nashettaw.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Ikka bare ayilatti tooshiyaa s'eelleedda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Hachcheppe doommiide yeletay ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">anjjetteeddawunnee giino.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Wolk'k'aama gideedda I,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">daro yewuwaa taw ootseedda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Aa suntsaykka geeshsha.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Aa maarotay yayyiyaawanttoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">yeletaappe yeletay gakkanaw de'ee.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Bare wolk'k'aan mino kiitaa kiitetteedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">barenttu wozanaa k'ofaan otorettiyaawantta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">laaleedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Mooddiyaawantta kawutetsaa maataa oydiyaappe wotseedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ashikkatuwaakka k'ay d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootseedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Koshatteeddawantta lo"o yewuwaan kalisseedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">duratuwaa k'ay mela yedersseedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Bare maarotetsaa k'oppiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">bare ayiliyaa Israa'eeliyaa maadeedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Nu aawaatoo I odeeddawaadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abrahaamewunne Aa yaraw geeddawaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">med'inaw naagana diraassa»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:55">yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mayraamakka heezzu agenaa keena Elssaabees'i matan gam"owaappe guyyiyaan bare golle simmaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elssaabees'iwukka yeliyaa wodii gakkina, attuma na'aa yelaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Izi shooratuunne izi dabbo gideeddawanttu, Goday maarotetsaa iziw ootseeddawaa sisiide izinna ittippe nashetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Hosppuntsa gallassaan na'aa k'as's'aranaw yeeddino; Aa, aawuwaa suntsaan Zakkaraasa giide suntsanaw koyyeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Wog. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Aa daaya k'ay, «Hanenna, Yohaannisa geetettanaw koshshee» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Unttunttukka izo, «Ne dabbatuwaappe hachche gakkanaw ittuukka ha suntsaan s'eesettibeenna» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Aa aabba, oona giyaa suntsan s'eegettanaw koyyintto s'orssi oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Aa aabbukka s'aafiyaabaa oochchi akkiide, «Na'aa suntsay Yohaannisa» giide s'aafina, ubbatuukka yewuwaan maalaletteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Hewankka Zakkaraasa doonay dooyetteedda, Aa ins's'arssaykka bilettina haasayaa doommeedda, S'oossaakka galateedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Aa shooratuukka de'iyaasaa ubbaan yashshaan kumeeddino. Ha yewuukka zoozetiyaa Yihudaa gadiyaa ubbaan darii haasayetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Hawaakka siseeddawanttu ubbatuu, «Ha na'ay ayaa gidaneeshsha?» yaagiide yewuwaa barenttu wozanaan oyk'k'eeddino; S'oossaykka aanana de'iyaawaa ereeddino.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zakkaraasa Galataanne Timbbitiyaa Oduwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Yohaannisa aabbu Zakkaraasi Ayaanaa Geeshshaan kumiide timbbitiyaa yaagi odeedda:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Israa'eeliyaa Goday S'oossay anjjetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">yiide bare asaa s'omooseeddanne wozeedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Bare ayiliyaa Daawite golliyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">wolk'k'aama ashshiyaawaa nuw giigisseedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Hawekka beni Godaa geeshsha nabatuwaa doonaan odettowaadan,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>I nuuna, nu morkkatuwaappenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nuunanna ek'ettiyaawanttu kushiyaappe ashshanaassa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Hawaakka I ootseeddawe, nu aawaatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">maarotetsaa bessanaassanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">bare geeshsha c'aak'uwaa wozanaa aatsanaassa.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Nu aawuwaa Abraahaamoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">c'aak'k'eedda c'aak'uwaa k'oppanaw,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>nu morkkatuwaa kushiyaappe kesiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">yashshay banttaan aw ootsanaadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">maataa nuw immeedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Hawenneekka, nuuna nu wodiyaa ubbaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">geeshshatetsaaninne s'illotetsaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">bare sintsaan essana diraassa.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Zaariidekka, neenoo, ta na'aw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">D'ok'k'a S'oossaa nabiyaa geetettanaassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ogiyaa giigissanaw Godaappe sintsanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">baanaassa.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Asaa nagaraa maariyaa atotetsaa eraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">unttunttoo immanaassa.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Hewekka killippe yeedda poo'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">nuuna s'omooseeddawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">nu S'oossaa maarotetsaanne k'aretaa gaasuwaana.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Aa poo'uukka d'umaaninne hayk'uwaa kuwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">utteeddawanttoo poo'issee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nu gediyaakka sarotetsaa ogiyaan suurissee.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Na'aykka dic'c'iide, ayaanaan minneedda; Israa'eeliyaa asaw beetteedda gallassay gakkanaw mela biittaan de'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Yeletaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>He wode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">He wode, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Geetettowe S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi yeletti simmiide biro guutsatetsaan de'ishshin Yesuusi yeletto wodiyaanna.</char></note> Roomaa kawutetsaa garssan de'iyaa Asay ubbay suntsaa s'aafettanaadaninne paydettanaadan Awugiss's'oose K'eesareppe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">K'eesaara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giyaa suntsay kaatiyaa guussa. Hewenneekka c'ora gadiyaa mooddiyaa wolk'k'ay de'iyaa c'ora kaatatuwaa kaatiyaa guussaa.</char></note> azazuu keseedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Hewenneekka, K'ereneyoose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">K'ereneyoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Geetettiyaawe Roomaa kaatii Awugiss's'oose, Sooriyaa geetettiyaa Yihudaanne Galiilaa Awuraajjatuwaa oyk'k'eedda gadiyaan suntsayeeddawaa.</char></note> Sooriyaa gadiyaa mooddiyaa wode haneedda koyro asaa payduwaa.<verse eid="LUK 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Hawaa diraw itti itti Asay s'aafettanaw bare katamaa bare katamaa beedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yooseefokka Daawita golliyaappenne yaraappe gidiyaa diraw Galiilaa Awuraajjaan de'iyaa Naazireete katamaappe denddiide Daawita katamaa gideeddawunnikko Yihudaan de'iyaa Beeteleeme geetettiyaa katamaa keseedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>He wode yeliyaa wodii mateedda aw ooshetta utteedda Mayraamakka aanana ittippe baaddu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Unttunttu hewaan de'ishshin iziw yeliyaa wodii gakkii aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Izakka Bayira Na'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bayira na'aa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isiraa'eeliyaa Asay yeletteedda na'aa ubbaa golliyaankka S'oossaw bessiyaawaa giino.</char></note> gideedda attuma Na'aa yelaaddu; imatsay shemppiyaa sa'aa demmabeenna diraw, na'aa mayuwaan s'aas'aade Gap'atiyaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7, 12, 16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Gap'atiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha miishshay miyay miyaabay sa'aan laalettennaan maana mala yeggiide immiyaabaa.</char></note> k'eraaddu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wudiyaa Heemmiyaawanttanne Kiitanchchatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>He gadiyaan k'amma barenttu wudiyaa heemmiidde dembban ak'iyaawanttu de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>S'oossaa kiitanchchay k'oppennaan yiide unttunttu miyyiyaan ek'k'eedda; Godaa bonchchuu unttunttu yuushshuwaan poo'eedda wode, wolk'k'aama yashshay unttuntta oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kiitanchchay unttuntta, «Yayyoppite, asaw ubbaw haniyaa daro nashechchiyaa mishiraachchuwaa taani hinttenttoo ahaad. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Hachche Daawita katamaan ashshiyaawe yeletteedda. Ikka Godaa Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Hawe hinttenttoo malla gido: Gac'ino na'ay mayuwaan s'aas'ettiide gap'atiyaa giddon giseeddawaa demmanita» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>K'oppennaan c'ora S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu koyro kiitanchchaanna ittippe k'onc'c'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>S'oossaakka galatiide, hawaadan geeddino:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">«Bonchchuu S'oossaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">bolla saluwaan gido.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">Sa'aan I dosiyaa asaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">sarotetsay gido»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 2:14">yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Kiitanchchatuu unttunttuppe shaakettiide saluwaa kesowaappe guyye, wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu, «Goday nuw k'onc'c'isseeddawaa, hawaa haneedda yewuwaa be'anaw Beeteleeme boytte» geetetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Unttunttukka elleelliide beeddino. Mayraamonne Yooseefo demmiide, gacino na'aykka gap'atiyaan giseeddawaa be'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan guutsa na'aa diraw odetteeddawaa k'onc'c'issiide odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Hawaa siseedda ubbay unttunttu odeedda yewuwaan maalaletteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mayraama k'ay hawaa ubbaa bare wozanaan oyk'k'aade k'oppaadde gam"aaddu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttukka ubbaa yewuu unttunttoo odetteeddawaadan hanina demmo diraw, siseeddawoonne be'eeddawoo ubbaw S'oossaa bonchchiiddinne galatiidde simmeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Na'aw hosppun gallassaa gidina k'as's'arettiyaa wodii gakko wode, I aatti uluwaan attanaappe kase, kiitanchchay kesso suntsaan, Yesuusa geetetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Wog. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk'. 1:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan S'oossaw Sheed'etteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Muse wogaa maaraadan geeyyiyaa wodii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Geeyyiyaa wodii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihudatuwaa mac'c'a Asay attuma na'aa yelowaappe guyyiyaan, «Geeshsha gidukku» yaagi k'oppiino. K'aykka he na'ay k'as's'arettana gakkanaw iza soyippe kesennaadaan oosettaw. Ha wodii, geeyyiyaa wodiyaa geetettee.</char></note> poletteedda wode Yooseefonne Mayraama gac'ino na'aa S'oossaw sheed'd'anaw Yerusaalame akki beeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Hewenneekka Godaa wogaan, «Attuma na'aa gideedda bayira na'ay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bayira na'ay: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:7">2:7</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'eellite.</char></note> ubbay S'oossaw dummateeddawaa gidanawaa» geetetti s'aafetteeddawaadaaninne,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kes. 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>k'aykka Godaa wogaan, «Laa"u dogommatuwaa woy laa"u harap'p'e maratuwaa» geetettowaadan, Godaw yarshshuwaa yarshshanaw afeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>He wode s'illonne genc'c'a gideedda Simoona geetettiyaa itti bitanii Yerusaalamen de'ee. Ikka, Israa'eeliyaa asaw atotetsaa hidootaa naagiyaawaanne Ayaanaa Geeshshay Aa bollaan shemppeedda asaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Godan oketteedda Kiristtoosa be'ennaan hayk'k'ennawaa Ayaanaa Geeshshaan aw k'onc'c'isseedda.<verse eid="LUK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Ikka he wode Ayaanaa Geeshshay kaaletsina, Geeshsha Golliyaa geleedda. Na'aa yelawanttu eriyaa wogaa maaraadan, koshshiyaawaa aw polanaw guutsa na'aa Yesuusa oyk'k'iide gelo wode,<verse eid="LUK 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoone mokki akki na'aa idimmiide S'oossaa galatiidde hawaa yaageedda:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Godaw, Neeni k'aalaa gelo maaraadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ha"i taana ne ayiliyaa saruwaan neekko afa.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30-31"/>Gaasuukka, ta ayfatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:30-31">asaa ubbaa sintsan Neeni giigisseedda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:30-31">ashshiyaa hidootaa be'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:30-31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Hewekka Israa'eeliyaa gidenna asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">k'onc'c'etsaa immiyaa poo'uwaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">K'ay Ne asaw Israa'eelew bonchchuwaa.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yooseefonne Aa daaya Aa diraw haasayetteedda yewoo maalaletteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simoonikka anjjiide Mayraamo, «Hawe Na'ay Israa'eeliyan c'oratoo dendduwaassinne kunddetsaw gaaso gidanaw, k'aykka iitaa haasayiyaawanttoo malla gidanaw dooretteedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>C'oratookka wozanaa k'ofay k'onc'c'owaa gidanaw, ne shemppuukka mashshaan k'ans's'owaadan seelettanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>K'aykka Aaseera yaraappe gideedda Paanu'eela naatta Haanno geetettiyaa nabatta de'aw; Izakka loytsa c'imaaddu. Bare wodorotetsaan geleedda asinaana laappu laytsaa de'eeddawunno. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Izi laytsaykka hosppun tammanne oydduwaa gidana gakkanaw gallassaanne k'ammaa geeshsha golliyaappe shaakettennaan s'oomaaninne woosaan kiitettaadde am"e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Am"e: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Am"e guussay asinay hayk'k'ina gelennaan gam"eedda mac'c'awuno. Ha payduwaan s'aafetteedda mishiratta laappu laytsaa s'alalaa asinaana gam"owaappe guyye 84 laytsaa ubbaa am"e gidaade gam"aaddu.</char></note> gidaade gam"aaddu.<verse eid="LUK 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>He wodekka shiik'aade S'oossaa galataaddu; K'aykka Yerusaalame Asay wozettanaw naagiyaawanttoo ubbatoo gac'ino Na'aa Yesuusabaa odaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yooseefonne Mayraama Naazireete Simmeeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yooseefonne Mayraama Godaa higgiyan azazetteeddawaa ubbaa polowaappe guyye Galiilaa Awuraajjaan de'iyaa barenttu katamaa Naazireete simmeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Guutsa na'aykka dic'c'iiddenne minniidde beedda; aad'd'o eraankka kumeedda; S'oossaa aad'd'o keekatetsay Aa bollaan shemppeedda.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guutsa Na'aa Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Yooseefonne Mayraama laytsaan laytsaan Paasigaa Baalaa bonchchanaw Yerusaalame katamaa biino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kes. 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Zar. 16:1-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Na'awukka tammanne laa"u laytsaa gido wode dooyaadan baalaw hini Yerusaalame keseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Baalaa polowaappe kaala barenttu golle unttunttu simmoode guutsa na'aa Yesuusi Yooseefonne Mayraama erennaan Yerusaalamen atti aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Unttunttunna ittippe de'iyaawaa malatina itti gallassaa ogiyaa hametteeddino. Guyyeppe k'aykka barenttu dabbatuwaannanne barenttu siik'ettiyaawanttu matan koshshaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>D'ayo wode koyyiidde hini Yerusaalame simmeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Heezzu gallassaappe guyye, tamaarissiyaawanttu giddon Yesuusi uttiide unttunttu giyaawaa sisiiddenne unttuntta oochchiidde Geeshsha Golliyaa garssan de'iyaawaa be'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Sisiyaawanttu ubbatuukka, Aa akeekaaninne Aa zaaruwaan maalaletteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Yooseefonne Aa daaya Aa be'o wode maalaletteeddino. Aa daayakka, «Ta Na'aw, ayaw nuuna hawadan ootsay? Ne aabbunne tanne Neena koyyiidde, daro metooteeddo» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesuusikka unttunttoo, «Ayaw taana koyyiitee? Ta aabbu gollen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ta aabbu gollen: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay, Ta aabbu kiitteedda oosuwaa polanaw bessee guussaa.</char></note> de'anaw taw koshshiyaawaa eribeykkitee?» yaagi zaareedda. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Hewaa yaagi odooppe attin, unttunttoo I odeedda yewuu ayaa gintto gelibeenna.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Hewaappe simmiide, unttunttunna ittippe hini Naazireete beedda; hewankka unttunttoo azazettee. Aa daayakka hewaa ubbaa bare wozanaan wotsaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesuusikka eraaninne geesan, sabaanikka S'oossaanne asaa sintsan dic'c'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Lem. 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi Yesuusaw Ogiyaa Giigissee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>S'ibaariyoosa geetettiyaa kaatii kawuteedda tammanne ichcheshetsiyaa laytsaan P'ens's'enaawiyaa P'ilaas'oosi Yihudaa mooddiyaa wode, Heroodise Galiilaan oyddentsiyaa shaakuwaa mooddiyaa wode, Aa ishay Pilip'p'oosikka Is'uuriyaaninne S'irkkonddoosan oyddentsiyaa shaakuwaa mooddiyaa wode, Lisaaniyoosikka Abileenen oyddentsiyaa shaakuwaa mooddiyaawaa gidiide mooddi de'ishshin, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Haanninne K'eyyaafay k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">K'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Haanninne K'eyyaafay: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haanna kaappotetsaa wodii Yesuusi yelettanaappe kase 6-15 laytsaa gakkanaassa. K'eyyaafaa geetettiyaa Haanna bolluu 18-37 laytsaa kaappo gidiide Yesuusa yeletaappe kase gam"eedda.</char></note> gidiide de'ishshin, S'oossaa k'aalay Zakkaraasa na'aa Yohaannisakko mela biittaan yeedda.<figure style="fig" alt="High priest" file="hk00267b.tif" size="col" ref="3:2">K'eesatuwaa Kaappuwaa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yohaannisi Yorddaanoosa Shaafaa heeraa ubbaa biide, «Hintte nagaray atto geetettana mala nagaraa paas'iide s'ammak'ettite» yaagi tamaarisseedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Nabiyaa Isiyaasa mas'aafan s'aafetteedda k'aalaadan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa. 40:3-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">«Mela biittaan waassiyaa bitaniyaa kooshshay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Godaw ogiyaa giigissite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Aa ogiyaakka suurissite.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Ollay ubbay kumo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">deriinne zoozii denbbaa gido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">giigenna ogii ubbay giigo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">hanchchiro ogii ubbay liik'o.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Hewaa gidooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">Asay ubbay S'oossay ashshiyaawaa be'ana› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:6">yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Hawaa diraw Yohaannisi Aa kushiyan s'ammak'ettanaw keseedda asaw hawaadan oduwaa doommeedda, «Henttenoo, shooshshaa naatoo; yiyaa hank'k'uwaappe attana mala hinttentta ooni mak'k'eeddee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Simmi hinttenttu nagaraappe simmeeddawanttoo bessiyaa ayfiyaa ayfite. Hinttenttu wozanaan Abraahaamo nu aabbu de'ee gooppite. S'oossay Abraahaamoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraahaamoo naanaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihuda asatuu barentta S'oossay dooreedda asaa yaagi k'oppiino. Gaasuunnekka, beni hidootaa k'aalay S'oossaappe nu aabbu Abraahaamoo imetteedda yaagiide k'oppiyaa diraassa.</char></note> naanaa ha shuchchatuwaappe dentsanaw danddayee yaagaade taani hinttenttoo oday. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ha"i ubbaa bees'i mitsaa s'ap'uwaan k'ans's'anaw giigi utteedda; simmi lo"o ayfiyaa ayfena mitsay ubbay k'ans's'ettiide tamaan olettanawaa.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>«Yaatina ha"i nu ayaa udanee?» yaagiide Aa c'ora Asay oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohaannisikka, «Laa"u mayuu de'iyaawe baynnawoo immo; k'umay de'iyaawekka baynnawoo gisho» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>K'aras'aa shiishshiyaawanttukka s'ammak'ettanaw yiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, nu ayaa udanee?» yaagi oochcheeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk'. 7:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>I unttunttoo, «Geetettowaappe aad'd'o k'aras'aa aatsi shiishshoppite» yaagi odeedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Hewaappe kaala wotaadaratuu, «Nuunishi, ayaa udanee?» yaagi Aa oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Yohaannisikka, «Asaa shaluwaa naak'uwaan bonk'k'i akkoppite, oonanne wordduwaan mootoppite, hinttenttu dirgguu hinttenttoo gidana» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>He wode Asay ubbay Kiristtoosa yuussaa naagiidde de'iyaa diraw Yohaannisa, «Hawekka Kiristtoosa gidennaan attena» yaagiide barenttu wozanaan maleeddino. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yohaannisi ubbatuwaakka, «Taani haatsaan s'ammak'ay; gidoppe attin taappe wolk'k'aamaynne taanikka Aa c'aammaa k'ashuwaa billana danddayennawe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aa c'aammaa k'ashuwaa billana danddayennawe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe k'oomaa woy danggaas'iratti oosuwaa.</char></note> biro yaanawaa; ikka Ayaanaa Geeshshaaninne tamaan s'ammak'anawaa; <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Aa kushiyan katsaa dalaappe shaakki geeshshiyaa layday de'ee. Katsaa uddumaan bukkowaa geeshshi punniide ayfiyaa diyiyaan k'olee; shin dalaa to'enna tamaan guuddee.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yohaannisikka hara c'ora k'aalaan c'ora asaa mak'k'iidde mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odeedda.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heroodise S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa K'achcheedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Galiilaa mooddiyaa Heroodisa k'ay bare ishaa Pilip'p'oosa machchatto Herodiyaado I akkeedda dirawunne haraakka c'ora iita kiitaa kiitetto diraw, Yohaannisi seereedda. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Hawaa diraw ha ubbaa gujjiide Heroodise Yohaannisa k'asho golle gelisseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mat. 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mar. 6:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yohaannisi Yesuusa S'ammak'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Asay ubbay s'ammak'etti simmowaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusi s'ammak'etteedda. I woossi de'ishshinkka saluu dooyetti aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanaykka harap'p'iyaa malatiide Aa bollaan wod'd'eedda. Saluwaappekka, «Ta dosiyaa na'ay neena; neenan Taani nashettay» yaagiyaa k'aalay yeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Dom. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:17">Mat. 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk'. 9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Yeletay Kase Guyye <optbreak/>Mayzzaappe De'iyaa Payduwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesuusi tamaarissuwaa doommoode aw hattamu laytsaa gideedda; c'ora asaykka barenttoo malatowaadan Aa Yooseefo na'aa yaagiino; Yooseefo Eele na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eele Maate na'aa; Maate Leewiyaa na'aa; Leewii Milkke na'aa; Milkke Yoona na'aa; Yooni Yooseefo na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yooseefo Maataatiyaa na'aa; Maataati Amoos'e na'aa; Amoos'e Naahoome na'aa; Naahoome Esiliime na'aa; Esiliime Naage na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naage Maa'aate na'aa; Maa'aate Maataatiyyu na'aa; Maataatiyyu Seemeye na'aa; Seemeyi Yooseefo na'aa; Yooseefo Yooda na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoodi Yoonaana na'aa; Yoonaani Reese na'aa; Reese Zerubaabeela na'aa; Zerubaabeeli Salaatiyaala na'aa; Salaatiyaale Neele na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neeli Milkke na'aa; Milkke Haadde na'aa; Haadde Yoosaase na'aa; Yoosaase K'oosaama na'aa; K'oosaami Elmaadoome na'aa; Elmaadoome Eere na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eere Yoosee'e na'aa; Yoosee'e, Eli'eezera na'aa; Eli'eezere, Yooraame na'aa; Yooraami Maas'aate na'aa; Maas'aate Leewiyaa na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Leewii Simoona na'aa; Simoone Yihudaa na'aa; Yihuday Yooseefo na'aa; Yooseefo Yoonaana na'aa; Yoonaani Eeliyaak'eema na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eeliyaak'eemi Meeliya na'aa; Meeliye Mayinaana na'aa; Mayinaani Maas'aate na'aa; Maas'aate Naataane na'aa; Naataane Daawite na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Daawite Issey na'aa; Issey Iyyoobeedda na'aa; Iyoobeedi Boo'eeza Na'aa; Boo'eezi Salmoona na'aa; Salmooni Nahishoona na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nahishooni Aminaadaaba na'aa; Aminaadaabi Raama na'aa; Raami Ariina na'aa; Ariinay Hezroona na'aa; Hezrooni Pereeza na'aa; Pereezi Yihudaa na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yihuday Yaak'ooba na'aa; Yaak'oobi Yisaak'a na'aa; Yisaak'i Abraahaamo na'aa; Abraahaamo Taara na'aa; Taari Naakoora na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Naakoori Seeroohe na'aa; Seeroohi Ragawa na'aa; Ragawi Pelega na'aa; Pelegi Abeera na'aa; Abeeri Saalla na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Saalli K'aynaana na'aa; K'aynaani Arfaakisiide na'aa; Arfaakisiide Seeme na'aa; Seemi Nohe na'aa; Nohe Laameehe na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Laameehi Maatusaala na'aa; Maatusaali Heenooke na'aa; Heenooki Yaareedda na'aa; Yaareed Malaali'eela na'aa; Malaali'eeli K'aynaana na'aa; <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>K'aynaani Heenoosa na'aa; Heenoosi Seete na'aa; Seeti Addaama na'aa; Addaami S'oossaa na'aa.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusaw Shiik'eedda S'alahiyaa Paac'iyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mar. 1:12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Ayyaanaan kumiide Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe simmeedda; Ayyaanaan mela sa'aa kaalesettiide beedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Hewaan oytamu gallassaa daabiloosan paac'etteedda. He gallassatuwaan ayaanne mibeenna diraw wurssetsaa poluwaa heeraan I koshatteedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Daabiloosikka, «Neeni S'oossaa Na'aa gidooppe ha shuchchaa, ‹Ukitsaa gida› gaade azaza» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesuusikka, « ‹Asay S'oossaa K'aalaa ubbaappe attin ukitsaa s'alalaan de'enna› geetetti S'oossaa K'aalaan s'aafetteedda» yaagi zaareedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Zar. 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Daabiloosikka d'ok'k'a gideedda deriyaa Yesuusa kessiide alamiyaa kawutetsaa ubbaa lip'o ayfii simmanaw besseedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Daabiloosikka, «Ha kawutetsaa maataynne bonchchuu ubbay taw imetteedda. Taani ta dosiyaa oossinne immana; newukka immana. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Hewaa gidiyaa diraw, ne ta sintsaan taw goyinnooppe ha ubbay neessa gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesuusikka zaariide, « ‹Godaa S'oossaw goyinna, Aa s'alalaa Godaya› geetetti S'oossaa K'aalaan s'aafetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9-11"/>Daabiloosikka Yesuusa Yerusaalame afiide Geeshsha Golliyaa huup'iyaa kessiide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:9-11">« ‹S'oossay neena naagana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:9-11">kiitanchchatuwaa kiittanawaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:9-11">unttunttukka ne gedii shuchchaan d'ubettenna mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:9-11">barenttu kushiyaan neena dentsanawantta› yaagettiide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:9-11">Geeshsha Mas'aafaan s'aafetteedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:9-11">ane Neeni S'oossaa Na'aa gidooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:9-11">hawaappe duge neena ola»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz. 91:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:9-11">yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:9-11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesuusikka zaariide, « ‹Ne Godaa S'oossaa paac'c'oppa› geetetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Daabiloosikka paac'iyaa ubbaa wurssowaappe guyye guutsa wodew Yesuusappe shaaketteedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Galiilaan Oosuwaa Doommeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mar. 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesuusikka Ayaanaa wolk'k'aan Galiilaa gadiyaa simmeedda. Aa waariikka yuushshuwaan de'iyaa ubbaa gakkeedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Yesuusikka Ayihudatuwaa Woosa Golliyaan tamaarissiide asaan ubbaan galatetteedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naazireeten Yesuusa Is's'eeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>I bare dic'c'o katamaa Naazireete yeedda; kase ootsiyaawaadankka sambbata gallassi Ayihudatuwaa woosa golle geliide nabbabanaw denddiide ek'k'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17-19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17-19"/>Nabiyaa Isiyaasan s'aafettiide s'aas'etteedda mas'aafaa aw immeeddino. He mas'aafaa billiide:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:17-19">«Taani hiyyesatoo mishiraachchuwaa odanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:17-19">oketteedda diraw Godaa Ayyaanay Ta bollan de'ee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:17-19">K'ashetteeddawanttoo biletsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:17-19">k'ook'atoo s'eelana mala odanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:17-19">k'aykka naak'etteeddawantta naak'uwaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:17-19">kessana mala dosetteedda Godaa laytsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:17-19">odana mala, Taana kiitteedda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:17-19">geetetti s'aafetteeddasaa demmeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:17-19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Mas'aafaakka s'aas'iide Ayihudatuwaa woosa golliyaan ootsiyaawoo immiide utteedda. Ayihudatuwaa woosa golliyaan de'iyaa Asay ubbay Aa c'addi s'eelleedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Yesuusikka, «Hachche hinttew nabbabettina hinttenttu siseedda k'aalay poletteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ubbay aw markkatteeddino. Aa doonaappe kesiyaa aad'd'o keekatetsaa k'aalaappe denddeeddawaan maalalettiidde, «Hawe Yooseefo na'aa gidennee?» geeddino.<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesuusikka sid'e banttaan ha leemisuwaan, «Hinttenttu taw ‹D'aliyaa Godaw, ne huup'iyaa patsa, neeni K'ifirinaahooman ootsina nu sisowaa ubbaa ha ne katamaankka k'ay ootsa› yaagiide odiita» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>K'aykka, «Tumuwaa yaagay, nabii bare yeletto gadiyaan gammakka bonchchettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>«Yewuwaan k'ay tumuwaa oday: Eelaasa wodiyaan heezzu laytsanne usuppun agenaa iray bukkennaan is's'ina sa'aa ubbaan wolk'k'aama koshay geleedda wode, Israa'eelen c'ora am"atuu de'iino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Kat. 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Eelaasikka Sidoonaa gadiyaan de'iyaa Seraafta heeraa itti am"attikko kiitetteeddappe attin ookkonne kiitettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Kat. 17:8-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Nabiyaa Elssaa'a wodiyaankka Israa'eeliyaan c'ora oolluwaa harggiyaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Oolluwaa harggiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossaa k'aalay tamaarissettiyaa wodiyaa ubbaan, «Oolluwaa» giyaa k'aalay galbbaa bollan sakkiyaa sakuwaa ubbaw akettiyaawaa.</char></note> oyk'etteeddawanttu de'iino; Sooriyaa biittaan de'iyaa Ni'imaaneppe attin unttunttuppe ooninne pas'i beenna» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Kat. 5:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ayihudatuwaa woosa golliyaan de'iyaawanttu ubbatuu hawaa sisiide darissiide hank'k'etteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Unttunttu denddiide Yesuusa katamaappe gas'aa kessiide duge olanaw katamay kees'etteedda deriyaa huup'iyaa afeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Shin Yesuusi unttunttu gidduwaanna aad'd'iide beedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iita Ayyaanay Oyk'k'eedda Bitaniyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">4:31-37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusi Galiilaa gadiyaan de'iyaa K'ifirinaahooma katamaa beedda. Sambbata gallassaankka asaa tamaarisseedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>I tamaarissiyaa timirttii maataan gidiyaa diraw siseedda Asay ubbay maalaletteeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat. 7:28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Ayihudatuwaa woosa golliyaan iita ayyaanay oyk'k'eedda bitanii de'ee; bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsi waassiide, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Hayya godo aggaarikkii Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa; nuw neenanna ay ittippetetsay de'ii? Nuuna bayizzanaw yaad? Neeni oonentto eraad; Neeni S'oossaa Aawuu kiitteedda geeshsha gidikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesuusikka, «C'o"u ga, aappekka kesa» yaagi seereedda. Iita ayyaanay bitaniyaa unttunttu gidduwaan kunddissiide ayinne k'ohennaan aappe keseedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Asay ubbay maalalettiide ittuu ittoo, «Hawe ayaa k'aalee? Barew de'iyaa maataaninne wolk'k'aan iita ayyaanatuwaa seeree; k'ay iita ayyaanaykka kesee» yaagiidde haasayeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Aa waariikka he yuushshuwaan de'iyaa gadiyaa ubbaa gakkeedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi C'ora Hargganchcha Asaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesuusi Ayihudatuwaa woosa golliyaappe denddiide Simoona golliyaa geleedda, Simoona bollotatta wolk'k'aama k'os'uwaa harggiyaan harggettaade giseeddawunniw Yesuusi izo patsanaadan Asay Aa woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>I matan ek'k'iide k'os'uwaa harggiyaa seerina, harggii yeddiisheedda; he wodiyaankka denddaade unttunttoo kiitettaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Away wullo wodiyaan dumma dumma harggiyaan oyk'k'etteedda harganchchatuwaa ubbaa aakko aheeddino; ikka ittuwaa ittuwaa bolla bare kushiyaa wotsiide patseedda. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Iita ayyaanatuukka, «Neeni Kiristtoosa S'oossaa Na'aa» yaagi waassiidde c'ora asaappe keseeddino. I Kiristtoosa gidowaa unttunttu ereedda diraw haasayenna mala diggeedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Galiilaan Tamaarisseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar. 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Sa'ay wontto wode Asay baynnasaa beedda; Asay ubbay Aa koyyiidde I de'iyaasaa yeeddino. Barenttuppe shaaketti beennaadan digganaw koyyeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>I k'ay, «Hini hara katamatoo baade S'oossaa Kawutetsaa mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa odanaw koshshee; taani kiitetteeddawe hawaa diraassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Galiilaan de'iyaa Ayihudatuwaa woosa gollen K'aalaa tamaarissiidde gam"eedda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Koyro Barena Kaalliyaawantta Dooreedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi Gensaarees'e Abbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gensaarees'e Abbaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galiilaa Abbaw imetteedda dumma suntsaa.</char></note> gas'aan ek'k'iide de'ishshin c'ora Asay aakko shiik'iide S'oossaa k'aalaa sisanaw sugetti de'iino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mat. 13:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mar. 3:9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>He wode laa"u wonggiratuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wonggiriyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wonggiriyaa geetettowe, wogga haatsaa woy abbaa bollaan Asay hefintsa bagga pinnanaw go"ettiyaa miishshaa. Hayk'k'o Asay moogettiyaawaa gidennawaa eranaw koshshee.</char></note> Abbaa gas'aan ek'k'owaa I be'eedda; moliyaa p'iriyaawanttu k'ay wonggiratuwaappe wod'd'iide barenttu dabbaa meec'c'i de'iino.<figure style="fig" alt="Fisher men in their fishing boat" file="hk00208b.tif" size="span" ref="5:2">Moliyaa p'iriyaawanttu barenttu wongiriyan</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesuusi wonggiratuwaa giddoppe Simoonawunno gideeddawunnin geliide sa'aappe yaa abbaakko guutsaa shiishshanaadan oochcheedda. Hewaappe guyye wonggiriyaa bollan uttiide asaa tamaarissuwaa doommeedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Tamaarissuwaa betsowaappe guyyiyaan Simoona, «Wonggiriyaa yaa abbaa c'iimmuwaakko shiishshite; hinttenttu dabbaakka moliyaa p'iranaw olite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoonikka, «Godaw, k'ammaa kummentsaa daaburi ak'iide ayinekka oyk'k'ibeykko; shin ha"i Neeni goowaadan dabbaa oleetto» yaagi zaareedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yoh. 21:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Hewaadankka ootseedda wode, daro c'ora moliyaa oyk'k'eeddino. Unttunttu dabbatuukka duus'erettanaw haneeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yoh. 21:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Hara wonggiriyaan de'iyaa laggetsatuu yiide maaddanaadan wutteeddino; unttunttu laa"u wonggiratuwaankka moliyaa kuntsina wonggiratuu mitettussaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simooni P'es'iroosikka hawaa be'eedda wode Yesuusa gulbbatan kunddiide, «Godaw, taani nagaranchcha asaa gido diraw taappe shaaketta» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Hawaa geeddawe inne aanana ittippe de'iyaawanttu ubbay barenttu oyk'k'eedda moliyaa c'oratetsaan maalaletteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Hewaadankka k'ay Simoona laggetsaa gideeddawanttu Zabddiyoosa naanatuu Yaak'oobinne Yohaannisi maalaletteeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yesuusikka Simoona, «Yayyoppa hawaappe guyyiyaan asaa p'iriyaawaa gidanaassa» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Unttunttukka wonggiratuwaa haatsaappe gas'aa kessiide, ubbabaa aggiide Yesuusa kaalleeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Oolluu Oyk'k'eedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesuusi katamatuwaappe ittuwaan de'ishshin oolluu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Oolluwaa: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:27">4:27</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'eellite.</char></note> bollaa ubbaa meedda bitanii de'iyaawe Yesuusa be'iide Aa sintsankka kunddiide, «Godaw, neeni koyyooppe taana patsanaw danddayaa» yaagiide woosseedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesuusikka bare kushiyaa yeddi bochchiide, «Dosay geeyya!» geedda. Heman"iyankka oolluu Aa yeddeedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Hawaa oossinne odoppa. Shin k'eesaakko baade neena bessa. Hewaappe guyye oolluwaa harggiyaappe pas'eeddawoo markka gidanaadan Muse higgiyan azazetteedda yarshshuwaa shiishsha» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Gido shin Aa waarii loytsi aakkiide beedda; daro c'ora asaykka Yesuusi odiyaawaa sisanawunne barenttu harggiyaappe pas'anaw shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Yesuusi c'ora wode geemasaa biide woossee.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bollay Sileedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 5:18-26">5:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:2-8">Mat. 9:2-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:3-12">Mar. 2:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi tamaarissiidde de'ishshin Galiilaappenne Yihudaa heeraa ubbaappe, Yerusaalame yeedda Parisaawatuunne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu utti de'ishshin hargganchchatuwaa patsana mala S'oossaa Aawuwaa wolk'k'ay aw imetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>He wode bollay sileedda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bollay sileedda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Giriike k'aalaan «Paralumoo'ay» geetettiyaawaa. Ha k'aalaa biletsay Inggilizeetsuwaan «Paraalayizid» guussaa. Ha laa"atuwaakka Dawurootsuwan biletsaa immoode, keechcheeddawaa woy k'aas's'enna mala daabureeddawaa guussaa.</char></note> itti bitaniyaa amareeda Asay shanchchamaan tookki ahi golle gelissiide Yesuusa sintsan wotsanaw koyyeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Asaa c'oratetsaappe denddeeddawaan Yesuusakko shiik'anaw danddayibeykkino. Hewaa diraw bollaw gi"i golliyaa kaaraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaaraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha payduwaan geetetteedda golliyaa kaaray Dawurowaa mala gidennaadan, Palasttiine gaden golliyaa bollan de'iyaa kaaray gede k'erettiide kees'ettee. Hewe yaatiide k'ay dufettiide gas'aan gas'aan hara mitsay tec'ettina loytsi kees'ettee. Hewaa mala kees'ay ooratsa k'aalaa c'aak'uwaa wodiyaan eretteeddawaa.</char></note> k'aariide Aa, shanchchamaanna asaa giddon Yesuusa sintsaan wotseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesuusikka unttunttu ammanuwaa be'iide, «Ha bitanew, ne nagaray atto geetetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu, «Hawe S'oossaa boriyaawe oonee? Itti S'oossaappe attin nagaraa atto gaanaw ooni danddayii?» yaagi k'ofaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesuusikka unttunttu k'ofaa ero diraw hawaadan geedda, «Ayaw hinttenttu wozanaan hawaadan k'oppiitee? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>‹Ne nagaray atto geetetteedda› gaanawaappenne ‹Denddaade ba› gaanawaappe hak'awe matee? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Yewuwaan k'ay hawaa taani geeddawe, Asaa Na'ay biittaa bollan nagaraa maaranaw maatay de'iyaawaa hinttenttu eranaadana.» Hewaappekka gunddeedda bitaniyaa, «Dendda ne shanchchamaa tookkaade ne golle ba gay» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Gunddaykka asaa sintsaan denddowaashshin bare shanchchamaa tookkiide S'oossaa galatiidde bare soy beedda. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ha wode ubbatuukka darii maalaletteeddino; S'oossaakka galatiidde, «Hachche malabaa be'eeddo» yaagiide yashshaan kumeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Leewiyaa Dooreedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">5:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusi kesiide beedda; Leewiyaa geetettiyaa k'aras'aa shiishshiyaawe, k'aras'aa shiishshiyaasan uttowaa be'iide, «Taana kaala» geedda. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Ikka denddiide ubbabaa aggiide Aa kaalleedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Hewaappe simmiide Leewii bare gollen daro shoobiyaa giigisseedda; c'ora k'aras'aa shiishshiyaawanttunne hara c'ora asaykka unttunttunna uttiide mi de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Parisaawatuunne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa, unttunttunna ootsiyaawanttu, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu bollan, «Ayaw k'aras'aa k'ans's'iyaawanttunnanne nagaranchchatuwaanna miiteennee ushiitee?» yaagiide zuuzummeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk'. 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesuusikka, «Hargganchcha asaappe attin pas'a asaw aakimiyaa koshshenna. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Taani yeeddawe, nagaranchchatuu barenttu nagaraa paas'iide simmanaadaanappe attin, s'illatuwaa s'eesanaw yabeykke» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi S'oomaabaa Ooshetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">5:33-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Hawaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusa, «Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttunne Parisaawatuwaa kaalliyaawanttu ubbaa wode s'oomiinonne woossiino; shin Neena kaalliyaawanttu k'ay ubbaa gallassi miinonne ushiino» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesuusikka, «Mishiray unttunttunna de'ishshin miyaatatuu s'oomanaw danddayiinoo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Yewuwaan k'ay mishiray unttunttuppe shaakettiide baana wodii yaanawaa; he wode s'oomanawantta» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Yesuusikka kaalliyaa leemisuwaa odeedda: «Ooratsa mayuwaappe peed'i akkiide ec'a mayuwaa bollan d'eppiyaawe baawa; gaasuukka hawaada ootsooppe ooratsa mayuwaa peed'ee; ooratsa d'efiikka ec'a mayuwaan giigenna. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Hawaadankka ec'eedda c'ilggiyaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">C'ilggiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawoo Dawurootsuwan imettiyaa gujja biletsay eessaa naa"iyaa ogoruwaa.</char></note> ooratsa woyniyaa eessaa wotsiyaawe baawa; wotsooppe k'ay ooratsa woyniyaa eessay c'ilggiyaa d'uussee; eessaykka gukkee; c'ilggaykka bayee. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Ooratsa woyniyaa eessaa, ooratsa c'ilggiyaan wotsanaw bessee. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Ec'a woyniyaa eessaa ushiide ooratsa koyyiyaawe ooninne baawa; gaasuukka ec'ay mal"ee giyaa diraw.»<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalliyaawanttu Sambbataan Tishaa Duutseeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Sambbata gallassi Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe itti goshshaa gidduwaanna aad'd'iyaa wode Aa kaalliyaawanttu zarggaappe tishaa duutsiide barenttu kushiyan shigechchiide muussaa doommeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Parisaawatuwaa giddoppe, «Sambbata gallassaan ootsanaw woga gidennawaa ayaw ootsiitee?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesuusi, «Kaatiyaa Daawitenne ittippe de'iyaawanttu koshatteedda wode ootseeddawaa nabbabi beykkitee? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Daawite S'oossaa golliyaa geliide k'eesatuwaappe attin hara Asay meennaadan digetteedda, S'oossaw yarshshetteedda k'umaa meedda. Ittippe de'iyaawanttukka I imminaade meeddino» yaagi zaareedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Wog. 24:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Hawaappe kaalliide Yesuusi, «Asaa na'ay sambbataw Godaa!» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Kushii Gunddeedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Hara sambbata gallassaan Yesuusi Ayihudatuwaa woossiyaa golliyaa geliide tamaarissi de'ee. Hewankka ushechcha kushii sileedda bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu Yesuusa mootiyaa gaasuwaa demmanaw I sambbataan asaa patsooppe be'ana giide naagi de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Ikka unttunttu k'ofaa eriide kushii sileedda bitaniyaa, «Dendda asaa gidduwaan ek'k'a» yaageedda. Bitaniikka denddi ek'k'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Hewaappe simmiide Yesuusi, «Haninttonne sambbata gallassaan lo"obaa ootsanaw bessiiyee iitabaa ootsanaw bessii? Shemppuwaa ashshanaw bessiiyee wod'anaw bessii?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Yesuusi bare yuushshuwaan de'iyaa asaa ubbaa s'eellowaappe guyyiyaan bitaniyaa, «Ne kushiyaa mic'c'a!» yaageedda. Ikka mic'c'iide pas'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Unttunttu loytsi hank'k'eettiide Yesuusa bolla ootsanawaa barenttu giddon mak'k'eteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Tammanne Laa"u Kiitetteeddawantta Dooreedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>He wodiyaan Yesuusi deriyaa bolla woossanaw keseedda; hewankka k'ammaa kumentsaa S'oossaakko woossiidde ak'eeda. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Sa'ay wonttowaan barena kaalliyaawantta s'eeseedda. Hewanttuppekka tammanne laa"atuwaa dooriide, «Kiitetteeddawantta»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kiitetteeddawantta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay tammanne laa"u Yesuusi kiitteedda hawaaratuwaa guussaa.</char></note> yaagiide suntseedda. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Unttunttu suntsaykka: P'es'iroosa giide I suntseedda Simoona, Aa ishaa Inddiraasa, Yaak'ooba, Yohaannisa, Pilip'p'oosanne Barttalamoosa, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Maatoossa, Toomaasa, Ilppiyoosa na'aa Yaak'ooba, bare gadew seelettiyaa Simoona, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yaak'ooba na'aa Yihudaanne Yesuusa aatsi immeedda ask'k'orootu Yihudaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ask'k'orootu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Ayihuda gadiyaan de'iyaa Ask'k'orootu geetettiyaa gadiyaappe yeennaan attena guussa. Ha suntsaa biletsay, «Worddanchchaa». K'aykka, «Hayk'oo aatsi immiyaawaa» guussaa.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi C'ora Asaa Tamaarisseeddanne Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesuusikka unttunttunna ittippe deriyaappe wod'd'iide dembbasaan ek'k'eedda. Aa kaalliyaawanttuppekka c'ora Asay hewaan de'ee. K'aykka Aappe sisanawunne barenttu harggiyaappe pas'anaw Yihudaa gadiyaappe, Yerusaalame katamaappe, abbaa matan de'iyaa S'iiroosappenne Sidonaappe yeedda c'ora Asay hewaan de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Ha asaykka Aa sisanawunne barenttu harggiyaappe pas'anaw yeeddino. Tuna ayyaanan oyk'ettiide metootiyaawanttukka pas'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Wolk'k'ay aappe kesiide ubbaa patsiyaa diraw Asay ubbay Aa bochchanaw koyyee.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anjjuwaabaanne Metuwaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Barena kaalliyaawantta s'eelliide yaageedda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Hinttenttu mank'k'atuu anjjetteeddawantta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa kawutetsay hinttenttuwaa.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Hinttenttu ha"i koshattiyaawanttu anjjetteeddawantta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">gidini kaallanita; hinttenttu ha"i yeekkiyaawanttu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">anjjetteeddawantta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">gidini miic'c'anita.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>«Asaa na'aa diraw hinttentta Asay is's'iyaa wodenne toochchiyaa wode, hinttenttu suntsaakka iitaan dentsiyaa wode, anjjetteeddita. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Saluwaan hinttenttu akkana woytay dara gidiyaa diraw he gallassi nashechchaan guppite; gaasuukka kase hinttenttu aawotuu nabatuwaa bollan hawaadan ootsiidde de'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Yewuwaan k'ay, dure asatoo hinttenttoo aayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">hinttenttu ishalo de'uwaan de'eeddita.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Hinttenttoo ha"i kalleeddawanttoo aayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">gidini koshattanita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">hinttenttoo ha"i miic'c'iyaawanttoo aayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">gidini kayyottanitanne yeekkanita.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Asay ubbay hinttenttu lo"otetsaabaa haasayiyaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">hinttenttoo aayye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">kase hinttenttu aawotuu worddo nabatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">hawaadan ootseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Morkkiyaa Siik'anaw Bessee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Shin Taani odiyaawaa sisiyaawanttoo yaagay: hinttenttu morkkatuwaa dosite; hinttena is's'iyaawanttoo, lo"uwaa ootsite; <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>hinttena shek'k'iyaawantta anjjite, hinttena naak'k'iyaawanttoo, woossite. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Itti bagga shayiyaa bak'k'iyaawoo, laa'entsuwaakka bessa; ooninne ne kootiyaa akkiyaawoo, ne shaamic'c'iyaakka diggoppa.<verse eid="LUK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>«New de'iyaawaa neena woossiyaawoo, imma; newaa akkeeddawaa, zaara gaade oochchoppa. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Asay hinttenttoo ootsana mala hinttenttu dosiyaawaadan, hinttenttukka haraw hawaadan ootsite.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>«Hinttentta dosiyaawantta s'alalaa dosooppe ay galatay de'ii? Hawaa gidooppe nagaranchchatuukka barena dosiyaawantta dosiino. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Hinttenttoo lo"obaa ootsiyaawanttu s'alalaw hinttenttu lo"obaa ootsooppe hewoo ay galatay de'ii? Nagaranchchatuukka hawaadan ootsiino. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Tal"iide hinttew zaaranaw danddayiyaawanttu s'alalaw tal"ooppe ay galatay de'ii? Bare tal"eeddawaa zaariide akkanaw nagaranchchatuukka barenttu garssan tal"ettiino. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Shin hinttenttu, hinttenttu morkkiyaa dosite; unttunttookka lo"obaa ootsite; hinttenttuppe tal"owaa zaariid akkanaw k'oppoppite. Hawaa hinttenttu polooppe hinttenttoo gatii daranawaa. K'ay hinttenttu Ubbaappe Bolla S'oossaa naanaa gidanita. I iitatoonne galatennawanttookka keeka. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Hinttenttu aabbu maariyaawaa gidowaadan hinttenttukka maariyaawantta gidite.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hara Asaa Pirddanaw Bessena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«O bollankka pirddoppite, hinttenttu bollankka pirddettenna; haraa bolla kunaaniyaa ootsoppite; hinttenttu bollankka kunaani oosettenna. Atto giite; S'oossay hinttenttoo atto gaana. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Immite; hinttenttoo imettana. Hinttenttu makkeedda makaan hinttenttoo makettana. Bak'k'i naak'k'ina siilli kumi palah laalettiyaa makaa hinttenttu kiwuwaan idintsana» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>K'aykka Yesuusi hawaappe kaalliyaa leemisuwaa odeedda; «K'ook'ay k'ook'aa kaaletsanaw danddayii? K'ook'ay k'ook'aa kaaletsooppe laa"atuukka oyk'ettiide ollaan kunddikkinoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat. 15:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Tamaariyaawe barena tamaarissiyaawaappe aad'd'enna; tamaariyaawe min tamaarooppe barena tamaarissowaa mala gidanaw danddayee.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>«Ne ayfiyaa giddon de'iyaa tuussaa kessennaan de'aadde hara ne laggiyaa ayfiyaa giddon de'iyaa suullaa ayaw s'eellay? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ne ayfiyaa garssan de'iyaa tuussaa be'ennaan hara asaakko shiik'aade, ‹Ta ishaw, ne ayfiyaa garssappe suullaa ta kessoo?› yaaganaw woota danddayay? Ha lo"uwaa malatiyaa iitaw, koyrottaade ne ayfiyaa giddon de'iyaa tuussaa kessa. Hewaappe guyyiyaan ne ishaa ayfiyaa giddon de'iyaa suullaa kessanaw geeshshaade s'eellanaw danddayaa.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mitsattonne Iza Ayfeedda Ayfiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Lo"o mitsay iita ayfiyaa ayfena; hewaadankka iita mitsay lo"o ayfiyaa ayfanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Mitsay ubbay bare ayfiyaa ayfiyaawaan erettee. Aguntsaappe woddentsaa ayfii mas'ettenna; hawaadankka, s'undduk'k'iyaappe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">S'undduk'k'iyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha mitsay gomi"oriyaa zariyaa gidiide Aa ayifii ayawunne maaddennawaa.</char></note> laadiyaa ayfiyaa mas'anaw danddayettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Lo"o Asay bare lo"o wozanaappe lo"o yewuwaa haasayee. K'ay iita Asay bare iita wozanaappe iita yewuwaa haasayee. Ayaw gooppe, Asay bare doonaan haasayiyaawe bare wozanaan kumeeddawaa doonay haasayiyaa diraassa.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laa"u K'ommo Golliyaa Kees's'iyaa Asaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Taani odowaa ootsikkita, shin ayaw Godaw, Godaw, yaagiide Taana s'eegiitee? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Taakko yiyaa ubbay ta k'aalaakka sisiide oosuwaan peeshshiyaawe oona malatintto ta hinttentta bessana; <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>ikka golliyaa kees's'iide daro ollaa bookkiide zaallaa bolla ginbbiide kees's'eedda asaa malatee; di'uu di"iide he golliyaa suginakka, mino zaallaa bolla kees'etto diraw k'aatsanaw danddaybbeenna. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>K'ay Ta k'aalaa sisiide oosuwaan peeshshenna uray baasuu banttasaa shafiyaa bollan golliyaa kees's'eeddawaa malatee. Di'uu di"iide he golliyaa sugo wode elekka kunddeedda; he golliikka iita wodaa woddiide bayeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi S'eetuwaa Kaappuwaa K'oomaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yoh. 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesuusikka hawaa ubbaa asaa sintsan haasay wurssowaappe guyyiyaan hini K'ifirinaahooma beedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Hewankka itti s'eetuwaa kaappuu de'ee. I daroppe dosiyaa Aa k'oomay harggiide hayyanaw mateedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Ikka Yesuusabaa siseedda wode, bare k'oomaa woossiide patsana mala Yihudaa c'imatuwaa hini aakko kiitteedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Unttunttukka Yesuusakko yiide, «Ha bitanii, Neeni Aa maaddanaadan daroppe koyyeedda; <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>gaasuukka nu asaa I daroppe dosiide Ayihudatuwaa woossiyaa golliyaa kees'issowekka Aa» yaagiide daroppe woosseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesuusikka unttunttunna ittippe beedda. Ikka hini golliyaa heeraa gakkeedda wode s'eetuwaa kaappuu bare laggetsatuwaa barekko s'eesiide, «Ta Godaw, daaburoppa; ayaw gooppe, neena ta golliyaa kaaraappe garssa baggana gelissanaw taw bessena. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Hawaa diraw ne sintsaan ek'k'anawukka haray atto bessiyaawaa gidikke. Shin neeni k'aalaa s'alalaa oda; ta k'oomaykka pas'anawaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Taani taappe bollanna maatay de'iyaawanttoo eeno gaade de'iyaa asaa. Taappe garssannakka taani kiitissiyaa wotaadaratuu de'iino. Ittuwaa, ‹Ba› yaagiyaa wode, bee; haraakka k'ay, ‹Haaya› gooppe yee. Ta k'oomaykka, hawaa ‹Ootsa› giyaa wode azazettee; ootsee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesuusikka hawaa sisiide Aa yewuwaan maalaletteedda; guyye simmiide Aa kaalliyaa daro asaa, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; taani hawaa mala ammanuwaa haray atto, Israa'eeliyaa garssankka be'abeykke» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Kase kiitetteedda asatuukka s'eetuwaa kaappuwaa golle guyye simmiyaa wode, Aa k'oomay pas'owaa be'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Am"atti Na'aa Hayk'uwaappe Dentseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Wonttisa gallassi Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunnanne c'ora asaana ittippe Nayno geetettiyaa katamato beeddino. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Yesuusi katamaa gakkana s'eetuwaa wode, Asay hayk'k'eedda anhaa tookkiide keseeddino. Hayk'k'owekka bare daayiw mes's'i itti na'aa; aatakka asinay baynna am"atto. Daro katamaa asaykka izo kaalleeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Yesuusikka izo be'eedda wode k'arettiide, «Yeekkoppa!» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Shiik'iide shanchchamaa bochcheedda; tookkowanttukka ek'k'eeddino. Yesuusi, «Neenoo yalagaw, dendda gay!» yaagina, <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>bitanii suuri utteedda. Haasayaakka doommeedda. Yesuusikka Aa, Aa daayiw immeedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Ubbaykka yashshaan kumiide, «Wolk'k'aama nabii nu garssan denddeedda; S'oossaykka bare asaa ashshanaw yeedda!» yaagiide S'oossaa galateeddino. <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Hewenneekka Yesuusa waarii Yihudaa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa gadiyaa ubbaan sisetteedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:1-19">Mat. 11:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttu hanowaa ubbaa aw odeeddino. Yohaannisikka barena kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"atuwaa s'eesiide, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>«Yaanawe neeneeyye? Woy nuuni haraa naaganee?» yaagi, unttunttu oochchana mala hini Yesuusakko kiitteedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Asatuukka Yesuusakko yiide, «S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi, yaana geetetteeddawe neeneeyye? Woy haraa naaganee? Yaagiide oochchana mala neekko kiitteedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>He wodiyaan Yesuusi c'ora asaa dumma dumma harggiyaappe patseedda; tuna ayyaanatuwaakka asaappe kesseedda; c'ora k'ook'atuwaa ayfiyaa dooyyeedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Yesuusikka Yohaannisi kiittowanttoo, «Biide hinttenttu be'eeddawaanne siseeddawaa Yohaannisaw odite; k'ook'atuu s'eellanawantta; gunddatuu hamettanawantta; oolluu oyk'k'owanttu geeyyanawantta; tulleeddawanttu sisanawantta; hayk'k'eeddawanttu denddanawantta; hiyyeesatookka mishiraachchuwaa k'aalay odettanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Taanan d'ubettenna Asay ubbay anjjetteeddawantta» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Yohaannisi kiitteeddawanttu bidiggowaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusi asaw Yohaannisabaa oduwaa doommeedda: «Ayaa be'anaw biittaa bazzuwaa keseedditee? C'arkkuu k'aatsiyaa uusuntsaa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Woy ayaa be'anaw keseedditee? Lo"o mayuwaa mayyeedda asaa de'uwaa? Lo"o mayuwaa mayyeeddawanttunne barena giigissiyaawanttu kaatiyaa gollen de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Woy ayaa be'anaw keseedditee? Nabiyaa be'anaw keseedditee? Ee; taani hinttenttoo yaagay; hinttenttu be'anaw kesowe nabiyaappekka aad'uwaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafan, ‹Ne ogiyaa neeppe sintsanna giigissiyaa kiitanchchaa neeppe sintsayaade kiittana› geetetti Yohaannisabay s'aafetteeddawe hawaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Mac'c'awanttuppe yeletteeddawanttu garssan s'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisappe aad'd'iyaa ooninne baawa. S'oossaa kawutetsaan k'ay ubbaappe laafa geetettiyaawekka aappe aad'd'anawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Haray atto shin k'aras'aa kessiyaawanttu attenaan hawaa Yesuusi haasayowaa siseedda ubbay Yohaannisa kushiyan s'ammak'ettowanttu S'oossaw bessiyaa bonchchuwaa immeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29, 30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat. 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk'. 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Shin higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu Yohaannisan s'ammak'ettibeenna diraw, S'oossay unttunttoo k'oppeeddawaa is's'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesuusi, «Simmi Taani ha wodiyaa asaa ayaanna leemisoo? Unttunttu ayaa malatiinoo? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Unttunttu geyaasan uttiide ittuu ittuwaa s'eesiide, ‹Suusulliyaa hinttenttoo punninakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">kaa'ibeykkita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">yeekuwaa yetsaa kesseeddoshshinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">yeekkibeykkita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">yaagettiyaa naanaa malatiino› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi k'umaa meennaan woyniyaa eessaakka ushennaan yiina, ‹Aa bollaan gaaleenay de'ee› yaageeddita. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Taani Asaa Na'ay maaddenne ushaadde yiina, ‹Hawe nafisaamaa; woyniyaa eessaakka ushiyaawaa; k'aras'iyaawanttoonne nagaranchchatoo dabbuwaa› yaagiita. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Gidoppe attin S'oossaa aad'd'o eratetsay bare oosuwaan tuma gidiide beetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisaawiyaa Simoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Parisaawatuwaappe ittuu barenanna k'umaa maana mala shoobbina, Yesuusi Aa soy biide maanaw utteedda. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>He katamaan nagaranchchaa geetetteedda itti mishiratta de'ewunna, Yesuusi Aa soyin utteeddawaa sisaade, albbass's'iroosa geetettiyaa shuchchaappe oosetteedda albbass's'iroosa baareeta kumeedda shittuwaa akkaa yaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Guyyenna Aa gediyaa mataan ek'k'aade, yeekkaadde Aa gediyaakka bare afotsaan okaa doommaaddu; izi afotsay bayizzeedda Aa gediyaakka bare huup'iyaa binnanaan k'uc'c'aaddenne Aa gediyaa yeraade gediyaan shittuwaakka c'ac'c'afaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat. 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Yesuusa bare soy s'eeseedda Parisaawiikka hawaa be'iide, «Hawe nabiyaa gideeddentto, hanna Aa bochchiyaa mishiratta oonenttonne k'aykka iza nagaranchchaa gidiyaawaa I erana shin» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesuusikka zaariide, «Simoona, taani new odiyaa yewuu de'ee» yaagina,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoonikka, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesuusi, «Itti bitaniyaappe miishshaa tal"eedda laa"u asatuu de'iino. Ittuwaa matan ichcheshu s'eetu diinaari, k'ay yekkuwaa matan ishatamuu de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Laa"atookka c'iggiyaawe d'ayina, laa"atuwaa ac'uwaakka maari aggeedda. Hawanttuppe hak'awe loytsi dosiyaawaa malatii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoonikka zaariide, «Daruwaa aggowaa malatee» yaageedda. Yesuusikka, «Tumuwaa zaaraadda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Yesuusi mishirattikko s'eelliide, Simoona hawaadan yaageedda; «Hanno mishiratto be'aaddii? Taani ne golle yiina haray atto shin haatsaakka ta gediyaw imma beykka; shin iza bare afotsaan ta gediyaa irs's'issaaddu; bare huup'iyaa binnanaankka k'uc'c'aaddu. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Neeni Taana yera beykka; shin iza taani geloodeppe doommaade ta gediyaa yeriyaawaa agga beykku. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Neeni ta huup'iyaan zayitiyaa okka beykka; shin iza ta gediyaan shittuwaa c'ac'c'afaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Hawaa diraw ta hinttenttoo oday: daroppe iza doseeddawaa diraw, daro nagaray iziw de'iyaawe maaretteedda; guutsay maarettiyaawe guutsaa dosee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Yesuusi mishiratto, «Ne nagaray k'uc'etteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Yesuusanna ittippe k'umaa maanaw utteeddawanttu barenttu wozanaan, «Nagaraa maaranaw danddayiyaawe hawe oonee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesuusi mishiratto, «Ne ammanuu neena ashsheeda, sarotetsaan ne golle ba» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalleedda Mac'c'awantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Yesuusi hawaappe simmiide, sabbakiiddinne S'oossaa kawutetsaa mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa katamaaninne heeraan odiidde aad'd'eedda. Tammanne laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttukka aanana ittippe de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Iita ayyaanaappenne wolk'k'aama harggiyaappe pas'eeddawanttu itti itti mac'c'awanttukka de'iino. Hewanttukka: Laappu s'alahii keseedda Magdala geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Mayraamonne, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Heroodisa golliyaan suntsaa gideedda Kuuza machchatti Yohaanno, Soosina geetettewunnanne hara c'oratuwaanna ittippe gidiide, Yesuusanne Aa kaalliyaawantta miishshaan maaddeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeretsaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>C'ora Asay daro katamatuwaappe shiik'iide, Yesuusakko yeedda wodiyaan leemisuwaan, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Zeriyaawe zeretsaa zeranaw keseedda. Zeriyaa wode itti itti zeretsay, ogiyaa doonaan wod'd'iide yed'etteedda. Yaatina saluwaa kafuu hewaa meedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Haray k'ay zaallaa bolla wod'd'iide doleedda wode koshshiyaa haatsaa demmenna diraw meleedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Hara zeretsay aguntsaa garssan wod'd'eedda. Aguntsay ittippe dic'c'iide mitteedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Haray lo"iyaa tu'e biittaan wod'd'eedda. Dolowaappe guyyiyaan, zerettowaappe s'eetu kushiyaa dakkuwaa mokkeedda» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesuusi Leemisuwaan Haasayeedda Gaasuwaa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 8:8">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar. 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesuusi hawaa haasayiidde, «Haytsay de'iyaa ubbay siso» yaagi k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide waasseedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu, «Ha leemisuu ayaa guussee?» yaagi Aa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Ikka zaariide,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa. 6:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:10">«Hinttenttoo S'oossaa kawutetsaa s'uuraa eray imetteedda; shin haratoo, s'eelliiddikka erenna mala, sisiiddikka akeekena mala leemisuwaan oday» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Zeretsaa Leemisuwaa Billiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar. 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Yesuusi, «Zeretsaa leemisuu hawaa: Zeretsay S'oossaa k'aalaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Ogiyaa gas'aan wod'd'eedda zeretsay, guutsa wodew k'aalaa sisiyaa asaa; ellekka s'alahii yiinne, unttunttu sisowaan ammani attena malanne k'aalay wozanaappe dogettana mala ootsee. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Zaallaa bollan wod'd'eedda zeretsay, koyro k'aalaa nashechchaan sisiyaawantta. Hewanttukka guutsa wodiyaa ammaninnee paac'ii gakkiyaa wodiyaan s'ap'uu bantta diraw ellekka ammanuwaa kaddiino. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Aguntsaa garssan wod'd'eedda zeretsay, k'aalaa sisiyaawantta; shin de'uwaa hirggaynne duretetsaa ishaluu c'uulleeddawantta. Hewanttu lo"o ayfiyaa immanaw danddaykkino. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Lo"o tu'e biittaan wod'eedda zeretsay bessiyaawe, lo"anne s'illo wozanaan k'aalaa sisiide naagiyaa asaanne he k'aalaan min ek'k'iide lo"o ayfiyaa ayfiyaawantta.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'omppiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«S'omppiyaa satsiide ittibaan k'um"i aggiyaawe woy arssaappe garssanna wotsiyaawe ooninne baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk'. 11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>K'onc'c'ennaan k'osuwaan attiyaabay itti yewuunne baawa. Erettennaaninne beettiyaasaa kesennaan attanabay ayinne baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk'. 12:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Hewaa gidiyaa diraw loytsi akeekaan sisite. Wozanaappe sisiyaawoo ubbaw gujji akeekay imettana; akeekenawaappe he aw de'iyaawaa malatiyaa akeekayikka aketanawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk'. 19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Daayonne Aa Ishatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>He wodiyaan aatanne ishatuu Yesuusanna gakettanaw aakko yeeddino; shin asaa c'oratetsaappe denddo gaasuwaan Aa demmanaw danddaybbeykkino. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Itti bitanii, «Ne daayanne ne ishatuu neenanna gakettanaw koyyo diraw karen yiide ek'k'eeddino» yaagi odeedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Ikka, «Ta daayanne ta ishatuu, S'oossaa k'aalaa sisiide oosuwaa bollan peeshshiyaawantta» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Beetaa C'o"u Ootseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe wonggiriyaa geliide, «Abbaappe hefintsa boytte» geedda. Unttunttukka denddiide hametaa doommeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Pinni de'iyaa wode, Yesuusi gem"isheedda. Abbaan gotuwaa c'arkkuu denddo diraw, wonggiriyaa garssan haatsay kumina daro metooteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Unttunttu Yesuusakko shiik'iide, «Godaw, Godaw! Nuuni bayoyttettee!» yaagiide Aa beegotseeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Ikka beegottiide gotuwaanne haatsaa beetaa seerina, gotuunne haatsaa beetay ek'k'eedda; ubbabaykka c'o"u geedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Ikka, «Hinttenttoo ammanuu hak'an de'ii?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Unttunttukka yayyi maalalettiide ittuu ittuwaa, «Hawaadan c'arkkuunne haatsay c'o"u giite giina azazettiyaawe hawe oonee?» yaagetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi S'alahii Oyk'k'eedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Galiilaa Abbaappe hefintsanna de'iyaa Gerggesenoona geetettiyaa gadiyaa, Yesuusinne Aa kaalliyaawanttu, wonggiriyaan pinniide gakkeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>He haatsaappe pinni sa'aa wod'd'o wode, iita ayyaanan oyk'etteedda itti bitanii, katamaappe kesiide aanana gaketteedda. Daro wodiyaappe doommiide mayuwaa mayyennaan kallo golliyaa aggiide duufuwaan de'ee.<verse eid="LUK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Yesuusa demmowaappe guyyiyaan, waassi Aa sintsaan guufanniide wolk'k'aama kooshshaan, «Wolk'k'aama S'oossaa na'aa Yesuusaa, tawunne new aybe ittippetetsay de'ii? Taana waayissoppaarikkii; ta neena woossay» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>I hewaa ayaw geeddee gooppe, bitaniyaa yeggi kesana mala Yesuusi Aa azazo diraassa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:29">Iita ayyaanay bitaniyaa oyk'k'oodeppe daro wode gido diraw, birataa santsalataan gediyaanne kushiyaa k'ashettiide naagettee. Santsalataa duutsi akkiide iita ayyaanay kaaletsina bazzuwaa bee.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesuusikka, «Ne suntsay oonee?» yaagi oochcheedda. Ikka c'ora iita ayyaanay geli utto diraw, «Leegiyoona»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Leegiyoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsay Giriike geetettiyaa k'aalaappe aketeedda. Suntsaa biletsay «C'ora» guussaa.</char></note> yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Barentta Yesuusi, «Hini c'iimmo ollaa biite» yaagenna mala woosseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Hewaan de'iyaa zooziyaa gas'aan hemettiyaa c'ora guduntsatuu de'iino. C'ora tuna ayyaanatuu, he guduntsatuwaa garssa, «Gelite» gaana mala Yesuusa woosseeddino. Ikka, «Biide gelite» geedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Iita ayyaanatuukka bitaniyaappe kesiide guduntsatuwaa garssa geleeddino. Guduntsaa wudiikka lank'k'iyaappe kajjottiidde ellekka abbaan mitetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Guduntsaa heemmiyaawanttu hanowaa ubbaa be'o wode harasaa biide, he katamaaninne yuushshuwaan hanowaa odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Ayee haneeddentto be'anaw kesiide, Asay Yesuusakko yeeddino. Iita ayyaanay keseedda bitanii, Aa wozanay simmina mayuwaa mayyiide Yesuusa gediyaa mataan uttowaa be'iide yayyeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Iita ayyaanan oyk'etteedda bitanii wooti pas'eeddentto be'eedda asay, hara asaw odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Gerggesenoona gadiyaaninne he heeraan de'iyaa Asay ubbay darii yayyeedda diraw, Yesuusi barenttu matappe baana mala woosseeddino. Ikka wonggiriyaan geliide beedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Iita ayyaanay keseedda bitaniikka Yesuusanna baana giide, Aa woosseedda; shin Yesuusi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Ne golle simmaade S'oossay new ootso wolk'k'aamabay ayentto markkatta» yaagi yeddeedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hayk'k'eedda Naattonne Sakettiyaa Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesuusi simmeedda wode Asay ubbay naagi de'iyaa diraw, Aa mokki akkeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>He wode, Ayihude asaa woosa gollew suntsaa gideedda Yaa'iroosa yaagettiyaa bitanii aakko yeedda. Ikka Yesuusa gediyaa sintsaan kunddiide, bare golle gelana mala woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Gaasotetsaykka tammanne laa"u laytsay kumeedda aw de'iyaa itti naatta hayk'k'anaw mata utto diraassa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesuusi biyaa wode c'ora Asay Aa yuushshuwaan sugettiidde metootseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>He asaa giddon he wodiyaan tammanne laa"u laytsaa ubbaa suutsay goggiyaa mishiratta de'aw. Bare de'iyaa shaluwaa ubbaa d'aliyaa eriyaawanttoo wurssinakka patsanaw danddayowe ooninne baawa.<verse eid="LUK 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Guyyenna yaade Aa mayuwaa mac'araa bochchaaddu; he man''iyaan iippe goggiyaa suutsay ek'k'i aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesuusi, «Oonee taana bochchowe?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Ubbay kaddina P'es'iroosi, «Godaw, Asay sugettiidde metootiyaa wode, ‹Oonee taana bochchowe› yaagay?» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Shin Yesuusi, «Itti Asay taana bochcheedda; wolk'k'aykka taappe kesowaa taani eray» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mishirattakka, Yesuusa iza bochchowe erettennaan attibeenawaa eraade, kokkoraadde yoonna Yesuusa sintsan kunddaa aggaaddu. Ayaa gaasuwaan Yesuusa bochchaaddentto iza pas'owaa ubbaa asaa sintsan odaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Ikka iziw, «Ha mishirattee! Ne ammanuu neena patseedda; saro ba» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesuusi haasay de'ishshin, Ayihuda asaa ammaniyaawanttu suntsaa soyippe itti bitanii yeeddawe, «Ne naatta hayyaaddu; simmi tamaarissiyaawaa metootsoppa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yesuusi hawaa sisiide, «Yaa'iroosaa, ammanappe attin, yayyoppa! Iza pas'anawunnu» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Soy geliide: P'es'iroosappe, Yaak'oobappe, Yohaannisappe, naatti aabbuppenne naatti daayippe attin, ooninne gelanaaddan eeno gibeenna. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ubbay he naattiw yeekkiiddenne kayyottiid de'iino. Shin Yesuusi, «Yeekkoppite, gisaadduppe attin hayyabeykku» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Iza hayk'k'eeddawaa eriide Aa bolla miic'c'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Gidoppe attin Yesuusi izi kushiyaa oyk'k'iide, «Ha naattee, beegotta!» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Izi shemppuukka simmina ellekka dendda ek'k'ina maanabaa immana mala, Yesuusi azazeedda. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Izi aabbunne izi daaya maalaletteeddino; shin Yesuusi unttuntta, hano yewuwaa oossinne odenna mala azazeedda.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Kaalliyaa Tammanne Laa"atuwaa Kiitteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesuusi tammanne laa"u Aa kaalliyaawantta ittippe barekko s'eesiide, s'alahiyaa ubbaa asaappe kessanawunne harggiyaawantta patsana mala wolk'k'aanne maataa immeedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>S'oossaa kawutetsaabaa odanawunne hargganchchatuwaa patsana mala unttuntta kiitteedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>I unttuntta kiittiidde, «Ogiyaa biidde, s'am"aa gidinakka, woy k'arc'c'iitiyaa, woy k'umaa, woy miishshaa gidinakka ayaanne oyk'k'oppite; laa'entsiyaa mayuwaakka oyk'k'oppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk'. 10:4-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Hinttena Asay hak'an mokkooppenne, hewaappe kesana gakkanaw, hinttenttu geleedda golliyaan gam"ite. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>He katamaa Asay hinttena mokkennaan is's'ooppe, hewaappe kesiidde, unttunttu hinttena mokkennaan is's'owoo markka gidana mala, hinttenttu gediyaappe baanaa shoc'i diggiide biite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu biide, k'eeri katamaa ubbaan mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odiiddenne hargganchchaa patsiidde yuuyyeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heroodise Ootseeddabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Ha"i Galiilaa biittaa kaatiyaa Heroodisekka haneedda yewuwaa sisiide yatti geedda. Gaasotetsaynnekka itti itti asay, «Yohaannisi hayk'uwaappe denddeedda» yaagee. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Hara asay, «Eelaasi kesiide beetteedda» yaagiyaa wode, haranttu k'ay, «Beni nabatuwaappe ittuu hayk'uwaappe denddeedda» yaagiino. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Heroodisekka, «Taani Yohaannisa k'ood'iyaa k'ans's'issa diggaaddishshin, hawaadan Asay haasayiyaa bitanii oonee?» yaagiide, Yesuusa be'anaw koyyeedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ichcheshu Sha"a Asaa Miziide Kalisseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Yesuusi kiittowanttu simmiide, unttunttu ootseeddawaa ubbabaa Yesuusaw odeeddino. Ikka unttuntta akkiide, Beetesayda yaagettiyaa katamaa matan de'iyaa takkasaa beedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Asay I de'iyaasaa eriide kaallina, unttuntta mokki akkiide S'oossaa kawutetsaabaa odeedda; harggiyaappe pas'anaw bessiyaawanttakka patseedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Sa'ay omarssiyaa wode, Yesuusa kaalliyaa tammanne laa"atuu aakko yiide, «Ha Asay ubbay nu yuushshuwaan de'iyaa heeraa giddonne k'eeri katamatuwaa giddo biide, ak'iyaasaanne k'umaa demmana mala moyzza; ayaw gooppe nuuni hawaan Asay baynnasaan de'eetto» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Shin Yesuusi unttuntta, «Asaw meetettiyaabaa hinttenttu immite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Unttunttu zaariide, «Ane biide, ha ubbaa asaw k'umaa shammenaan d'ayooppe nuw ichcheshu sooluwaappenne laa"u moliyaappe haray baawa; hewoo nuuni ha c'ora asaw k'umaa shammana mala koyyay?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(Gaasuukka, hewaan de'iyaa Asay ichcheshu sha"aa keena.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ichcheshu sha"a: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israa'eeliyaa wogaan mac'c'awenne k'eeri naanay paydettenna diraw, ichcheshu sha"aa guussay mac'c'awaanne k'eeri naanaa paydennaan kumeeddawaa. Ha payduu de'iyaa koyro maaray beni mas'aafaa ittuwaa ittuwaan baawa.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Ishatamu ishatamu asaa c'itan c'itan shaakki shaakki utissite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Unttunttukka I goowaadan ubbaa asaakka utisseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesuusikka ichcheshu soolluwanne laa"u moliyaa oyk'k'iide, pude saluwaa bonggotti s'eelliidde S'oossaa galateedda; duutsiide, asaw gishana mala Aa kaalliyaawanttoo immeedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Asay ubbaykka miide kalleeddino. Unttunttuppe atteedda dokkaa, tammanne laa"u samppaa kumeeddawaa dentseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Yesuusabaa Awaayeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi barekka woossiyaa wode, Aa kaalliyaawanttukka aanana ittippe de'ishshin, «Asay taana oona giinoo?» giide unttuntta oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Asay neena s'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa yaagee; hara Asay k'ay Eelaasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eelaasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha nabii I hayk'k'oodeppe daro wodeppe guyye, Yesuusi Kiristtoosi biittaa bollan tamaarissiidde deriyaa bolla woosaw kesiide laametti boos's'eeddawaappe guyye baggaan aanananne Musenna haasayeedda. Hewaa guussay hayk'k'i simmiide daro c'ora wodiyaappe guyye pas'a k'onc'c'eedda guussaa.</char></note> yaagee; haray k'ay beni nabatuwaappe ittuu denddeedda yaagee» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat. 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar. 6:14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk'. 9:7</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hintteshi, taana oona giitee?» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Yoh. 6:68</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">P'es'iroosikka zaariide, «Neeni S'oossay okkeedda Kiristtoosa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalliyaawanttu Hananaw Bessiyaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:38-39">Mat. 10:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24-26">16:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-38">Mar. 8:34-38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">Luk'. 14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesuusikka unttuntta, «Hawaa oossinne odoppite» yaagi minisi azaziidde, <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>«Taani, Asaa Na'ay, daro metuwaa akkanaw bessee; c'imatuwaan, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaaninne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttun is's'ettanaw koshshee; unttunttu taana wod'anawantta; taanikka heezzentso gallassi hayk'uwaappe denddanaw bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Yesuusikka asaa ubbaa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk'. 14:27</ref></char></note> «Taana kaallanaw dosiyaawe de'ooppe, bare huup'iyaa kaddo; bare mask'k'aliyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mask'k'aliyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, itti Asay bare laytsaa ubbaan S'oossaa kaalliidde shaakettennaan tookkanaw bessiyaa metuwaanne waayiyaa.</char></note> gallassaan gallassaan tookkiide taana kaallo. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Bare shemppuwaa ashshanaw dosiyaawe ubbay bayizzee; shin ta diraw bare shemppuwaa bayizziyaawe ubbay ashshee. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Itti uray ha alamiyaabaa ubbaa ashshiide bare shemppuwaa bayizzooppe woy barew pac'issooppe, ayaa maaddii? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Asay taananinne ta k'aalaan yeellatooppe, taani Asaa Na'ay, ta bonchchuwaannanne geeshsha kiitanchchatuwaa bonchchuwaanna yiyaa wode aan yeellatanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa yaagay; hawaan de'iyaa asaappe, S'oossaa kawutetsaa be'ana gakkanaw hayk'uwaa hayk'k'ennawanttu ittuu ittuu de'iino» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Malay Laametteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Yesuusi hawaa goowaappe guyyiyaan, itti saaminttaa keena gam"iide, P'es'iroosanne Yohaannisa, Yaak'oobakka akkiide, woossanaw deriyaa huup'iyaa keseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 P'es'. 1:17</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>I woossishin, Aa deemuwaa malay laametteedda; Aa mayuukka boos's'iide p'olk'k'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>K'oppennaan laa"u asatuu, Musenne Eelaas kesi beettiide, Yesuusanna haasay de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Unttunttu bonchchuwaan k'onc'c'i beettiide, Yesuusi S'oossaa k'ofaa polanaw Yerusaalamen hayk'k'anawaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hayk'k'anawaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriike mas'aafaa k'ofaan hawaa guussay, «Yesuusi saluwaa biyaawaa»; hawe k'ay I hayk'uwaappe denddiyaawaanne yaatiide saluwaa biyaawaa ubbaa shiishshi oyk'k'eedda k'ofaa.</char></note> aanana haasayeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>P'es'iroosanne aanana ittippe de'iyaawantta gem"ishuu geeroyeeddashshin, ellekka beegottiide Aa bonchchuwaanne aanana gatso ek'k'eedda laa"u asatuwaa be'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>He laa"u asatuu, Yesuusa miyyiyaappe shaakettiyaa wode, P'es'iroosi Yesuusa, «Godaw, hawaan de'iyaawe nuw lo"a gidiyaa diraw, heezzu daasiyaa ittuwaa new, ittuwaa Musew, ittuwaa Eelaasaw kees's'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>P'es'iroosi hewaa haasay de'ishshin, shaarii yiide unttuntta kammi aggina Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu yayyeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Shaariyaappekka, «Taani dooreedda ta Na'ay hawaa; I giyaawaa sisite» yaagiyaa k'aalay yeedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>K'aalay sisettowaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi bare s'alalaa gidiide beetteedda; unttunttukka yewuwaa barenttu wozanaan oyk'k'iide he wodiyaan ooninnekka ayaanne odibeenna.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Iita Ayyaanaan Oyk'etteedda <optbreak/>Laa"u Asatuwaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Wonttetsa gallassi, Yesuusinne heezzu Aa kaalliyaawanttu deriyaappe duge wod'd'iyaa wode, c'ora Asay Yesuusanna gaketteedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>He wode asaappe itti bitanii bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, taw de'iyaawe itti na'aa gido diraw, neeni Aa be'ana mala neena woossay; <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>k'ay iita ayyaanay wozanaa aatsenan denddiide Aa waasissee; doonaana paaroyana gakkanaw Aa kokkorssiide, ubbaa gallassi metootsiyaawaappe attin, Aa elle yeddenna. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Neena kaalliyaawanttu he iita ayaanaa kessana mala, taani unttuntta woossaad; shin danddaybbeykkino» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Ammanenna ha wodiyaa desha asaw, taani hinttenanna awude gakkanaw de'anee? K'ay hinttenttubaa awude gakkanaw danddayanee? Ne na'aa haa akkaaya» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Na'ay yiidde de'ishshin, iita ayyaanay Aa sa'aan oliide kokkorsseedda; Yesuusi iita ayaanaa agga gi na'aa patsiide Aa aabboo zaariide immeedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Asay ubbaykka S'oossaa wolk'k'aama wolk'k'aappe denddowaan maalaletteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Hayk'uwaabaa Laa'entsuwaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Taana Asaa Na'aa, Asay asaa kushiyaan aatsiide immanawaa; hinttenttu ha yewuwaa dogoppite» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Shin I giyaawaa unttunttu akeekibeykkino. Unttunttoo gelenna mala unttunttuppe geemmeedda diraw, ha yewuwaa Yesuusa oochchanaw yayyeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaawe Ooneeshsha? Yaagiyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu, «Nu giddoppe dariyaawe oonee?» yaagiide palumetteeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk'. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesuusi unttunttu wozanaa k'ofaa eriide, guutsa na'aa ahiide, bare matan essiide, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>«Ha guutsa na'aa ta suntsaan mokkiyaawe ooninne taana mokkeedda; k'ay taana mokkiyaa ubbay, taana kiitteedda ta aabba mokkee. Hinttenttu ubbaappe guus's'iyaawe ubbaappe dara» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hinttenttu Giyaawaa P'alk'k'enna <optbreak/>Uray Hinttenttu Bagga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar. 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohaannisikka zaariide, «Godaw, itti Asay ne suntsaan iita ayyaanatuwaa kessiyaawaa nuuni be'iide, nu bagga gidenna diraw, Aa diggeeddo» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Shin Yesuusi Aa, «Hinttenttu giyaawaa p'alk'k'ennawe hinttenttu bagga gidiyaa diraw, Aa diggoppite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sammaariyaa Katamaa Asatuu Yesuusa Mokkanaw Koyyibeykkino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Yesuusi saluwaa biyaa wodii matina, bare wozanaa k'ofaa Yerusaalamekko zaareedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Bareppe sintsaw ubbaa yewuwaa giigissana mala, kiitettiyaa asaa Sammaariyaa katamaa kiitteedda. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Shin I Yerusaalame baanaw denddeedda diraw, Asay Aa mokkibeykkino. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yaak'oobinne Yohaannisi hewaa be'iide, «Godaw, nuuni Eelaasi ootsowaadan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eelaas ootsowaadan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti itti Geeshsha Mas'aafaa biletsaan, «Ha asaa wurssanaw» yaagee.</char></note> tamay saluwaappe yiide unttuntta maanaadan s'eesana mala koyyay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Shin Yesuusi guyye simmiide, unttuntta seereedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Unttuntta seereedda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti itti Geeshsha Mas'aafaan de'iyaa biletsay, «Neeni ayi mala ayyaanentto, neena erikkii? Asaa Na'ay asaa shemppuwaa ashshanaw yeeddappe attin, bayizzanaw yibeenna» yaagee.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>«Taani, Asaa Na'ay, asaa shemppuwaa ashshanaw yoowaappe attin, bayizzanaw yabeykke» yaageedda. Unttunttu harasaan de'iyaa k'eeri katamaa beeddino.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalliyaawantta Gakkiyaa Paac'iyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Unttunttu ogiyaanna biishshin, itti bitanii Yesuusa, «Godaw, neeni biyaasaa ubbaa taani neena kaallana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Worakanatoo ollay, saluwaa kafatookka gollii de'ee; shin taani, Asaa Na'ay, gela shemppa akkiyaa sa'ay taw baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesuusi hara uraa, «Taana kaala» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Shin, bitanii, «Godaw, taani kasiyaan baade ta aabba moogana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesuusi, «Hayk'k'owantta barenttu hayk'k'owanttu moogino; neeni baade, S'oossaa kawutetsaabaa oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>K'ay hara bitanii, «Godaw, taani neena kaallana; shin koyruwaan ta soy asaa baade sarotana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Kat. 19:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Shin Yesuusi Aa, «Booraa goshanaw doommowe ooninne guyye s'eellooppe S'oossaa kawutetsaw bessena» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaw Kiitetteedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Hawaappe kaala Goday hara laappun tammu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Laappun tammu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti itti Geeshsha Mas'aafaa biletsaan, «Laappun tamanne laa"a». Ayihuda wogaan biittaa bollan de'iyaa asaa zeretsay laappun tamma. Shin kase Ec'a Giriike Mas'aafaa biletsaan de'iyaawe, «Laappun tammanne laa"a». Ooni eri Yesuusi bare k'aalaa alamiyaa yuushshuwaan gatsanaw ha payduwaanna k'ara asaa suntsiide kiittennan aggena yaagiyaa k'ofay de'ee.</char></note> asaa suntsiide laa"uwaa laa"uwaa ootsiide I baanaw de'iyaa katamaa ubbaa kiitteedda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Yesuusi unttuntta,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat. 9:37</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:2">«K'oychchaw gakkeedda katsay dara; kiitettiyaa Asay guutsa. Simmi k'oyc'ettiyaa katsaa Goday, k'oychchaw kiitettiyaawantta yeddana mala woossite. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Taani dorssatuwaadan wallatuwaa giddo hinttena kiittay, biite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat. 10:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Hinttenttu ogew ayaanne oyk'k'oppite: borssaa, k'arc'c'iitiyaa, c'aammaa, gidinakka oyk'k'oppite; asaana sarotettiidde ogiyaan wodiyaa wurssoppite.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Asaana sarotettiidde ogiyaan wodiyaa wurssoppite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He gallassaan garatetsaan ootsiyaa sarotay wodiyaa loytsi miyaa diraw, hawe haasayetteedda.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk'. 9:3-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>«Hinttenttu geliyaa golle ubbaa kasiyaan, ‹Sarotetsay ha gollew gido› yaagite. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>He golliyaan sarotetsaa dosiyaa Asay de'ooppe, hinttenttu sarotay he golliyaan ak'anawaa; koyyennawaa gidooppe, hinttenttu sarotay hinttenttoo simmanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>He golliyaan unttunttoo de'iyaawaappe miiddinne ushiidde de'ishshite; oosanchchaw Aa dirgguwaa c'iggay koshshee; itti golliyaappe hara golliyaa yuuyyoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 K'or. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 S'im. 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>«Ay katamaanne hinttenttu geliyaa wode, Asay hinttena mokki akkiide mizanaw shiishshowaa ayaanne miite. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>He katamatin de'iyaa hargganchchatuwaa patsiidde asaw, ‹S'oossaa Kawutetsay hinttekko mateedda›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaa Kawutetsay hinttekko mateedda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, «S'oossaa Kawutetsay hawaan woy hinttenttu giddon de'ee» guussaa.</char></note> yaagiide odite. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Yewuwaan k'ay ay katamaanne geloode, Asay hinttentta mokki akkenawantta gidooppe he katamaa k'ad'd'aakko kesinnee, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‹Nuuni hinttena yeellayanaw, haray atto nu gediyaa bollan de'iyaa hinttenttu katamaa baanaakka hinttenttoo k'ok'k'ofeetto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Baanaakka hinttenttoo k'ok'k'ofeetto: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, is'uwaa bessiyaawaa.</char></note>; yewuwaan k'ay, S'oossaa Kawutetsay hinttenttukko mateeddawaa erite› yaagite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Kit. 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Pirddaa gallassi ha katamattippe Sodoomaa katamaa gakkeedda muray kawushanawaa yaagaade taani hinttew oday.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Dom. 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">11:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ammanennaan Is's'eedda Katamatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Aayye new Koraaziine; aayye new Beetesayde; hinttenttun haneedda malaatatuu S'iiroosa katamaaninne Sidoonaa katamaan haneeddentto, hewaan de'iyaa asatuu kayyuwaa mayuwaa mayyiide, bidintsaa bollan uttiide, benippe barenttu nagaraappe simmanawanttashshin. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Hawaa diraw, murettiyaa gallassi hinttenttuppe aatsiide S'iiroosa katamawunne Sidoonaa katamaw muray kawushanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Hanne K'ifirinaahoome, neeni saluwaa pude d'ok'k'u gaanaw koyaad? Duge Si'ooliyaa wod'd'anaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa. 14:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>«Hinttenttu giyaawaa sisiyaa asay, taani giyaawaa sisee; hinttentta is's'iyaa uray taana is's'ee; taana is's'iyaa uray taana kiitteeddawaakka is's'ee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk'. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aa Kaalliyaawanttu Kiitetteeddasaappe Simmeeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Laappun tammu asatuukka, «Godaw, iita ayyaanatuukka ne suntsaan nuw azazetteeddino» yaagiidde nashechchaan simmeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesuusikka unttunttoo, «Sees'aanay walk'k'antsaadan saluwaappe wod'd'ishin be'aaddi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Simmi shooshshaanne sogguwaa yed'd'anaadan hinttenttu morkkiyaa s'alahiyaa wolk'k'aa s'oonana mala maataa immaaddi. Hinttentta k'ohanawe ayinneekka de'enna. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Gidoppe attin hinttenttu suntsay saluwaa maziggobiyaan s'aafetto diraw, nashettiteppe attin iita ayyaanatuu azazetto diraw nashettoppite» yaageedda. <figure style="fig" alt="Scorpion" file="bk00058b.tif" size="col" ref="10:19">Sogguwaa</figure><verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Nashechchaa K'onc'c'isseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:13-17">16:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>He wodiyaan Yesuusi Ayaanaa Geeshshaan daro nashettiide, «Saluwaanne sa'aa Godaw, neeni ha yewuwaa tamaarowanttuppenne aad'd'o eranchchatuwaappe gentsaade, k'eeri naanaw k'onc'c'isso diraw, neena galatay; Ee, ta Aabboo, ayaw gooppe, hawaa ootsanaw ne lo"o shene gideedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>«Ubbaa yewuu taw ta Aabbuppe imetteedda. Na'ay oonentto Aawuwaappe attishshin ooninne eriyaawe baawa; hewaadankka Aawuu oonentto Na'aappenne I k'onc'c'issanaw koyyo uraappe attin, haray ooninne eriyaawe baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Kaalliiddekka Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttukko simmi wod'd'iide, unttunttu s'alalaa, «Hinttenttu be'iyaawaa s'eelliyaa ayfatuu anjjetteeddawantta. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Ta hinttew odiyaawe ayee gooppe, c'ora nabatuunne kaatatuu hinttenttu be'iyaawaa be'anaw amotteeddinoshshin be'ibeykkino; hinttenttu sisiyaawaakka sisanaw amotteeddino; shin sisibeykkino» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asaw K'arettiyaa Sammaariyaa Bitaniyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Itti gallassi higgiyaa eriyaawe ittuu Yesuusa paac'c'anaw aakko yiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, med'inaa de'uwaa laattanaw, taani ayaa ootsoo?» yaagi oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Muse higgiyaa mas'aafan s'aafettowe ayee? Neeni ayaa gaade billay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Bitaniikka, «Muse higgiyaa mas'aafay, ‹S'oossaa ne Godaa polo ne wozanaappe, polo ne shemppuwaappe, polo ne wolk'k'aappenne polo ne k'ofaappe siik'a; hewaadankka ne laggetsaakka ne huup'iyaadan dosa› gee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wog. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Zar. 6:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Likke, tumuwaa gaadda; simmi neenikka hawaa ootsa; de'uwaan de'anaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa bitanii k'ay barena s'illo ootsanaw koyyiide Yesuusa, «Hanoshshin, ta laggetsay oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Itti bitanii Yerusaalameppe Iyyarkko biidde de'ishshin, ogiyaa bollan paannatuu Aa demmiide, Aa mayuwaa k'aarowaappe guyye shoc'iide, hayk'k'anaw pollu goode oliide beeddino. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>K'oppennaan itti k'eesay he ogiyaanna bide'iyaawe, shoc'ettiide kunddeedda bitaniyaa be'eedda wode, ayaanne ootsenaan miyyiyaanna aad'd'iide beedda. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Hewaadankka itti Leewii he ogiyaanna bide'ee. Ikka bitaniyaa be'iide, miyyeti aad'd'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Shin Sammaariyaa asaa gideedda itti bitanii, he baggana aad'd'iidde, ha bitaniyaakko yeedda. Aa be'eedda wode aw k'aretteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33, 34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Od. 28:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Aakkokka shiik'iide, zayitiyaanne woyniyaa eessaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zayitiyaanne woyniyaa eessaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooratsa C'aak'uwaa wodiyaan hawanttu d'alliyaawantta geetettiide akettiino. Ubbaa hawaan s'aafetteedda zayitii, ooratsa d'aliyaa malaataa geetettee. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak'. 5:14</ref></char> s'eellite.</note> Aa maytsaan tigiide, k'achcheedda. Hewaappe guyye bare hariyaa togissiide, imatsay ak'iyaa golliyaa akki beedda; hewaan bid'ayiidde naageedda. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Wonttetsa gallassi guutsa biraa bare kiisiyaappe kessiide, imatsay ak'iyaa golliyaa godaw immiide, ‹Ha bitaniyaa taw loytsa bid'ayaa; hawaappe daruwaa neeni kessooppekka, taani simmiyaa wode new c'iggana› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Simmi ha heezzu asatuwaappe, paannatuwaa kushiyan shoc'ettiide kunddeedda bitanew, lagge gideeddawe hak'awaa malatii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawekka, «He aw k'arettowaa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesuusikka Aa, «Simmi baade neenikka hewaadan ootsa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Marttinne Mayraami Soy Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna ogiyaa biidde, itti heeraa garssa gakkeedda. Hewaan Martto geetettiyaa itti mishiratta bare gollen mokkaaddu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38, 39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoh. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Iziwukka Mayraamo geetettiyaa michchata de'aw; hennakka Yesuusa gediyaa mataan uttaade, I odiyaawaa hayzzaadde de'aw. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Martta k'ay soybaa giigissaadde daabura de'aw; hewaa diraw Yesuusakko shiik'aade, «Hanna ta michchata, kiitaa ubbaa ta bolla olina, taani taarekka labbanoode s'eellaadde c'o"u gay? Hayyanaa taana maaddanaadan iziw oda» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Yesuusikka zaariide izo, «Marttee, Marttee, neeni c'ora yewuwaa k'oppaadde hirggaa; k'aykka metootaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Shin koshshiyaawe ittibaa; Mayraama bareppe ooninne akkena lo"obaa dooraaddu» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Woosaabaa Tamaarisseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi ittisaan woosaa woossi de'ee. Woosaa wurssowaappe guyye Aa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, «Godaw! Yohaannisi barena kaalliyaawantta woosaa tamaarissowaadan, nuunakka neeni waagi woossanentto tamaarissa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Ikka unttuntta, «S'oossaa woossiidde yaagi woossite:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">« ‹Saluwaan de'iyaa nu aabboo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne suntsay anjjetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne kawutetsay yo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne shenii saluwaan hanowaadan saankka hano;<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Gallassaan gallassaan koshshiyaa k'umaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">nuw hachche imma;<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Nuuni nuuna naak'k'eeddawanttuwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ubbaa atto goowaadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">neenikka nu naak'uwaa atto yaaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">nuuna iitaappe naagappe attin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">paac'iyaan gelissoppa›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 11:4">yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>K'aykka Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Hinttenttuppe ittoo siik'o laggii de'intto giddo bilahiyaan aakko yiide, ‹Ta siik'o laggew, taw heezzu sooluwaa tal"a; <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Ayaw gooppe, itti ta laggetsay yiina Aa miziyaawaa d'ayaad› yaagi woosseedda goytte. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Bare gollen de'iyaa Aa siik'o laggii soyippe haasayiidde, ‹Taana metootsoppa; penggii k'ashetteedda; tanaanaykka taananna giseeddino; hewaa diraw taani denddaade new ayinne immanaw danddaykke› gaanawee? <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Taani hinttenttoo odiyaawe ayee gooppe, I aw siik'o laggiyaa gido diraw, immennenttonneekka un"etso diraw I koyyiyaawaa ubbaa immee. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Hawaa diraw, ‹Woossite, hinttenttookka imettanawaa; koyyite, demmanita; kariyaa yiide s'eesite, hinttenttoo dooyettanawaa› yaagay. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Gaasuukka, woossiyaa ubbay akkanawaa; koyyiyaa uraykka demmanawaa; kariyaa yiide s'eesiyaa uraw, penggii dooyettanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>«Hinttenttu giddoppe bare na'aw, moliyaa woossina shooshshaa, k'umaa imma giina shuchchaa immiyaa aawuu de'ii? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Woy k'uuk'ulliyaa woossina sogguwaa immiyee? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Hinttenttu iita gidi de'iidde hinttenttu naanaw lo"obaa immiyaawaa erooppe, yaatina saluwaan de'iyaa hinttenttu aawuu barena woossiyaawanttoo Ayaanaa Geeshsha wooti darissiide immanddeeshsha?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Bi'eel-Zebuula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi itti bitaniyaappe duudissiyaa ayaanaa kessowaappe guyye duude bitanii haasayaa doommina, Asay maalaletteedda. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Shin unttunttuppe ittuu ittuu, «Gaaleenatuwaa kaappuwaa Bi'eel-Zebuuli aw wolk'k'aa immina gaaleenatuwaa kessee» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Ittuu ittuu k'ay Yesuusa paac'c'anaw saluwaappe malaataa bessanaadan aappe koyyeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Shin Yesuusikka unttunttu k'ofaa eriide unttuntta hawaa yaageedda: «Bare giddon shaakettiyaa kawutetsay ubbay d'ayanawaa; shaakettiyaa golliikka kunddee. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Yaatina Sees'aanaa kawutetsay bare giddon shaakettooppe Aa kawutetsay wooti ek'k'anawee? Hinttenttu taana, ‹S'alahiyaa kaappuwaa Bi'eel-Zebuuli new wolk'k'aa immina kessaa› yaagi haasayiita. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Simmi taani bi'eel-zebuula wolk'k'aan gaaleenatuwaa kessiyaawaa gidooppe hinttenttu naanay O wolk'k'aan kessanawanttee? Hawaa gidiyaa diraw, unttunttu hinttenttu bollan pirddiyaawantta gidanawantta. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Shin taani gaaleenatuwaa kessiyaawe S'oossaa wolk'k'aanna gidooppe, simmi S'oossaa kawutetsay hinttenttukko yeeddawaa erite.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Wolk'k'aama Asay bessiyaawaadan minniide bare golliyaa naagooppe, Aa shaluu loytsi naagettanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Yewuwaan k'ay aappe minuwaa dariyaawe yiide Aa k'ohooppenne s'oonooppe I ammanetteeda tooraanne gonddalliyaa aappe wotsi akkiide, aw de'iyaa miishshaa gishetti akkee.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>«Ta bagga gidennawe taananna ek'ettee; taananna shiishshi beennawekka laalee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuna Ayyaanay Kase Yeggi Beedda <optbreak/>Asaakko Simmiide Yiyaa Gaasuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat. 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Tuna ayyaanay asaappe keseedda wode, barew shemppiyaa sa'aa koyyiidde, haatsay banttasaanna aad'd'i bee. Shemppiyaa sa'aa demmennaan attooppe, ‹Taani kase yegga keseedda ta golliyaa simmana› yaagee; <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>simmiyaa wodekka gollii pitettiide giigowaa demmee. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Hewaappe kaala, biide haraa aappe iita laappu tuna ayyaanatuwaa akki yaa geliide, hewaan de'iino; he bitaniyaa de'uu koyrowaappe kaallawe iitowaa gidee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesuusi hawaa haasay de'ishshin, itti mishiratta c'ora asaa giddoppe bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsaade, «Neena yeleeddawunnanne d'antseedda ne daaya anjjetteeddawunno» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yesuusi k'ay, «Anjjetteeddawanttu S'oossaa k'aalaa sisiide azazettiyaawantta» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaappe Oosetto Malaataa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>C'ora Asay shiik'o wode Yesuusi, «Ha yeletay iita; ooratsa malaataa koyyee; shin nabiyaa Yoonaasa malaataappe haray imettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Gaasuukka Yoonaasi Nanawe katamaa asaw malaataa gidowaadan, Taani, Asaa Na'aykka, ha yeletaw malaataa gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yon. 3:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Away mokkiyaasaa s'eelliyaa wode, ushechcha duge bagganna de'iyaa gadiyaa kaatatta Solomonew de'iyaa aad'd'o eratetsaa sisanaw biittaa gas'aappe yeedda diraw, pirddaa wode ha yeletaan denddaade pirddanawunnu; be'ite, Solomoneppekka aad'd'iyaawe hawaan de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Kat. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Od. 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Nanawe Asay pirddaa wode hinttenttu bolla denddiide pirddanawantta; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu Yoonaasi odowaa sisiide barenttu nagaraa paas'i simmeedda diraassa; be'ite, Yoonaasappe aad'd'iyaawe hawaan de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bollaa Poo'issiyaa S'omppiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Soy geliyaa asaw poo'anaadan, S'omppiyaa s'omppiide d'ok'k'asaan wotsanaappe attin, geemasaan woy poo'uwaa kammiyaa yewuwaappe garssanna wotsiyaawe ooninne baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar. 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk'. 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Ne asatetsaw ne ayfii s'omppiyaa mala; ne ayfii pas'a gidooppe ne kumentsaa asatetsaykka poo'uwaa demmee; shin ne ayfii harggooppe ne kumentsaa asatetsaykka d'umaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Akeeka; hewaa gidiyaa diraw, ne garssan de'iyaa poo'uu d'umennaadan naagetta. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Simmi ne asatetsay ubbay poo'uwaan kumeeddawaa gidooppenne, d'umeedda asatetsay neenan baynnawaa gidooppe, ne asatetsay ubbay, s'omppii bare poo'uwaa ne bollan poo'issiyaawaadan, ne bollan wagagga poo'uwaa gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Parisaawatuwaanne Muse Higgiyaa Tamaarissiyaawantta Kunaaneedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk'. 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesuusi haasayaa wurssowaappe kaala, itti Parisaawe bitanii bare gollen k'umaa maanaadan ataalleedda; Yesuusikka ittippe geliide gaytaan utteedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:37</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Gaytaan utteedda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K'umaa maanaw utteedda guussa.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Parisaawiikka Yesuusa k'umaa maanaappe kasiyaan kushiyaa meec'etti beennawaa be'iide maalalettina, <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Godaykka, «Hinttenttoo Parisaawatoo, s'uu'aanne shaataa bolla bagga geeshshiita; shin hinttenttu garssay uuziyaaninne iitatetsaan kumeedda. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Hinttenttoo eeyatoo! Bolla bagga med'd'eeddawe garssaa med'd'ibeennee? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Shin hinttenttu s'uu'aaninne shaataa garssan de'iyaawaa hiyyeesatoo immite; he wode ubbabaykka hinttew geeshsha gidanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Shin hinttenttoo Parisaawatoo, hinttew aayye! Ayaw gooppe, anuugaappenne s'alotiyaappe, aguppiyaa do'uwaappe, tammu kushiyaappe itti kushiyaa S'oossaw immiita; shin tumu pirddaanne S'oossaa siik'iyaawaa hinttenttu aggiita. Yewuwaan k'ay hewaa aggenaan hawaa ootsanaw bessee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Wog. 27:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Hinttenttoo Parisaawatoo, hinttew aayye! Ayaw gooppe, Ayihuda asaa woosa gollen bonchcho utuwaa, geyaa giddonkka bonchcho sarotaa koyyiita.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>«Asay erennaan bollanna hamettiyaa beettena duufuwaa malatiyaa diraw hinttew aayye!» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttuppe ittuu, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, neeni hawaa yaaga haasayo diraw nuuna boraadda» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesuusi, «Hinttenoo higgiyaa eriyaawanttoo, henttew aayye! Ayaw gooppe, Asay tookkiide danddayenna dees'o tookuwaa haraa toossiita; shin hinttenttu hintte huup'ew birad'd'iyankka bochchikkita.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>«Hinttenttu aawotuu wod'eedda nabatuwaa duufuwaa loytsiyaa diraw hinttew aayye! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Simmi hinttenttu aawotuu nabatuwaa wod'ina, hinttenttu unttunttu duufuwaa bollan golliyaa kees's'iyaa diraw, Nabatuwaa oosuu lo"a yaagiide, unttunttuwaa markkattiita. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Hawaa diraw, S'oossaa aad'd'o eratetsay, Taani nabatuwaanne Yesuusi kiittowantta unttunttukko kiittana; unttunttukka hewanttuppe ittuwaa ittuwaa wod'anawantta; ittuwaa ittuwaa metootsanawantta yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Hawaa gidiyaa diraw, ha alamii med'ettoodeppe doommiide gukkeedda nabatuwaa suutsaw ha yeletay ooshettee. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Aabeelappe doommiide yarshshuwaasaappenne geeshsha golliyaappe gidduwaan gukkeedda Zakkaraasa suutsaa gakkanaw koyettee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihudatuwaa Mas'aafatuwaa garssan doometsaa mas'aafay koyro mas'aafaa. Ikka, Aabeeli asaa ubbaappe koyruwaan ishay Aa wod'eeddawaa odee. Ayihudatuwaa Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwaan wurssetsaa mas'aafay Laa'entsiyaa Oduwaa Mas'aafaa. He mas'aafaan Zakkaraasi wurssetsaan hayk'k'eeddawaa odiyaa diraassa Luuk'aasi Aabeelappe Zakkaraasa gakkanaw geeddawe.</char></note> Ee! Taani gay; ha yeletay hawoo ooshettiyaawaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Hinttenttoo Muse higgiyaa eriyaawanttoo, hinttew aayye! Ayaw gooppe eraa penggiyaa dooyyiyaa k'ulppiyaa akkeeddita. Hinttenttu hintte huup'ewukka gelibeykkita; k'ay gelanaw koyyiyaawanttakka diggeeddita» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesuusi hewaappe kesowaappe guyyiyaan, higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu Aa ooshaan urgguntsusaanne ek'ettussaa doommeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Aa doonaappe lo"ennabay kesooppe oyk'k'anaw geeddiino; shin demmibeykkino.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Lo"a Malatiyaa Iitatetsaappe Naagettana Mala Seeraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>He wodiyaan c'ora sha"aan paydettiyaa Asay ittuu ittuwaa yed'd'ana gakkanaw shiik'i de'ishshin, Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo koyro odanaw doommiidde, «Parisaawatuwaa irshshuwaappe naagettite; hawekka lo"a malatiyaa unttunttu immiyaa iita timirttiyaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar. 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Shin ayaaninne kameteedda yewuu k'onc'c'iyaa kesennaan attena; k'aykka geemmeedda yewuu erettennaan attena. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Hewaa diraw hintte d'umaan haasayowe ubbay, gallassi poo'uwaan sisettanawaa; hinttenttu Asay baynnasaan hini giso golliyaan haytsaan saasukkowe ubbay d'ok'k'u geedda sisettiyaa k'onc'c'esaan awaayetanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itti S'oossaa S'alalaw Yayana Bessee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Taanaadan ammaniyaawanttoo, taani hinttew yaagay; ha"i ashuwaa wod'iyaawantta, hewaappe kaala k'ay ayaanne ootsanaw danddayennawantta yayyoppite. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Yewuwaan k'ay hinttenttu oossi yayyanaw bessintto taani hinttentta erissana; hewekka wod'owaappe guyyiyaan gaannamiyan olanaw maatay de'iyaa S'oossaa s'alalaw yayyite; Ee, aw yayyite yaagay.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«Ichcheshu suunniyaa kafatuu santtimiyaan shamettikkinooyye? Hewanttuppe ittinnonne usa S'oossay dogenna. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Shin haray atto hinttenttu huup'iyaan de'iyaa binnaanay ubbaykka paydetteeddawaa; hawaa diraw yayyoppite; hinttenttu c'ora suunniyaa kafatuwaappe dariita.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusan Ammaniyaawanttanne Aa Is's'iyaawantta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat. 10:32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10:19</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Taani hinttew oday; tabaa asaa sintsan markkattiyaawoo oossinne Taanikka Asaa Na'ay, k'ay S'oossaa kiitanchchatuwaa sintsan markkattana; <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>shin asaa sintsan taana kaddiyaawantta taanikka asaa na'ay, k'ay S'oossaa kiitanchchatuwaa sintsan kaddana.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>«Ta bolla, asaa na'aa bolla, boriyaa k'aalaa haasayiyaawe de'ooppe Aa naak'uu atto geetettana; shin Geeshsha Ayaanaa bolla boriyaa k'aalaa haasayiyaawe de'ooppe k'ay Aa naak'uu atto geetettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar. 3:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Asay hinttentta Ayihude woossiyaa golliyaakko, gadiyaa ayissiyaawanttukkonne maatay de'iyaawanttu sintsa pirddaw shiishshiyaa wode, ‹Waagi zaaraneeshsha? Woy ayaa giide haasayaneeshsha?› yaagiide hirggoppite; <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>ayaw gooppe, hinttena Ayaanaa Geeshshay hinttenttu he saatiyaan haasayanaw bessiyaabaa tamaarissanawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mat. 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar. 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Luk'. 21:14-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dure Bitaniyaa Boozatetsaa Odiyaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Asaa garssappe itti bitanii Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, nu aabbu hayk'k'ina nuuni laattana mala atteeddabaa, taw gishana mala hayya godo ta ishaw oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesuusi k'ay, «Ha bitanew, hinttenttu bollan pirddiyaawaa gidanaadanne hewaa hinttew gishanaadan taana oonee suntseeddawe?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Gujjiidekka ubbatuwaa, «Asaa shemppoo shaluwaa duretetsay de'uwaa immenna diraw, yaaretiyaawaappenne yorattiyaawaappe naagettite; duretetsaa amuwaa ubbaappekka hinttena naagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kaalliiddekka hawaadan yaagi leemisuwaa unttunttoo odeedda: «Aw de'iyaa biittay darissiide katsaa mokkeedda itti dure bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Ha bitanii, ‹Taw ta katsaa wotsanaw gidiyaa sa'ay banttawaa diraw ayaa ootsooshsha?› yaagiide, bare wozanaan k'oppeedda; <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>hawaadan yaagi maleedda; ‹Taani wootane gooppe, taw de'iyaa yeesiyaa kolaade, hara aakkiyaa yeesiyaa med'd'ana yaagiide maleedda; hewaan ta katsaanne taw de'iyaa miishshaa ubbaa wotsana. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Yaataade taana, «Ne kaac'ay daro lo"a; new daro wodiyaw gidiyaa mas'uwaa shiishshaadda; simmi shemppaade ma, usha, nashetta» gaana› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>«Shin S'oossay Aa, ‹Ha boozaw, hachche k'amma neeni hayk'k'a. Yaatina ha neeni shiishsheedda mas'uu ubbay oossi gidanawee?› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«Barew biittaa bollan shaluwaa shiishshiyaawe, S'oossaa sintsan k'ay mank'k'o gideedda Asay ha bitaniyaa mala» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaa Wode S'oossaan Ammanettussaa Koshshee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Hawaappe kaala Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Hawaa diraw, ta hinttew oday: hinttenttu pas'a de'anaw ayaa maanee? Hinttenttu bollaw ayaa mayyanee? yaagiide hirggoppite.<verse eid="LUK 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>«Gaasuukka, shemppuu k'umaappe, k'ay asatetsay mayuwaappe aad'd'ennee? <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Ane k'uuratuwaa s'eellite; unttunttu zerikkino; c'akkikkino; unttunttoo katsaa shiishshiyaa sa'ay woy yeesii baawa; hanoppe attin, unttuntta S'oossay mizee; hinttenttu kafatuwaappe daroppe darikkitee? <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Hinttenttuppe darii k'oppiide daro wodiyaa de'anaw danddayiyaawe oonee?<verse eid="LUK 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>«Simmi hinttenttu ha laafabaa ootsanaw danddayennawantta gidooppe ayaw harabaw hirggettiitee? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>C'iishshatuu wooti dic'c'iinontto ane s'eellite; unttunttu kiitaan daaburikkino; puuttuwaa suk'k'ikkino; gido shin taani hinttew odiyaawe, Solomone hewaa keena bonchchetteeddawaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Solomone hewaa keena bonchchetteeddawaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihuda Asay Solomone bare de'eedda laytsaa ubbaan daro duretetsaan de'eedda giide k'oppiino.</char></note> gidiide, he c'iishshatuwaappe ittuwaa malaanne mayyibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Kat. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Od. 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Hinttenttoo laafa ammanuu de'iyaawanttoo, yaatooppe S'oossay hachche beettiide, wontti tamaan ees's'anaw olettiyaa, denbbaan doliyaa maataa hawaadan mayzziyaawaa gidooppe, hinttentta wootiide unttunttuppe aatsiide mayzzennee?<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>«Hawaa diraw, ‹Ayaa maanee? Ayaa ushanee?› yaagiide ubbaa wode koyyoppitenne hirggoppite. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ayaw gooppe, hawaa demmanaw ha alamiyaan de'iyaa S'oossaan ammanettena Asay hirggettiino. Hinttenttoo hawe ubbay koshshiyaawaa saluwaan de'iyaa hinttenttu aawuu eree. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Hewaa haniyaawaa aggiide, S'oossaa kawutetsaa koyyite; I hinttentta koshshiyaawaa ubbaa immanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sa'aan Bare Duretetsaan <optbreak/>Ammanettowe Saluwaan Waanii?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Hinttenttu guutsa gidinttonne, saluwaa hinttenttu aawuu bare kawutetsaa hinttenttoo immanaw nashetteedda diraw yayyoppite.<verse eid="LUK 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>«Hinttew de'iyaawaa zal"iide mank'k'oo immite; kayisuu shiik'ennasaan, bil"aykka meennasaan, saluwaan wurenna miishshaa dagayiidde, ec'enna k'arc'c'itatuwaa hinttenttu huup'ew wotsite. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Ayaw gooppe, hinttenttu wozanay hintte miishshay de'iyaa saan de'anawaa.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mino Oosanchchaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Hintte s'eessay danc'c'ettowaa, hintte s'omppiikka poo'eeddawaa gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat. 25:1-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Hinttenttukka, barenttu Goday yiide penggiyaa k'os's'iyaa wode, ellekka dooyyanaw bullachchaappe simmana gakkanaw naagiyaa oosanchchatuwaa malatite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar. 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Barenttu Goday soy yeedda wode beegotti de'ishshin demmiyaa he oosanchchatuu anjjetteeddawantta. Taani tumuwaa gay; I unttuntta, ‹Uttite› giide, bare danc'c'uwaa minisiide unttunttoo k'umaa aatsiide shoobbanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Goday hekka bilahiyaan woy hekka bilahiyaappe kaala yeedda wode, beegottiide genc'c'i naagiidde beettiyaa k'oomatuu anjjetteeddawantta. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Hawaa k'ay erite; kayisuu ay saatiyaan yintto golliyaawuu erintto, gollii bookettiyaa wode c'o"u giide s'eellennashshin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39, 40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Asaa na'ay k'oppenna saatiyaan yaanawaa; hinttenttu giigetti naagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>P'es'iroosikka «Godaw, ha leemisuwaa neeni odiyaawe nu s'alalaassee haraa ubbawukka ittippe oday?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Godaykka, «Simmi unttunttu bare soy asaw k'umaa immanaw bessiyaa saatiyaan immana mala, Aa goday suntsiyaa ammanetteedanne eranchcha miziyaa k'oomay oonee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Goday simmiyaa wode hawaadan kiitettiina demmiyaa k'oomay I anjjetteeddawaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Taani hinttew tumuwaa oday; de'iyaa mas'uwaa ubbaa bollan Aa suntsanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Yewuwaan k'ay he k'oomay, «Ta goday elle yeenna; gam"anawaa» yaagi bare wozanaan k'oppooppenne attumanne mac'c'a k'oomatuwaa shochchaa doommooppe, k'aykka koyyowaadan muussaanne ushshaa, matsottussaakka doommooppe, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>he k'oomaa goday, I k'oppenna gallassinne sid'ibeenna saatiyaan yaanawaa; he wodiyaan Aa k'ans's'ereetsiide, Aa gishuwaa kaac'aakka ammanennawanttunna ittisaa udanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Bare godaa sheniyaa eriide giigennawenne Aa sheniyaadan kiitettenna k'oomay, I iita d'oobaa d'oobettanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Eribeennawe k'ay d'oobettanaw bessiyaawaa ootseeddawe, guutsaa d'oobettee. Darobay imetteedda asaa ubbaappe, aappe darobay koyettee; wolk'k'aama hadaray imettowaappe, aappe darissiide koyettee.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Yesuusi, «Taani yeeddawe, ha sa'aa bolla tamaa satsanaassa; ha"ikka ees's'eeddentto, taana ay keena nashechchanaweeshsha. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Taani s'ammak'ettana metuwaa s'ink'k'atay polettana gakkanaw waanaade un"ettaytaa!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar. 10:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Ha sa'aa taani yeeddawe, sarotetsaa ahanaassa malatiiyee? Hinttew malatoppo. Taani yoowe, sarotaw gidennaan shaakkanaassappe attin. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Ayaw gooppe, ha"ippe doommina itti golliyaan de'iyaa ichcheshu asatuu shaakettanawantta; heezzatuu laa"atuwaa bolla, laa"atuukka heezzatuwaa bolla denddiide walak'ettanawantta. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Aawuu na'aa bolla, na'aykka aawuwaa bolla, aata naatti bolla, naattakka aatti bolla, bollotatta na'aa machchi bolla, na'aa machchakka bollotatti bolla, walassaan denddiide shaakettanawantta» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wodiyaa Hanotaa Eruwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>K'aykka Yesuusi asaw, «Away wulliyaa baggana hintte shaariyaa be'ooppe, ‹Ha"i ha saatiyaan hekko wolk'k'aama iray bukkana hanee› yaagiita; tumukka k'ay bukkee. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Duge baggana c'arkkuu c'arkkoode, ‹Hachche shammanawaa› yaagiita; geetettowaadankka k'ay hanee. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Hinttenoo lo"a malatiyaa iitatoo, sa'aanne saluwaa s'eelliide, hananawaa eriita; shin ha wodiyaabaa wooti eranaw danddaykkitee?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sigatetsaabaanne Mootuwaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Wode hinttenttu s'illo gideedda yewuwaa hinttenttoo ayaw pirddikkitee? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ne morkkiyaanna ittippe pirddiyaa daannaa sintsan shiik'anaw boode, biro ogiyaa bolla de'ishshin sigetta digga. Hewe d'ayooppe neena goochchiide pirddiyaa daannaakko afana; daannaykka polisew aatsi immanawaa; polisii k'asho gollen yegganawaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Taani new odiyaawe, wurssetsaa ac'uwaa c'iggana gakkanaw hewaappe kesakka» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nagaraappe Simmenna Ubbay D'ayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>He wodiyaan itti itti asatuu Yesuusakko yiide P'ilaas'oosi Galiilaa asaa wod'iide unttunttu suutsaa yaarshshuwaanna ittippe walakkeeddawaa aw odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesuusikka zaariide, «Hawanttu Galiilaa asatuu hayk'k'eedda diraw, yaatina unttunttoo hara Galiilaa asaa ubbaappekka aad'd'iide nagaranchchatuwaa gidowantta malatiinoo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Taani yaagay, hawaadan gidenna; yewuwaan k'ay hintte nagaraa paas'iide nagaraappe simmennaan is's'ooppe, hinttenttu ubbatuukka hewaadan hayk'k'iita. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Woy Salihooma gimbbii unttunttu bolla kunddiide, wod'eedda tammanne hosppun asatuwaa Yerusaalamen de'iyaawanttu ubbaappe aad'd'iide naak'k'owantta malatiinoo? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Hawaadan gidenna yaagay; yewuwaan k'ay nagaraa paas'ana d'ayooppe ubbatuukka hawaadan bayanita» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Yesuusikka hawaadan yaagi leemisuwaa odeedda, «Itti bitanew woyniyaa turaa goshshaa gaden toketteedda balasiyaa geetettiyaa ayfii meetettiyaa mitsatta de'aw; he bitaniikka mitsatta ayfaaddenttonne giide yeeddawe, ayinneekka ayfiyaa demmibeenna. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Woynniyaa turaa naagiyaawaa I, ‹Taani ha balasiyaa geetettiyaa mitsattippe ayfiyaa demmanaw heezzu laytsaa simerettaade ayaanne demmabeykke. Hewaa diraw deka dentsa digga; ayaw biittaa c'oo melissay?› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Naagiyaawekka zaariide, ‹Godaw, taani I yuushshuwaa harumanawunne pituwaa olanaw, ha laytsaa s'alalaw basha. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Sintsaw ayfooppe lo"a; shin ayfenaan is's'ooppe dekettu› geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi K'uuna Mishiratto Sambbata <optbreak/>Gallassaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yesuusikka itti Sambbataa gallassi Ayihuda woosa gollatuwaappe ittuwaan tamaarissi de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Hewaanikka tammanne hosppun laytsaa kumentsaa tuna ayyaanay k'uunisseedda mishiratta de'aw. Izakka suuraade ek'k'anaw ayinne danddayabeykku. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesuusikka izo be'eedda wode s'eesiide, «Ha mishirattee, ne harggiyaappe pas'aadda» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Yesuusi bare kushiyaa izi bolla wotsina, he wode suura sitti ga ek'k'aade bare S'oossaa galataaddu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Shin Ayihuda woosa golle kaappuu k'ay Yesuusi Sambbataan patseeddawaa diraw hank'k'etti zaarowaashshin asatuwaa, «Kiitettanaw bessiyaa usuppun gallassatuu de'iino; he gallassatun yiide pas'iteppe attin Sambbataan gidenna» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9">Kes. 20:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Zar. 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Godaykka zaariide, «Ha lo"a malatiyaa iita asatoo, hinttenttuppe ittuukka Sambbata gallassi booraa magaduwaappe woy hariyaa gaas'aataappe billiide haatsaa ushshanaw afennee? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Hanna Abraahaamo yaraa gideeddawunna, tammanne hosppun laytsaa kumentsaa s'alahii k'achcheeddawunna sambbata gallassi he k'ashuwaappe bilettanaw bessekkee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Hawaa odeedda wode ek'ettiyaawanttu ubbay yeellateeddino; Asay ubbay k'ay I ootseedda maalalissiyaa oosuwaan ubbaan nashetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sannaafic'iyaa Ayfiyaa Zeretsaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yesuusikka, «S'oossaa kawutetsay ayaa malatii? I ayaa malatintto, taani hinttentta woota bessoo? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>S'oossaa kawutetsay sannaafic'iyaa geetettiyaa k'eeri mitsatti ayfiyaa malatee. He mitsatti ayfiyaa Asay akkiide goshshaa garssan zereedda; zerettoonna dic'c'aade wogga mitsaa gidaaddu; yaatina saluwaa kafatuukka izi aac'aa bolla barenttoo golliyaa kees's'eeddino» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Irshshuwaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat. 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesuusikka zaariide, «S'oossaa kawutetsay ayaa malatintto, taani hinttentta woota bessoo? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Itti mishiratta heezzu keriyaa d'iiliyaa akkaade, munak'k'eedda munak'ay ubbay denddana gakkanaw, aan tigeedda irshshuwaa malatee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Un"a Penggiyaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mat. 7:13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Hewaappe kaala Yesuusi Yerusaalame biide, wogga katamaaninne k'eeri katamaan de'iyaa asaa tamaarissiidde aad'd'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>He wode itti bitanii shiik'iide Aa, «Godaw, S'oossaa pirddaappe attiyaawanttu guutsa asaa s'alalee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Hewaappe guyye Yesuusi unttuntta,<verse eid="LUK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Taani hinttenttoo oday; un"a penggiyaanna gelanaw baas'etite. C'ora Asay gelanaw koyyiino; shin danddaybbeykkino. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Golliyaawuu denddiide, ifitsaa k'achchowaappe guyye hinttenttu karen ek'k'iide, ‹Godaw, Godaw, nuw dooyaarikkii› yaagiide s'eessaa doommiyaa wode, ikka zaariide, ‹Hak'appe yeedditentto, taani hinttentta erikke› yaaganawaa.<verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>«He wode hinttenttu, ‹Nuuni neenanna ittippe meeddo; usheeddo; neeni nu heerankka tamaarissaadda› yaaganawantta.<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>«Yesuusi k'ay, ‹Taani hinttenttoo oday; hinttenttu hak'appe yeedditentto, taani hinttentta erikke; ubbatuukka makkalanchchatuu ta mataappe haakkite› yaagaanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz. 6:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>«Abraahaamo, Yisaak'i, Yaak'oobinne nabatuu ubbay hinttenttu karen ek'k'ishshin, S'oossaa kawutetsaan de'iyaawantta hinttenttu be'iyaa wode, hinttenttoo yeekonne achchaa d'ak'uwaa gidanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:28">13:28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat. 8:11</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>«Asay away doliyaasaappenne wulliyaasaappe, k'ay killibaggappenne hirkkibaggappe yiide, S'oossaa kawutetsaa gaytaan uttiino. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Be'ite; guyyeteeddawanttu, sintsatanawantta; sintsateeddawanttu k'ay guyyetanawantta» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Yerusaalamen Ootseeddabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>He wode Parisaawatuwaappe ittuu ittuu Yesuusakko yiide, «Heroodise neena wod'anaw koyyiyaa diraw, hawaappe ba digga» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Biide he worakanaw, ‹Hachchenne wontti iita ayyaanatuwaa kessana; hargganchchatuwaakka patsana; heezzentso gallassi ta oosuwaa wurssana› yaagite. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Hanoppe attin nabii Yerusaalameppe harasaan hayk'k'anaw bessena diraw, taani hachche, wonttinne wonttipeeshi ogiyaa bolla de'anaw bessee.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yerusaalame katamaa asaw, Yerusaalame katamaa asaw, Nabatuwaa wod'iyaawanttoo, hinttenttukko kiitettowantta shuchchaan c'addiyaawanttoo, kuttatta bare maratuwaa bare k'efiyaappe garssanna shiishsha hap'p'iyaawaadan, taani hinttenttu naanaa itti gadiyaa shiishshanaw aappu gede koyaadditaa! Shin taana diggeeddita. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Be'ite; S'oossay hinttenttu golliyaa ayinne olibeenna; taani hinttenttoo yaagay; hinttenttu, ‹Godaa suntsaan yiyaawe anjjetteeddawaa› gaana gakkanaw, taana be'ikkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Hargganchchaa Sambbataan Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Sambbata gallassi Parisaawatuwaa suntsatuwaappe ittuwaa golle Yesuusi k'umaa maanaw geleedda wode, ayaa kiitettintto be'anaw asatuu naagi de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Bollay gaafina metootiyaa itti bitanii Yesuusappe sintsanna de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesuusi higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttanne Parisaawatuwaa, «Sambbataan patsanaw danddayetti danddayettennee?» giide oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Unttunttukka c'o"u geeddino. I he bitaniyaa bollaa bochchi patsiide Aa moyzzeedda. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttuppe harii woy booray ollaan kunddintto, Sambbataa giide elleelli kessennawe oonee?» geedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat. 12:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Unttunttukka ha yewoo itti zaaruwaanne immanaw danddayibeykkino.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashikketetsaabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesuusi shoobettowanttu bonchchosaa dooriyaa wode s'eeliide, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Ooninne bullachchaa s'eesooppe, bonchchetteeddasaan uttoppa; ooni eri neeppe aatsiide bonchchettowe s'eesetteeddawaa gidanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Lem. 25:6</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Neenanne aanne s'eesawe yiide, ‹Hawo, utuwaa aw yeedda› yaagina; he wodiyaan yeellataade s'adenna de'iyaa saan utuwaa doommaasa; <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Yewuwaan k'ay neeni s'eeseetto wode neena s'eesowe yiide, ‹Ta laggew, killi d'ok'k'asaan utta› gaana mala, baade ubbaappe hokasaan utta; he wode neenanna ittippe utteeddawanttu ubbatuwaa sintsan new bonchchuu imettanawaa; <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Bare huup'iyaa d'ok'k'u ootsiyaa ubbay tooshettanawaa; bare huup'iyaa toochchiyaawanttu d'ok'k'u giino» yaagi leemisuwaa unttunttoo odeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk'. 18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Yesuusi barena s'eeseeddawaa zaariide, «Neeni laas'aa woy kawuwaa giigisseedda wode, ne laggetsatuwaa woy ne ishatuwaa woy dure ne shooratuwaa s'eesoppa; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu neena barenttu taraan s'eesiide kushiyaa c'iggana danddayiino. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Shin ataalliyaabaa giigisseedda wode, hiyyeesatuwaa, gunddatuwaa, doomatuwaanne k'ook'atuwaa s'eesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Unttunttu new kushiyaa zaaranaw danddayennawantta gidiyaa diraw, neeni anjjettanaassa. S'illatuu hayk'uwaappe denddiyaa wode S'oossay new kushiyaa zaaranawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wolk'k'aama Baalaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Yesuusi haasayaa wurssiyaa wode, k'umaa maanaw utto asaappe ittuu hawaa sisiide, «S'oossaa kawutetsaa gaytaan uttiyaawe anjjetteeddawaa» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesuusikka hawaadan geedda; «Itti bitanii daro lo"o kawuwaa giigissiide, c'ora asatuwaa s'eeseedda. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Kawuwaa wodii gakkina, kase s'eesettowantta, ‹Ha"i kawuu giigeedda, haayite› giide s'eesana mala bare gollen kiitettiyaa k'oomaa unttunttukko kiitteedda. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Shin ubbatuukka ittippe, beennaadan aggana mala woosseeddino; koyro bitanii k'oomaw odiidde, ‹Taani biittaa shammeedda diraw baade be'anaw koshshee; hewaa diraw hayya godo taw hank'k'ettoppaarikki› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>«Laa'entsiyaawe k'ay, ‹Taani ichcheshu waatsa booratuwaa shammeeddawantta waas'a be'anaw biyaa diraw, hayya godo taw hank'k'ettoppaarikki› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>«Haray k'ay, ‹Taani machchatto akkeedda diraw, yaanaw daanddayabeykke› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>«K'oomaykka yiide bare godaw, hanowaa ubbaa odeedda. He wode Goday daro hank'k'ettiide, bare golliyaan kiitettiyaa k'oomaa, ‹Hini katamaa ogiyaanne loosso ogiyaa elleellaade kesa; mank'k'atuwaanne gunddatuwaa, doomatuwaanne k'ook'atuwaa haa akkaade ya› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>«Aa k'oomaykka, ‹Godaw, neeni taana azazowaadan ootsaad; shin ha"ikka hara asaa akkiyaa sa'ay de'ee› geedda. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Godaykka bare k'oomaa, ‹Ta gollii kumanaadan hini ogiyaappe kare bagganne dirssaa gas'aa ubbaa kesaade, asaa ta golle akkaade ya. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ayaw gooppe, koyro ta golle shoobetteeddawanttuppe itti asaynne ta k'umaa meenna› geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaallanaw Barena Yarshshussaa Koshshee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>C'ora Asay Yesuusanna ittippe bide'iyaa wode, ikka asaakko guyye simmiide, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Ooninne taakko yiyaawe de'ooppe bare aabbanne aatto, bare machchattonne bare naanaa, bare ishatuwaanne michchatuwaa, bare de'uwaa ashshenaan taappe aatsi dosooppe, taana kaalliyaawaa geetettanaw danddayenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat. 10:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Ooninne bare mask'k'aliyaa tookkiide, ta geeduwaa kaallennaan d'ayooppe, taana kaalliyaawaa gidanaw danddayenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk'. 9:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>«Hinttenttuppe ittuu shuchchaa golliyaa kees's'anaw koyyooppe, kiitaa wurssanaw gidiyaa shaluwaa kasetiide utti heettennawe oonee? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Hewe d'ayooppe, golliyaa doommiide, kiitaa wurssanaw wolk'k'ay is's'ooppe, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>be'eeddawanttu ubbay, ‹Ha bitanii kees's'anaw doommeedda; shin kiitaa wurssanaw danddaybbeena› giide k'iliic'iino.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>«Woy tammu sha"a olanchchatuwaa oyk'k'eedda itti kaatii, hara laatamu sha"a olanchchatuwaa oyk'k'eeddawanttunna olettanaw danddayooppenne koyronna, taani s'oonanee s'oonikkitaashsha giide utti k'oppennee? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Barew danddayettennaan d'ayooppe, olaw yiyaa yekko kaatii haakuwaan de'ishshin kiittiide sigettanaw woossee. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Simmi hawaadankka hinttenttuppe ooninne barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa aggenawe, taana kaalliyaawaa gidanaw danddayenna.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Go"enna Mas'iniyaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Mas'inii lo"a; shin lok'ilok'ennaan d'ayooppe, laa'entso Aa wooti lok'ilok'issanaw danddayettii? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Biittawukka lo"enna; tu'eyanawukka maaddennawaa gido diraw, Asay Aa oli aggee. Sisiyaa haytsay de'iyaawe hawaa siso» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Bayeedda Dorssaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Itti gallassi, k'aras'aa shiishshiyaawanttunne nagaranchchatuu ubbay Yesuusa sisanaw aakko shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Parisaawatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu, «Ha bitanii, nagaranchchatuwaa shiishshiyaawaanne unttunttunna k'umaa miyaawaa» yaagiide zuuzummeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luk'. 5:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Yesuusikka leemisuwaan zaaruwaa hawaadan yaagi odeedda:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«S'eetu dorssay de'iyaa uray hinttenttu giddoppe de'intto hewaappe ittuu bayintto udduppu tammanne udduppunuwaa denbbaan aggiide bayeeddawaa beettana gakkanaw koyyennawe oonee? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Demmeedda wode nashechchaan bare hashiyaa bollan dorssaa tookki, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>bare golle simmiide, bare dosiyaawanttanne shooratuwaa ittippe s'eesiide, ‹Bayeedda ta dorssaa demmo diraw, taananna ittippe nashettite› yaagiide odee. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Hewaadankka nagaraa paas'etsaa koshshenna udduppu tammanne udduppu s'illatuwaappe aatsiide nagaraa paas'iyaa itti nagaranchchaan saluwaan daro nashechchay gidanawaa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bayiide Beetteedda Santtimiyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«K'aykka tammu nahaasiyaa santtimii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nahaasiyaa santtimii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriike k'aalaa biletsaan ittinna, itti gallassaa muumiyaa ootsi peesheedda wolk'k'aa oosanchchaw c'igetiyaa miishshaa keenaa gidiyaawaa odee.</char></note> de'iyaa mishiratta tammuwaappe ittuu bayintto demmana gakkanaw s'omppiyaa s'omppaade, golliyaa pittaade loytsa koyyennawunna iza oonee? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Izakka demmeedda wodiyaan bare dosiyaawanttanne bare shooratuwaa ittippe s'eesaade, ‹Taappe bayeedda santtimiyaa demmeedda diraw, taananna ittippe nashettite› yaagaade odaw. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Hewaadankka nagaraa paas'iyaa itti nagaranchchaa gaasotetsaan S'oossaa kiitanchchatuwaa sintsan nashechchay hananawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baya Na'aa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Gujjiide Yesuusi, «Laa"u naanay de'iyaa itti bitanii de'ee; <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>unttunttuppekka teefa na'ay, ‹Ne mas'uwaappe taana gakkiyaawaa imma› geedda. Aawuukka bare mas'uwaappe naanaatoo gisheedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan teefa na'ay barena gakkeeddawaa ubbaa shiishshi akkiide hini haako gade beedda; hewaan bare akkeedda miishshaa ubbaa laali wurssi aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Ikka de'iyaawaa ubbaa wursseeddawaappe guyyiyaan he gaden wolk'k'aama koshay geleedda; ikka metuwaan un"ettussaa doommeedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Hawaa diraw he gaden de'iyaawanttuppe ittuwaakko shiik'iide, ‹Taana new k'oomaa ootsaarikkii?› yaagina, bitaniikka bare guduntsaa wudiyaa heemmana mala Aa dembbaa yeddeedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Guduntsaa wudii miyaa hal"uwaa maanaw amotteedda; shin hewenttokka aw immiyaawe beettibeenna.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>«Bare bayizzuwaa ero wode, ‹K'umay s'ooniide sa'aan attiyaa ta aabboo ootsiyaawanttu aappunee; shin taani hawaan koshaan hayk'k'ana mataytaa? <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Denddaade ta aabbukko baanee› hawaadan yaagana; ‹Ta aabboo, S'oossaakka neenakka naak'k'aad; <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Hannippe guyye ne na'aa yaagettaade s'eesettanaw bessikke; new kiitettiyaawanttuppe ittuwaadan taana wotsaarikkii gaana› geedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>He man''iyaan denddiide bare aabbukko yeedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«I biro haakuwaan de'ishshin, aawuu be'iide, aw k'aretteedda; aakko wos's'i biide, Aa idimmi yereedda.<verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>«Na'aykka, ‹Ta aabboo, taani S'oossaakka neenakka naak'k'aad; hannippe guyye ne na'aa geetettaade s'eesettanaw bessikke› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>«Shin aawuu bare oosanchchatuwaa, ‹Elleelli biide, ubbaappe dooretteedda lo"o mayuwaa ahiide, Aa mayzzite; Aa birad'd'iyan migiduwaa, Aa gediyankka c'aammaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Migiduwaa, c'aammaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalatuu na'aa aabbu, Aa polo wozanaappe akkowaa bessiyaawantta. Migiduu, he na'ay gollen de'iyaa asatuwaa ubbaappe lo"o s'eeletteeddawaa bessee. C'aammay k'ay, I bare aabboo ayile gidennaadan na'aa gidiyaawaa bessee. Ayilatuu he wode c'aammaa wotsikkino.</char></note> wotsite. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Mod'd'eedda korumaa ahiide shukkite; moytte, nashettoytte. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ayaw gooppe, hawe ta na'ay hayk'k'eedda; shin ha"i pas'eedda; bayeedda; shin ha"i beetteedda› yaagina, nashechchaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«He wodiyaan, bayira na'ay gaden de'iyaawe yiide gollekko matiyaa wode, yetsaanne duruwaa kooshunchchaa siseedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Ikka yewuu ayentto eranaw koyyiide, k'oomatuwaappe ittuwaa s'eesiide, ‹Hawe ayee?› giide oochcheedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>K'oomatuukka, ‹Ne ishay saro yeedda diraw, ne aabbu mod'd'o korumaa aw shukkeedda› yaagi odeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>«Bayira na'ay hank'k'ettiide golle gelikke yaagi is's'ina, aawuu karew kesiide, gelanaadaa woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Shin I zaariide bare aabba, ‹Hekko hawaa keena wodiyaa k'oomaadan new kiitettaad; ne azazowaappe ittuwaannekka pac'issa beykke; ta laggetsatuwaanna ittippe nashettana mala haray atto itti deeshshaa bul"uwaanne taw imma beykka; <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>shin hawe ne na'ay ne miishshaa c'aaratuwaanna ittippe diifissiide yiina, d'iiko booraa shukkaadda› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>«Aawuukka Aa, ‹Ta na'aw, neeni ubbaa gallassaa taananna ittippe de'aa; taassa gideeddabay ubbaykka newaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Shin hawe ne ishay, hayk'k'eeddawe pas'o dirawunne bayeeddawe beetto diraw, nuuni miiddinne ushiidde nashettanaw bessee› yaageedda» giide odeedda.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Garssanna Suntsatetsaa Akkeedda <optbreak/>C'inc'c'a Bitaniyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo odiidde, «Itti dure bitanii, bare golliyaa ubbaa bolla suntseedda itti bitanii de'ee; shin ha bitanii Aa miishshaa bayizzee yaagiyaa zigirssay Aa gakkeedda; <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>hewaa diraw bare suntseedda bitaniyaa s'eesiide, ‹Hawe taani sisiyaa yewuu ayee? Hannippe guyye neeni ta Golliyaaninne ta miishshaa bolla taappe garssanna suntsettaade kiitettanaw danddayabeenna diraw, hachche gakkanaw kiitetteeddawaa heettaade sheed'd'a› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>«Suntsetteeddawe bare wozanaan, ‹Ta goday taana suntsatetsaappe kolana hanee; shin ta waanooshsha? Goshanaw wolk'k'ay taw baawa; woossanaw k'ay taw pokkee. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Ta ootsanabaa ta eray; I taana suntsatetsaappe kessooppe, barenttu golle biina, taana mokkiyaa laggetsatuwaa taani demmana› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«Bare godaappe shaluwaa tal"eedda asatuwaa huup'iyaan huup'iyaan s'eesiide, koyro bitaniyaa, ‹Neeni ta godaappe woyssa keena shaluwaa tal"aaddii?› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>«Ikka, ‹Taani s'eetu baareetaa kumeedda zayitiyaa tal"aad› yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">«Suntsetteedda bitaniikka, Neeni paramana warak'ataa hey; uttaade ellekka ‹Ishatama› gaade s'aafa yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>«Hewaappe hara bitaniyaa, ‹Neeni aappunuwaa tal"aaddii?› yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">« ‹S'eetu k'un"aa zarggaa› yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«Suntsaykka, ‹Warak'ataa hey; hosppun tamma gaade s'aafa› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>«He suntsay c'inc'c'atetsaan ootseedda diraw, Aa goday Aa galateedda; ayaw gooppe, ha alamiyaa Asay barenttuwoo poo'uwaa asaappe aad'd'eedda c'inc'c'atuwaa.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Taani hinttenttoo yaagay, ‹Ha alamiyaa shaluu wuriyaa wode, med'inaw wurenna golliyaan hinttentta mokkana mala, ha miishshaan hinttenttoo laggiyaa demmite. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Laafa yewuwaan ammanetteedawe, woggabaankka ammanettee. Shin laafa yewuwaan ammanettibeennawe, woggabaankka ammanettena. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Simmi hinttenttu ha alamiyaa shaluwaan ammanettennawaa gidooppe, tumatetsaa shaluwaa hinttenttoo oonee hadaraa giide immanawe? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Hinttenttu hara asaa shaluwaan ammanettennawaa gidooppe, hinttenttu miishshaa oonee hinttenttoo immanawe?› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Itti kaala laa"u godatoo k'oomatanaw danddayiyaawe ay k'oomaykka baawa; ayaw gooppe, ittuwaa is's'iide, haraa dosee; woy ittuwaa bonchchiidde, haraa kad'ee; S'oossawunne shaloo moodettanaw danddaykkita» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Shaluwaa dosiyaa Parisaawatuu hawaa ubbaa sisiide, Yesuusa bolla k'iliic'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Shin Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttu asaa sintsan hinttentta s'illo asaa ootsiyaawantta; shin S'oossay hinttenttu wozanaa eree; ayaw gooppe, asaa sintsan bonchchetteeddawe S'oossaa sintsan tuna gidee.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muse Higgiyaabaanne Geluwaa Akaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Mat. 5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Muse higgiyaanne nabatuu s'aafeedda mas'aafaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Muse higgiyaanne nabatuu mas'aafaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihudatuwaa Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwaa; hewantta guussay Ec'a C'aak'uwaa mas'aafaa.</char></note> Yohaannisa wodiyaa gakkanaw Asay azazettiidde de'eeddino; hewaappe kaala k'ay S'oossaa kawutetsay odetteedda; Asay ubbay yaa gelanaw keesetee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat. 11:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Shin higgiyaappe ittibay attiyaawaappe saluunne sa'ay aad'd'iyaawe matattee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat. 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Bare machchatto billiide hararo akkiyaawe ubbay woshummee; k'ay asinaappe biletteedda mac'c'awuno akkiyaawe ooninnekka woshummee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 K'or. 7:10</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dure Bitaniyaabaanne Mank'k'o Gideedda Ali'aazarabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Gatii loytsiide al"o gideedda mayuwaa mayyiiddinne gallassaan gallassaan otoruwaan nashettiidde de'iyaa itti dure bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>K'aykka kumentsaa asatetsan maytsay de'iyaa itti Ali'aazara geetettiyaa hiyyeesay, ha dure bitaniyaa kariyaan giseedda. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Ha dure bitaniyaa samppaappe laaletteedda suuppaa maanaw amottee; haray atto kanatuukka yiide Aa maytsaa laac'c'iino.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Ha hiyyeesaa bitanii hayk'k'ina, kiitanchchatuu Aa Abraahaamo bagga bonchchosaa afeeddino; dure bitaniikka k'ay hayk'k'iide moogetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Si'ooliyaan daro seelettiidde de'ishshin, d'ok'k'u giide haakuwaan Ali'aazara, Abraahaamo baggan de'iyaawaa be'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>«Ikka bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, ‹Abraahaamo, ta aabboo, taw k'aretta. Ha tamaa seelaan metoota de'iyaa diraw, Ali'aazar bare birad'd'iyaa s'eeraa haatsaan bochchiide, ta ins's'arssaa irs's'issanaadan hayyanaa taakko kiittaarikkii› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Abraahaamo k'ay, ‹Ta na'aw, neeni pas'a de'aadde, lo"o de'uwaa de'ina, Ali'aazar lo"enna meto de'uwaa de'eeddawaa k'oppa. Ha"i k'ay I hawaan nashettiyaa wode, neeni metuwaa bolla de'aa.<verse eid="LUK 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>« ‹Hawaappe haray k'ay, hawaappe yaa hinttenttukko aad'd'anaw koyyiyaawanttu aad'd'ennaadan, yaan de'iyaawanttukka k'ay haa nuukko pinnennaadan, nu giddoninne hinttenttu giddon wogga aafuu med'etteedda› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>«Dure bitaniikka, ‹Abraahaamo, simmi hewaa gidooppe, neeni Ali'aazara ta aabbu golle yeddana mala, neena woossay. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Ayaw gooppe, taw ichcheshu ishatuu de'iyaa diraw, unttunttu k'ay ha metuwaasaa yeenna mala, unttunttoo Ali'aazar biide markkatto› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>«Abraahaamo k'ay, ‹Musenne nabatuu s'aafeedda mas'aafay unttunttoo de'ee; he mas'aafay giyaawaa unttunttu sisiino› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>«Dure bitanii, ‹Hi"ii; Abraahaamo, ta aabboo, hewaa gidenna; shin itti bitanii hayk'uwaappe denddiide, unttunttukko bintto, unttunttu barenttu nagaraa paas'iide, simmanawantta› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>«Abraahaamokka, ‹Unttunttu Musenne nabatuu s'aafeedda mas'aafaa sisennawaa gidooppe, haray atto itti uray hayk'uwaappe denddi yinttokka ammanikkino› geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Nagaraabaa Yesuusi Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mat. 18:6</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Asaa baletsiyaawe yeennaan attena; shin baletsiyaawaa ahiyaa uraw aw aayye; <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>He bitanii ha guutsatuwaappe ittuwaa baletsiyaawaappe, gaac'c'iyaa wos'aa bare k'ood'iyaan k'ashettiide abbaan mitettiyaawe aw lo"a. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Hintte huup'ew naagettite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Ne ishay neena naak'k'ooppe, Aa zora. K'ay nagaraappe I simmooppe, aw atto yaaga. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Itti gallassi I neena laappu gede naak'k'iide, laappu gedekka, ‹Neena ta naak'k'aad, taana maara› giidde neekko yooppe, aw atto ga» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Kiitetteeddawanttukka Godaa, «Nuw ammanuwaa gujja» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Godaykka, «Hinttew sannaafic'iyaa ayfiyaa keena ammanuu de'intto, hinttenttu ha boo'iyaa, ‹Hawaappe shodettaade, abbaan tooketta› gintto hinttew eeno gaana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'oomay Ootsanaw Bessiyaa Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>K'aykka Yesuusi, «Hintteppe goshiyaawe woy miyaa heemmiyaa k'oomay de'iyaa Asay hak'et de'ooppe, goshsha gadeppe woy miyaa gadeppe simmo wode ellekka, ‹Haaya shemppa akka, k'umaa maanaw utta› yaagiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Yewuwaan k'ay, ‹Ta maana kawuwaa giigissa; ta maananne ushana gakkanaw minnaade taana ek'k'aade miza. Hewaappe guyye new ma, usha› yaagiyaawaa gidennee? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>He k'oomay kiitetteeddabaa ootseedda diraw, he bitanii galatanaw bessennee? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Hewaadankka hintte k'ay Asay hinttena kiitto oosuwaa ootseedda wode, ‹Nuuni maaddenna k'oomatuwaa; nu ooso s'alalaa ootseeddo› yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Oolluu Oyk'k'eedda Tammu Asatuwaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesuusi Yerusaalame biidde, Galiilaappenne Sammaariyaa giyaa gadatuwaappe gidduwaanna aad'd'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>I itti guutsa katamato geliyaa wodiyaan, haakuwaan ek'k'eedda tammu oolluwaan oyk'etteeddawanttu Aa be'eeddino. Unttunttukka haakuwaan ek'k'iide, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Yesuusa, Godaw, hayya godo nuuna patsaarikkii!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesuusi unttuntta be'iide, «Biide, hinttenttu bollaa k'eesatuwaa bessite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Unttunttukka k'eesatuwaakko bide'iidde oolluwaappe pas'eeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Wog. 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu bare harggiyaappe pas'eeddawaa be'iide, bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, S'oossaa bonchchiidde simmeedda. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Galatiiddekka Yesuusa gediyaa matan gulbbateedda. He bitanii Sammaariyaa asaa.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Tammuu pas'ibeykkinoo? Yaatina udduppunatuu hak'an de'iinoo? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ayihuda asaa gidenna Sammaariyaa bitaniyaappe attin, S'oossaa bonchchanaw simmeeddawanttu baawa guussee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Dendda ba; ne ammanuu neena patseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Kawutetsaa Yuussaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Parisaawatuu itti gallassi, «S'oossaa kawutetsay awude yaannee?» giide oochchina Yesuusi, «S'oossaa kawutetsay hinttenttu naagiyaa ogiyaan yeenna» yaagi zaareedda. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>K'aykka, «Ooninne, ‹S'oossaa Kawutetsay hawaan de'ee›, woy ‹Hewaan de'ee› gaanaw danddayenna; S'oossaa Kawutetsay hinttenttu wozanaa giddon de'ee» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo odiidde, «Asaa Na'ay k'onc'c'iyaa gallassatuwaappe ittuwaa be'anaw hinttenttu amottiyaa wodii yaana; shin be'ikkita. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>K'ay unttunttu hinttena, ‹Haweku hawaana› woy ‹Hewaana› yaaganawantta. Shin unttuntta kaalliide, unttunttunna booppite. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Walk'k'antsay saluwaan wolk'k'aamiyaa wode, ha gas'aappe hini gas'aa poo'uu poo'iyaawaadan, asaa na'aa yuussaykka hewaadan hananawaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Shin koyrottiide Asaa Na'ay daro metuwaa metootanawunne he wodiyaan de'iyaa yeletaan is's'ettanaw bessee.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>«Nohe wodiyaan hanowaadankka, Asaa Na'ay k'onc'c'iyaa gallassankka hewaadan hananawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Dom. 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nohe markkabiyaa gelo gallassay gakkanaw unttunttu, miiddinne ushiidde, akkiiddinne akettiidde de'ishshin, bashshaa haatsay yiide ubbaa asaakka bayizzeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Dom. 7:6-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>«Hewaadankka, Loos'e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nohe, Loos'e: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossay biittaa bashshaa haatsaan bayizzeedda wode, I Nohane Aa golle asaa ashsheeda. S'oossay Sodoomaanne Gamoora katamatuwaa, izin de'iyaa iitaa asatuwaa ubbaa tamaan bayizzeedda wode, Loos'anne Aa golle asaa ashsheeda (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-29">Dom. 19:1-29</ref></char> s'eellite).</note> wodiyaan, Asay miiddinne ushiidde, zal"iidde, tokkiiddinne golliyaa kees's'iide de'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Shin Loos'e, Sodoomaappe keso gallassaan k'ay saluwaappe tamaynne ees's'iyaa bonk'k'o shuchchay bukkeedda; ubbabaakka miide wursseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Dom. 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>«Asaa na'ay k'onc'c'iyaa gallassaankka hawaadan hananawaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>He gallassaan, golliyaa huup'iyaan de'iyaawe, golle garssan de'iyaa miishshaa akkanaw wod'd'oppo; hawaadankka goshsha gaden de'iyaawe, guyye simmoppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat. 24:17</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mar. 13:15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Ane Loos'e machchattibaa k'oppite!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Dom. 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Bare shemppuwaa ashshanaw koyyiyaa ubbay, bayizzee; bare shemppuwaa bayizziyaa ubbay, de'uwaan naagee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk'. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ta hinttew odiyaawe ayee gooppe, he k'ammaan laa"u asatuu itti gisuwaan gisanawantta; unttunttuppe ittuu akettina laa'entsiyaawe attanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Laa"u mac'c'a asatuu itti wos'aan gaac'c'anawantta; ittinna akettina, ittinna attanawunnu. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Laa"u asatuu goshsha garssan de'iino; ittuu aketanawaa, laa'entsiyaawe attanawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:40">Mat. 24:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusa, «Godaw, hewe hak'an hananawee?» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Ikka zaariide, «Bakkutay de'iyaasaa shorttii shiik'anawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Mank'k'o Gideedda Am"attibaanne <optbreak/>Makkalanchcha Daannaabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo, salettenaan ubbaa gallassi woossanaadan leemisuwaan odeedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Ikka, «Itti katamaan S'oossaw yayyenawe, asaakka bonchchenna itti daannay de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>He katamaan am"e mishiratta de'aw. Izakka he daannaakko yaade, ‹Ta morkkewunne taw de'iyaa yewuwaa pirddaa› yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>«Daro wodiyaan iziw pirddennaan is's'eedda. Shin bare wozanaan k'oppiide, ‹Taani, ubbaa S'oossaw yayana d'ayooppekka, asaakka k'ay bonchchana d'ayooppe, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>ha am"e mishiratta taana labbantsiyaa dirawunne ubbaa wode taakko yaade taana daaburssenna mala, taani iziw pirddana› geedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>«He makkalanchcha daannay goowaa akeekite. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>S'oossay gallassinne k'amma barentta maaddana mala, danddayaan aakko waassiyaa doorettawanttoo pirddenneeyye? I unttunttoo ellekka zaarennee? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Taani hinttenttoo yaagay; unttunttoo elleelli pirddana; shin Asaa Na'ay yiyaa wode ha biittaan ammanuwaa demmaneeshsha?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Otorettiyaa Parisaawiyaanne Barena <optbreak/>Kawushisseedda K'aras'aa K'ans's'iyaa Bitaniyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Barentta geeshsha giide ammanettiyaawanttoonne haraa ubbaa darii kad'iyaawanttoo, Yesuusi ha leemisuwaa odeedda: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Laa"u asatuu woossanaw geeshsha golliyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Woossanaw geeshsha golliyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihuda Asay ubbaa wode Geeshsha Golliyaan wontta guuraaninne gallassaa woossino.</char></note> geleeddino. Hewanttuppe ittuu Parisaawiyaa; ittuu k'ay k'aras'aa k'ans's'iyaawaa. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Parisaawii denddi ek'k'iide bare wozanaan woossiidde, ‹S'oossaw, taani hara asaadan: bonk'k'iyaawanttudan, makkaliyaawanttudan, woshummiyaawanttudan, woy hawaadan k'aras'aa shiishshenna diraw neena galatay. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Saaminttaan laa"u kaala s'oomay; taani demmiyaa ubbaappe tammu kushiyaappe ittuwaa immay› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>«Shin k'aras'iyaa bitanii haakuwaan ek'k'iide, bare ayfiyaan pude saluwaa d'ok'k'u giide s'eellanawukka koyyibeenna. Shin bare tiraa bak'k'iidde, ‹S'oossaw, taani nagaranchchaa; taana maara› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Taani hinttenttoo odiyaawe ayee gooppe, kase bitaniyaappe aad'd'iide ha bitanii s'illo gidiide bare golle simmeedda; barena d'ok'k'u ootsiyaa ubbay kawushana; barena k'ay kawushissiyaa uray d'ok'k'u gaana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Guutsa Naanaa Anjjeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Yesuusi bare kushiyaa wotsiide anjjana mala Asay guutsa naanaa akkiide aakko yeeddino. Aa kaalliyaawanttukka be'iide, asaa ahenna mala geeddino. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yesuusi k'ay guutsa naanaa barekko s'eesiide, «Guutsa naanay taakko yaana mala aggite, diggoppite; S'oossaa kawutetsay hawanttu malaasa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; S'oossaa kawutetsaa guutsa na'aadan akkenawanttu ubbay he kawutetsaa mulekka gelenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Yihudaa biittaa Mooddiyaawanttuppe ittuu, «Lo"o tamaarissiyaawoo, taani med'inaa de'uwaa laattanaw ayaa ootsanaw bessii?» yaagiide Yesuusa oochcheedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesuusikka aw, «Ayaw taana lo"oo, yaagay? Itti S'oossaappe attin, lo"uu ooninne baawa; <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>S'oossaa azazatuwaa, ‹Woshummoppa, wod'oppa, wuu"oppa, wordduwaa markkattoppa, ne aabbanne ne daayo bonchcha yaagiyaawaa eraa› » yaagiide zaareedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Bitanii zaariide, «Hawaa ubbaa, na'atetsaappe doommaade naagaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesuusikka hawaa sisiide, «Ittibay neeni biroon ootsennaan attowe de'ee; hewenneekka, new de'iyaawaa ubbaa zal"aade mank'k'atoo imma; hawaa ootsooppe saluwankka neeni durettana; hewaappe guyye ta geeduwaa kaala» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>He bitanii k'ay hewaa sisiide daro dure gido diraw daro kayyotteedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesuusikka ha bitanii daro kayyottowaa be'iide, «Dure Asay S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanaw wooti metanddeeshsha! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Dure Asay S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanawaappe gaaluu marppiyaa s'oo'iyaanna aad'd'anawe matattee» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Hewaa siseedda asay, «Simmi ooni attanaw danddayii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Ikka k'ay zaariide, «Asaw danddayettennawe S'oossaw danddayettee» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>P'es'iroosi zaariide, «Simmi nuuni nuw de'iyaa ubbaa aggiide neena kaalleeddo» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Ikka, «Tumuwaa gay, S'oossaa kawutetsaa diraw bare golliyaa, woy barena yelawantta, woy bare machchiyaa, woy bare naanaa, woy ishatuwaa aggeeddawe, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>ha wodiyaan daro dakkuwaa, sintsa yiyaa kawutetsaankka med'inaa de'uwaa akkenawe ooninne baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Hayk'uwaabaa <optbreak/>Heezzentsuwaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesuusikka tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawantta barekko s'eesiide, «Simmi Yerusaalame baana; Asaa Na'aabaykka nabatuu mas'aafan s'aafetteeddabay ubbay yaan polettana. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Ayihude gidennawanttoo Aa aatsi immana, k'iliic'ana, daro metootsana, Aa bollan c'uchchana; <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>shoc'owaappe guyyiyaan wod'ana, heezzentsiyaa gallassi I denddana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Unttunttukka ha yewuwaappe ayaanne akeekibeykkino; hayk'uukka unttunttoo akeekettibeenna diraw I haasayobaakka eribeykkino. <verse eid="LUK 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesuusi Iyarkkokko mateedda wodiyaan, itti k'ook'a bitanii woossiidde ogiyaa gas'aan utteedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>C'ora Asay aad'd'iyaawaa sisiide, «Hawe ayeeshsha?» yaagi oochcheedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Asaykka aw, «Naazireetiyaa Yesuusi hawaanna aad'd'i de'ee» yaagi zaareeddino.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Ikka, «Daawite na'aa Yesuusaa, taana maaraarikkii» giide waasseedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Aappe sintsanna biidde de'iyaawanttukka, c'o"u gaanaadan hank'k'etteeddino. I k'ay, «Daawite na'aw, taana maaraarikkii» giide darii waasseedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesuusikka ek'k'iide, barekko ahanaadan asaw odeedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>Yesuusakko I s'eetuwaa wodiyaan, Yesuusi, «Taani new ayaa ootsanaadan koyyay?» yaagiide Aa oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Ikka zaariide, «Godaw, s'eellanaw koyyay» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesuusikka, «S'eella, ne ammanuu neena patseedda» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>He wodiyaankka s'eelli aggeedda; S'oossaakka bonchchiidde Aa geeduwaa kaalleedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:43">Asay ubbay bitaniyaa s'eelliide, S'oossaa galateeddino.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Zakkiyoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesuusi hini Iyyarkko katamaa geliide, hewaanna aad'd'i de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Suntsay Zakkiyoosa geetettiyaa itti dure bitanii hewaan de'ee. Ikka k'aras'iyaawanttoo kaappuwaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Zakkiyoosi Yesuusa geetettiyaawe hak'awentto be'anaw koyyishshin k'antsa gideeddawaa diraw, asaa c'oratetsaappe denddowaan be'anaw danddayibeenna. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Yesuusi he ogiyaanna aad'd'iyaa diraw, sintsaw aad'd'iide itti boo'iyaa bolla keseedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesuusi he sa'aa gakkiide, d'ok'k'u gi pude s'eelliide, «Zakkiyoosa, hachche ne gollen peeshanaw bessiyaa diraw elle wod'd'a» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Ikka elleelli boo'iyaappe wod'd'iide, nashechchaan Yesuusa mokkeedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Hewaan de'iyaa asaa ubbay hawaa be'iide, «Hawe nagaranchchaa gollen geliide imatsaa gidiide shoobettana hanee» giide ubbatuukka zuuzuntsaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakkiyoosikka k'ay ek'k'iide Godaa, «Godaw, simmi taw de'iyaawaa ubbaappe bagga hiyyesatoo immana; ooppennekka wordduwaan akkeeddawaa gidooppe, oyddu dakkuwaa udaade zaarana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesuusikka Zakkiyoosaw odiidde, «Neenikka Abraahaamo sheeshshaa gidiyaa diraw, hachche atotetsay ha golle asaw yeedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Ayaw gooppe, Asaa Na'ay bayeeddawaa koyyanawunne ashshanaw yeedda» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat. 18:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tammu K'oomatuwaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Asay hawaa sisiide de'ishshin Yesuusi, hini Yerusaalame s'eetuwaa dirawunne unttunttoo S'oossaa kawutetsay ha"ikka k'onc'c'iyaawaa malato diraw leemisuwaa odeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Hawaadan yaagi doommeedda; «Itti wolk'k'aama bitanii barew kawutetsaa bonchchuwaa akkiide simmanaw, hini haako gadiyaa beedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Bare k'oomatuwaa giddoppe tammuwaa s'eesiide, unttunttoo tammu miinaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Miinaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miinaa geetettiyaawe, Giriike k'aalaan Minase giyaawaa. Hawaa biletsay, he wode de'iyaa oosanchcha asaw imettiyaa heezzu agenaa dirgguwaa.</char></note> geetettiyaa miishshaa immowaashshin, ‹Taani simmaade yaana gakkanaw, ha miishshaan zal"ishshite› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>«Shin Aa gadiyaa Asay Aa is's'o diraw, ‹Ha bitanii nu bolla kaatetanaadan nuuni koyyokko› yaagiide, guyyenna I de'iyaasaa asaa kiitteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Gidoppe attin, ha bitanii kaate gidiide hini bare gade simmeedda. He k'oomatuu huup'iyaan huup'iyaan I immo miishshaan zal"iide ay keena wod'iseeddinontto eranaw s'eesisseedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>«Koyro k'oomay shiik'iide, ‹Godaw, neeni taw immeedda tammu miinaa wod'iyaa tammuwaa demmaad› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Aa Goday Aa, ‹Hayyanaashsho! Neeni lo"o k'oomaa; neeni guutsa yewuwaan ammanetteedawaa gidaade beetto diraw, tammu katamatuwaa bollan maatay new imetteedda› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>«Laa'entsiyaawekka shiik'iide, ‹Godaw, neeni taw immeedda ichcheshu miinaa geetettiyaa miishshay ichcheshuwaa wod'd'eedda› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Aa Godaykka Aa, ‹New ichcheshu katamatuwaa bollan maatay imetteedda› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Hara heezzentsiyaa k'oomay shiik'iide, ‹Godaw, c'urk'k'aan s'aas'a wotseedda ne miishshaa hawaa be'a. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Ayaw gooppe, neeni wotsabeennasaappe akkiyaawaa; zerabeennawaa k'oyc'iyaa mek'etsi baynna asaa gidiyaa diraw, new yayaad› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>«Godaykka, ‹Ha iita k'oomay; neeni haasayo k'aalaan ne bolla taani pirddana. Wotsabeennawaa akkiyaawaa, zerabeennawaa k'oyc'iyaa mek'etsi baynna asaa gidiyaawaa erooppe, <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>taani yaade ta miishshaa wod'iyaanna akkana mala, ayaw wod'isiyaawanttoo immabeykkii?› yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>«Godaykka, hewaan ek'k'owantta, ‹Ha miishshaa aappe wotsi akkiide tammu miinay de'iyaawoo immite› yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Unttunttukka, ‹Godaw, aw tammu miinay de'ee› yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>«Ikka, ‹Taani hinttenttoo odiyaawe, de'iyaawoo ubbaw gujettanawaa; baynnawaappe k'ay he de'iyaawekka aketanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk'. 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Yewuwaan k'ay taani unttunttu bollan kawutennaadan koyyeedda ta morkkatuwaa taakko ahiide ta sintsaan shukkite› geedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Daro Bonchchuwaan Yerusaalame Geleedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-15">Yoh. 12:12-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesuusi hawaa goowaappe kaala hini Yerusaalame kesanaw barena kaalliyaawanttuppe sintsatiide beedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Debre Zayite geetettiyaa deriyaa matan de'iyaa hini Beetefaagen Biitaaniyaa geetettiyaa heeraa katamatuwaakko shiik'eedda wode barena kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"atuwaa, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Hinttenttuppe sintsan de'iyaa k'eeri katamatuwaa biite; yaa hinttenttu geliyaa wode, ooninne biro uttibeenna hare maray k'ashetti utteeddawaa demmanita; Aa billiide haa akki yiite. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ooninne hinttentta, ‹Hawaa ayaw billiitee?› giide oochchooppe, ‹I bare godaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Godaw: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaan godaw geetettowe, hare maraa godaappeshshin, S'oossaa gidenna.</char></note> koshshiyaa diraassa› yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Kiitetteeddawanttukka biide, Yesuusi unttunttoo odowaadan hanina demmeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Unttunttu hare maraa billiyaa wode be'iide hariyaa Goday, «Hare maraa ayaw billiitee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Unttunttukka, «Godaw hawe koshshee» yaagiide, <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>hare maraa Yesuusakko aheeddino; barenttu mayuwaa Aa bollan wotsiide Yesuusa hariyaa togisseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Asaykka Yesuusi biyaa ogiyaa bolla barenttu mayuwaa hiis's'eeddino.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mayuwaa hiis's'eeddino: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, Ayihuda asaa wogaan, eretteeddanne bonchchettiyaa asaw oosettiyaa imatsaa mokaa wogaa.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>I Debre Zayite geetettiyaa deriyaa dugetsaa afiyaa ogiyaa mateedda wode, daro c'ora gideedda Aa kaalliyaawanttu be'eedda S'oossay ootseedda malaataw ubbaw nashettiide, barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide,<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>«Godaa suntsaan yiyaa kaatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">anjjetteeddawaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">saluwaan sarotay gido.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">K'ay killi d'ok'k'a saluwaan de'iyaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">S'oossay bonchchetto»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 19:38">yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Asaa garssan de'iyaa itti itti Parisaawatuu Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, neena kaalliyaawantta c'o"u ootsaarikkii» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Ikka zaariide, «Taani hinttenttoo oday, unttunttu c'o"u gooppe, shuchchaykka waassanawaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesuusi Yerusaalame mateedda wode, katamato be'iide, yeekkiidde, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>«Ne sarotaw gidiyaawaa neeni hachche eraaddintto lo"a; shin ha"i hewe ne ayfiyaappe geemmeedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ayaw gooppe, ne bolla yaana wodii de'ee; he wode neena is's'iyaawanttu ne yuushshuwaan dirssaa diriide, yaappenne haappenne dooddiide, neena un"etsiyaa wodii yaanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Neenanne ne dirssaa garssan de'iyaa ne asaa mentsereetsana. S'oossay neena be'anaw yeedda wodiyaa neeni erabeenna diraw, neena is's'iyaawanttu shuchchaa ubbaa ittuwaa ittuwaa bollappe dentsiide laalanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan Zal"iyaawantta Yedersseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Hawaappe kaala Yesuusi geeshsha golliyaa geliide, zal"iyaawantta hewaappe kesseedda. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Yesuusi zaariide, « ‹Ta gollii S'oossaa woossiyaa golliyaa gidanawaa› geetettiide S'oossaa k'aalaan s'aafetteedda. Shin hinttenttu Aa paannuwaa gonggoluwaa ootseeddita» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yesuusi ubbaa wode geeshsha golliyaan tamaarissi de'ishshin, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu, Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne asaa ayissiyaawanttu Aa wod'anaw koyyiino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk'. 21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Shin Asay ubbay Aa haasayaappe ittuunne attenaan sisi utto diraw, Aa wod'iyaa ogiyaa unttunttu d'ayeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Maataa Bolla Denddeedda Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Itti gallassi Yesuusi asaa geeshsha golliyaan tamaarissiiddenne mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odiidde de'iyaa wode, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu gadiyaa c'imatuwaanna ittippe Yesuusakko yeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Unttunttukka, «Ha yewuwaa neeni ootsiyaawe ay maataanentto oda; ha maataakka new immeeddawe I oonee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Ikka, «Ta hinttena itti ooshaa oochchiyaawe de'iyaawaa ane zaarite. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Yohaannisa s'ink'k'atay S'oossaappee woy asaappee?» yaagi oochcheedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Unttunttu bare giddon mak'k'ettiidde, «S'oossaappe gooppe, hewaa gidooppe ‹Ayaw ammanibeykkitee› nuuna yaaganawaa; <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>‹Asaappe› gooppe, Asay ubbay Yohaannisi nabiyaa gidiyaawaa ammaniyaa diraw shuchchaan nuuna dechchanawantta» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Hawaassi, «Hak'appe yeeddentto erokko» giide aw zaareeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesuusikka, «Hawaa gidooppe taanikka, taani O maataan ha yewuwaa ootsaytantto hinttenttoo odikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Hawaappe simmiide Yesuusi asaw ha leemisuwaa yaagi oduwaa doommeedda:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa. 5:1</ref></char></note> «Itti bitanii daro woyniyaa turatuwaa tokkeedda. Goshshanchchatoo kotsaw immiide, I hini hara gadiyaa biide c'ora wodiyaa gam"eedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Woynnii ayfiyaa ayfo wode, woyniyaa goshshaa Goday barena gakkiyaawaa ahanaadan itti k'oomaa kotsaawatuwaakko kiitteedda. Kiitetti beeddawaakka d'oobbiide, mela kushiyaa yeddeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Hewaappe hara k'oomaa kiitteedda. Unttunttu hewaakka k'ay d'oobbiide, toochchiide, mela kushiyaa yeddeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Ha"ikka haraa heezzentsiyaa k'oomaa kiitteedda. Unttunttukka k'ay Aa masuntsiide, hini kare oleeddino.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>«He woyniyaa turaa Godaykka, ‹Simmi ayaa ootsoo? Ane ha"i ta dosiyaa na'aa kiittana; ooni eri Aa bonchchooppenne› geedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Goshshanchchatuu k'ay na'aa be'eedda wode, ‹Hawe Aa laattiyaawaa gido diraw, hayite wod'oytte; hewaappe guyye, biittay nuussa gidanawaa› giide zoretteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Woynniyaa turaa sa'aappe, hini karew kessiide Aa wod'eeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Woynniyaa turaa Godaykka unttuntta ayaa ootsanddeeshsha? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Yooppe he goshshanchchatuwaa, wod'anawaa; woyniyaa turaa sa'aakka haranttoo immanawaa» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Asatuukka hawaa siso wode, «Hawaa malabaa ahoppo» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesuusikka hini unttunttukko s'eelliide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">« ‹Simmi shuchchaa golliyaa kees's'iyaawanttu kad'eedda shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">I waanna golliyaa minisiyaa huup'e shuchchaa gideedda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">geetettiide s'aafetteeddawaa biletsay ayee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Ha shuchchaa bollan kunddiyaa ubbay me'erettee; shuchchaykka Aa bollan kunddiyaa ubbay bunchchettanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Giiraa, Giiranee Agganee Giyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Muse higgiyaa s'aafiyaawanttunne k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Yesuusi haasayeedda leemisuu, unttunttu bollan geetettowaa ero diraw, he saatiyankka Aa oyk'k'anaw koyyeeddino. Shin asaw yayyeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Yesuusa, he gadiyaa mooddiyawoonne Aa maataw aatsiide immanaw Aa doonaappe kesiyaa k'aalaan oyk'k'anaw injjetiyaa wodiyaa naagiino. Hewaa diraw geeshsha malatiidde oytsanaw wochchiyaawantta kiitteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>He kiitettowanttukka Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, neeni tuma yewuwaa haasayiyaawaanne tamaarissiyaawaa, hewaadankka k'ay S'oossaa ogiyaa tumatetsaan tamaarissiyaawaanne oossinne dummayennawaa nuuni ereetto. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>K'aykka unttunttu, Roomaa kaatiyaa K'eesaarew giiraa c'igganaw koshshii woy koshshennee?» yaagi oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>I k'ay unttunttu deshatetsaa eriide, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Ane taana itti diinaariyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Diinaariyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He wode Roomaa biittaa Asay go"ettiyaa miishshaa.</char></note> bessite; hewaa bollan de'iyaa misiliinne s'aafettowe oona bessii?» geedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Unttunttukka, «K'eesaarewaa» giide zaareeddino. Inneekka, «Hewaa gidooppe: K'eesaarewaa, K'eesaarew immite; S'oossaawaa, S'oossaw immite» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Unttunttukka, I haasayeedda K'aalaan asaa sintsan oyk'k'anaw danddayibeykkino. Aa zaaruwaan maalalettiide c'o"u geeddino.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hayk'uwaappe Dendduwaabaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Saduk'aawanatuppe ittuu ittuu Yesuusakko yiide, ooshaa aw shiishsheeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Kit. 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>Unttunttukka Yesuusa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Zar. 25:5</ref></char></note> «Tamaarissiyaawoo, itti bitanii machchatto akkiide na'aa yelennaan hayyiyaawaa gidooppe, mishiratto hewaa ishay laataa akki na'aa yeliide bare ishaw zeretsaa wotsana mala Muse nuw s'aafeedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Itti wodiyaan laappu ishatuu de'iyaawanttuppe, bayiray machchatto akkiide yelennaan hayk'k'i aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Laa'entsiyaawekka izo laatteedda. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Heezzentsiyaawekka k'ay izo akkeedda; laappunatuukka izo akkiide na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Wurssetsaan mishirattakka hayk'k'a aggaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Simmi laappunatuukka he mishiratto akkeedda diraw, hayk'uwaappe denddeedda wode, iza oossi machche gidanee?» yaagi oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesuusikka, «Ha alamiyaa naanay akkiinonne akettiino. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Shin hayk'uwaappe denddiide, sintsappe yiyaa wodiyaan de'anaw bessiyaawanttu akkikkinonne akettikkino. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Unttunttu S'oossaa kiitanchchaa malatiide de'iyaa diraw, hewaappe simmiide hayk'k'ikkino. Hayk'uwaappe denddiyaawantta gidiyaa diraw unttunttu S'oossaa naanaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Muse, S'oossay aw k'onc'c'eedda woraabaa s'aafeedda taarikiyaa garssan, Godaa S'oossaa, ‹Abraahaamo S'oossaa, Yisaak'a S'oossaa, Yaak'ooba S'oossaa› yaagiide s'eesussay, hayk'k'awanttu denddiyaawaa bessee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kes. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ubbaykka aw hayk'k'i beennawantta gidiyaa diraw, I hayk'k'ibeennawanttu S'oossaappe attin, hayk'k'owanttuwaa gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Itti itti Muse higgiyaa s'aafeeddawanttukka, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, lo"uwaa haasayaadda» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Hawaappe simmiide, ittuukka Aa oochchanaw s'alowe baawa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Oonee Giyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Hawaappe kaala Yesuusi unttuntta, «Asay Kiristtoosa wooti ‹Daawite na'aa› yaagiinoo? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43"/>Gaasotetsaynneekka, Daawite bare huup'ew Mazimure Mas'aafaa garssan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42-43">« ‹Goday ta Godaa, «Taani ne morkkatuwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">ne gediyaappe garssanna de'anaadan ootsana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">ta ushechchaan utta» geedda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:42-43">yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>«Simmi Daawite Kiristtoosa, ‹Godaa›, giide s'eesiyaawaa gidooppe, wooti aw na'aa gidana danddayii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muse Higgiyaa Tamaarissiyaawanttuppe <optbreak/>Naagettana Mala, Yesuusi Seereedda Seeraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Asay ubbay sisishshin barena kaalliyaawanttoo, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttuppe naagettite; unttunttukka, adussa k'amishiyaa mayyiide yuuyyanaw, geyay de'iyaa saan bonchcho sarotaa akkanaw, woossiyaa gollen bonchcho oydiyaan uttanaw, shoobetteeddasan bonchchosaa koyyiyaawantta. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Hewanttukka am"atuwaa golliyaa kalloyiyaawantta; barentta bessanaw woosaa adussiyaawantta; unttuntta iita pirdday naage» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Am"attibaanne Izi Imotaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesuusi d'ok'k'u giide s'eelliyaa wode, dure Asay geeshsha golliyaan imotaa shiishshiyaa miishshaa giddon barenttoo de'iyaawaappe unttunttu yeggiyaa wode be'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>K'aykka itti hiyyeesaa am"e mishiratta laa"u sembberiyaa hewaan yeggiyaa wode be'iide, <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>«Ta hinttew tumuwaa gay, ha hiyyeesaa am"e mishiratta, ooppenne daruwaa immaaddu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Ha Asay ubbay barenttoo palahowaappe immeeddino; shin iza bare hiyyeesateshaa wolk'k'aan barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa immaaddu» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Gollii Kolettanawaa Yesuusi Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu ittuu, «Geeshsha gollii lo"o shuchchaaninne baalaa shiik'uwaa imotaan lo"eeddawaa» yaagi haasayiyaa wode Yesuusi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Hawe hinttenttu be'iyaawe ubbay kolettennaan, shuchchay shuchchaa bollan keelettiide attena wodii yaanawaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Unttunttukka, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, simmi hawe hananawe awudee? K'aykka hawe hananaw mallay ayee?» yaagiid oochcheeddino.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Metuwaa Wodiinne Nashechchaa Wodii Yaanawaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-13">Mat. 24:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Ikka, «Ooninne baletsennaadan naagettite; c'ora asay, ‹Taani Kiristtoosa› yaagiidde k'aykka, ‹Wodii mateedda› yaagiidde ta suntsaan yaanawantta; hinttenttu k'ay unttuntta kaalloppite. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Olaa yewuwaanne asaa makkalaabaa sisiyaa wode dagammoppite; hawe koyro hananaw bessiyaawaa gido diraappe attin wurssetsay biraa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Hewaappe kaalliide asaw, «Asay asaa bolla, kawutetsaykka kawutetsaa bolla, denddanawaa; <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>wolk'k'aama biittaa k'aatsay hananawaa; koshaynne harggii, dumma dummasaan med'ettanawaa; yashshiyaa yewuunne ubbaakka wolk'k'aama malaatay saluwaappe hananawaa.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>«Hawe ubbay hananaappe kasiyaan k'ay Asay hinttentta oyk'k'anawantta, metootsanawantta; hini Ayihudatuwaa woosa golle asaw aatsi immanawantta; k'asho gollekka gelissanawantta; kaatatuwaa sintsaninne mooddiyaawanttu sintsan shiishshanawantta; hawe ubbay ta suntsaa gaasuwaan hinttentta gakkanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Hawekka markkattanaw hinttew lo"o kaac'aa gidanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Hawaa gidiyaa diraw, ay zaaruwaa immanee giidde koyrottiide hinttenttu un"ettenna mala hawaa wozanaa aatsite. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Ek'ettiyaawanttu ubbay, ek'ettanawunne lakanaw danddayenna k'aalaanne aad'd'o c'inc'c'atetsaa taani hinttenttoo immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk'. 12:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Hinttentta yeleeddawanttunne hinttenttu ishatuu, hinttenttu dabbatuunne hinttenttu laggetsatuukka attenaan hinttentta aatsi immanawantta; hinttenttuppekka ittuwaa ittuwaa wod'anawantta. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ta suntsaa diraw asaa ubbaa matan is's'etteeddawantta gidanita. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Yewuwaan k'ay hinttenttu huup'iyaa binnanaappekka ittinnanne bayukku. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Min ek'k'iide hinttenttu shemppuwaa ashshiita.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Yerusaalame Bayetsaabaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Yerusaalame olaa asaan dooddetteedda wode, izi bayetsay mateeddawaa erite. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>He wode Yihudaan de'iyaawanttu deriyaakko bak'atino; katamaan de'iyaawanttu k'ay hewaappe kesino; baalaagariyan de'iyaawanttukka yaa katamaakko geloppino; <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>S'oossaa k'aalaan s'aafetteeddawe ubbay polettanaadan hawe haluwaa kesiyaa wodiyaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Biittaa bollan wolk'k'aama metuu hananawaa; ha"i de'iyaa asaa bollan hank'k'uu yaanawaa; hewaa diraw he wodiyaan shahaarowanttoonne d'antsiyawanttoo aayye! <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Asay ubbay mashshaan hayk'k'anawantta; S'oossaa erenna gadiyaa ubbatuukka omooduwaan baanawantta; Yerusaalamekka Ayihuda gidennawanttu wodii polettana gakkanaw, unttunttun yed'etteeddawunno gidanawunnu.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Laa'entso Yuussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar. 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Awaa, agenaaninne s'oolinttiyaa bolla malaatay hananawaa; abbaappenne beetaa kooshshaappe denddo gaasuwaan biittaa bollan de'iyaa Asay ubbay un"ettanawantta; hirgganawantta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Iyu. 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Sas'. 6:12</ref>, <ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Saluwaa wolk'k'ay ubbay k'aas's'iyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Saluwaa wolk'k'ay ubbay k'aas's'ee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, beni wode asay, saluwaan de'iyaa s'oolinttii ubbay ayaanaa wolk'k'aanna de'ee giide k'oppee.</char></note> diraw Asay yashshaaninne alamiyaa bolla ayee yaanaweeshsha yaagiidde naaguwaan daaburanawantta. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>He wode Asaa Na'ay wolk'k'aaninne wolk'k'aama bonchchuwaan shaariyaan yiyaa wode be'anawantta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Sas'. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Hinttenttukka, ha yewuu polettussaa doommiyaa wode, wozuu s'eetuwaa diraw sitti giide ek'k'ite; pude d'ok'k'u giide s'eellite» geedda.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balasiyaa Geetettiyaa Mitsaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kaalliiddekka, hawaa yaagi leemisuwaa odeedda, «Woddentsaappenne hara mitsaa ubbaappe s'eellite; <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Haytsay aac'ina be'iyaa wode, he wode bonii mateeddawaa hinttenttu eriita. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Hewaadankka k'ay yewatuu polettiyaawaa be'iyaa wode, S'oossaa Kawutetsatta mateeddawunno erite.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>«Taani hinttew tumuwaa gay; hawe ubbay polettana gakkanaw ha yeletay aad'd'enna. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Saluunne sa'ay aad'd'ana; shin ta k'aalay aad'd'enna. <verse eid="LUK 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Simmi zaway baynna de'uwaan, ushshaa daruwaanne de'uwaaban un"ettishshin hinttenttu wozanay leppennaadaninne he gallassay p'iriyaadan k'oppennaan hinttena gakkennaadan naagettite; <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Hawe biittaa ubbaan de'iyaawanttu ubbatuwaa bollan gakkanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Simmi yiyaa iitabaa ubbaappe hinttenttu attanaadaaninne asaa na'aa sintsankka ek'k'anaw danddayana mala, ubbaa wode min woossite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Yesuusi gallassi gallassi geeshsha golliyaan tamaarissiide, k'amma k'amma Debre Zayite yaagettiyaa deriyaakko kesiide ak'ee. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Asay ubbay Aa sisanaw guuran yaa geeshsha golliyaa aakko yiino.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Wod'anaw Mak'k'etteeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Paasigaa geetettiyaa magaage Ukitsaa Miyaa Baalay mateedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kes. 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Muse higgiyaa s'aafiyaawanttu Yesuusa wooti wod'anentto, wod'iyaa ogiyaa geeman koyyiino; shin asaw yayyiino. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>S'alahiikka tammanne laa"u kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuwaa gideedda Ask'k'orootu Yihudaan geleedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Ikka biide, Yesuusa wooti aatsi immanentto k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaannanne geeshsha golliyaa naagiyaawanttu kaappatuwaanna ittippe haasayeedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Unttunttukka nashettiide, miishshaakka Yihudaw immanaw wuletteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ikka eeno geedda; Asay baynna saan Yesuusa aatsi immanaw injjetiyaa wodiyaa koyyee.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ayihudatuwaa Paasigaa Maanaw Giigetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Magaage Ukitsaa Miyaa Baalaa bonchchiyaa wodii gakkeedda; he wodiikka Paasigaw dorssaa shukkanaw bessiyaa wodiyaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesuusi P'es'iroosanne Yohaannisa, «Paasigaa k'umaa nuuni maanaadan biide giigissite» giide kiitteedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Unttunttukka zaariide, «Hak'an giigissanaadan koyyay?» yaagi oochcheeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Ikka, «Hinttenttu, katamaa geliyaa wode otuwaanna haatsaa tookkeedda bitanii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Haatsaa tookkeedda bitanii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He wode he gaden asaa gollen kiitettiyaa attuma k'oomay haatsaa tookkooppe, he gollii dure gidiyaawaa bessee.</char></note> hinttenttunna gakettanawaa; I geliyaa golliyaa Aa kaalliide gelite; <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>He golliyaawaakka, ‹Tamaarissiyaawe neena, «Taani, taana kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe Paasigaa k'umaa miyaa imatsaa kifilii hak'a baggana de'ii?» yaagee› giite. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>He bitaniikka pook'iyaa bollan de'iyaa hiis'etti utteedda aako kifiliyaa hinttentta bessanawaa; hewaanikka sa'aa giigissite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Unttunttu biide, Yesuusi goowaadankka bitaniyaa demmiide Paasigaa k'umaa giigisseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Paasigaa k'umay meetettiyaa saatii gakko wode, tammanne laa"u kiitettowanttunna ittippe k'umaa maanaw utteedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Ikka, «Taana metuu gakkanaappe kasiyaan hinttenttunna ha Paasigaa k'umaa maanaw daro amottaadde de'ay. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Ayaw gooppe, ta hinttew odiyaawe, hawe S'oossaa kawutetsaan polettana gakkanaw, taani laa'entsuwaa hawaappe miikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>S'uu'aa akkiide, S'oossaa galatiide, «Hawaa heytte, hinttenttu gidduwaan gishetti ushite. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Ayaw gooppe, ta hinttenttoo yaagay, S'oossaa Kawutetsay yaana gakkanaw, hachcheppe doommaade woyniyaa eessaa ushikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>K'ay magaage ukitsaa akkiide, S'oossaa galateedda; he ukitsaa mentsi unttunttoo immiidde, «Hawe hinttenttoo imettiyaawe ta ashuwaa; hawaan taana k'oppana mala hawaa miite» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Kawuwaa moowaappe guyyiyaan, kasewaadan s'uu'aa dentsi unttunttoo immiide, hawaadan yaageedda: «Ha s'uu'ay, ta hinttenttu diraw gussiyaa ta suutsaa k'ofetsiyaa ooratsa c'aak'uwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat. 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar. 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 K'or. 11:23-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Shin be'ite, taana aatsi immanaw de'iyaa bitanii gaytaan taananna ittippe mee. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ayaw gooppe, taani Asaa Na'ay S'oossay goowaadan bay; shin taana aatsiide immiyaa uraw aw aayye» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Unttunttu giddoppe hewaa ootsanaw de'iyaawe oona gidanentto, barenttu giddon ooshaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaawe Oonee? Yaagiyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>K'ay barenttu giddoppe ooni aad'd'intto yaagettiyaa palumay unttunttu giddon keseedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesuusi unttuntta yaageedda: «Ha alamiyaa mooddiyaawanttu barenttu asaa bolla godattiino; unttuntta mooddiyaawanttu keekatuwaa geetettiino. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Shin hinttenttu hawaadan hanoppite; yewuwaan k'ay hinttenttuppe d'ok'k'a gideeddawe hintte ubbaappe guus's'iyaawaa; hinttentta mooddiyaawekka, hinttenttoo k'oomaadan hano.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>«K'umaa maanaw utteeddawaappenne k'umaa asaw aatsiyaawaappenne ooni bonchchettii? K'umaa maanaw utteeddawaa gidennee? Taani k'ay hinttenttu giddon k'umaa aatsiyaa k'oomaa mala. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>K'ay taani paac'ettiyaa wodiyaan hinttenttu taananna ittippe min ek'k'eeddawantta. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29-30"/>Aa kawutetsaa oydiyaan uttana mala Ta aabbu taana suntsowaadan, Taani k'ay Ta kawutetsaan ta gaytaappe maanaadaaninne ushanaadan, tammanne laa"u Israa'eeliyaa yaratuwaa bolla pirddiidde, kawutetsaa oydiyaan uttana mala hinttentta suntsaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:29-30"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Kaadanawaa Yesuusi Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Goday, «Simoonaa, Simoonaa, taani odiyaawaa sisa; s'alahii hinttentta Asay zarggaa hal"iyaawaadan, hal"anaw S'oossaa woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Shin taani ne ammanuu bayennaadan ne diraw gaannataaddi. Neeni taakko simmiyaa wode ne ishatuwaa minisa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simooni zaariide, «Godaw, taani neenanna k'ashettanawunne neenanna ittippe hayk'k'anaw giiga uttaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesuusi k'ay, «P'es'iroosa, taani new yaagay; hachche bilahiyaan, kuttuu waassanaw heezzu gede taana neeni, ‹Aa taani erikke› gaade kaadanaassa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo, «Korojjuu, k'arc'c'iitiinne c'aammay banttaan taani hinttentta kiitto wode, hinttenttoo ittibay pac'c'owe de'ii?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Unttunttukka, «Ittibaynne nuw pac'c'ibeenna» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mat. 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mar. 6:8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk'. 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Ikka zaariide, «Ha"i k'ay korojjuu de'iyaawe akki bo; k'arc'c'iiti de'iyaawekka hewaadan ootso; baynnawe k'ay bare mayuwaa zal"iide mashshaa shammo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Ayaw gooppe ta hinttew yaagay, ‹Hawe makkalanchchatunna ittippe paydetteedda› yaagetti S'oossaa Mas'aafan s'aafetteeddawe, taanan polettennaan attena. Ee, taw geetetteeddawe ha"i polettanawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu, «Godaw, hawaan laa"u mashshay de'ee» yaagina ikka, «Hewe gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Debre Zayite Deriyaan Woosseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-40">Mat. 26:36-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesuusi katamaappe kesiide, hara gallassi biyaawaadankka Debre Zayite beedda. K'ay Aa kaalliyaawanttukka Aa geeduwaa beeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>He sa'aa gakkiide, «Paac'iyaan hinttenttu gelennaan attana mala, woossite» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Shuchchaa olina gakkiyaasaa keena unttunttuppe haakki beedda. Gulbbatiide, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Ta Aabboo, neeni koyyiyaawaa gidooppe, ha metuwaa s'uu'aa taappe digga; shin ta shene gidoppo; ne shene gidoppe attin» yaagiide woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Saluwaappe yiide minisiyaa kiitanchchay aw beetteedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Bare wozanaa giddon seelettiidde, darii woosseedda. I c'awottiyaa c'awuukka sa'aa bollan s'okiyaa suutsaa malateedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Woosaappe denddiide, barena kaalliyaawanttukko guyye biide, unttunttu daroppe k'aretteedda diraw, daaburiide gem"ishowantta s'eelliide, <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>«Ayaw gem"ishiitee? Paac'iyaan gelennaadan denddi woossite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Morkketuwaa Kushiyan Oyk'etteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesuusi hewaa haasay de'ishshin, c'ora Asay yeeddino. Tammanne laa"u Aa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuwaa gideedda Yihudaa geetettiyaawe he asaa kaaletsiide yeranaw Yesuusakko shiik'eedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yesuusi k'ay, «Yihudaw, neeni taana Asaa Na'aa yeraade aatsa immay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Aa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa Aa kaalliyaawanttu hanettiyaa yewuwaa be'o wode Aa, «Godaw, ha asaa nuuni mashshaan k'ans's'anee?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu, K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa k'oomaa shoc'iide, Aa ushechcha haytsaa k'ans's'i oleedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Yesuusi k'ay zaariide, «Aggite, bashite» yaageedda. Bitaniyaa haytsaakka bochchiide patseedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yesuusikka barekko yeedda k'eesatuwaa kaappatoo, geeshsha golliyaa naagiyaawanttoo, suntsatoonne gadiyaa c'imatoo, «Paannuwaa oyk'k'iyaawaadan mashshaanne s'am"aa oyk'k'iide yiitee? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Geeshsha golliyaan taani gallassaan, gallassaan hinttenttunna de'iyaa wode, taana oyk'k'ibeykkita; shin ha"i hawe hinttenttu wodenne d'umaa wolk'k'aa wode» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Yesuusa Kaddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-72">69-72</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Yesuusa oyk'k'i k'achchiide, K'eesatuwaa ubbaa kaappuwaa golle afiide gelisseeddino. P'es'iroosikka unttunttuppe guyye haakuwaan unttunttu geeduwaa kaallee. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Dirssaa giddon tamaa eetsiide, ittippe utti de'ishshin, P'es'iroosi unttunttu giddon yiide utti aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Tamay poo'iyaa baggana P'es'iroosi uttiide de'ishshin, itti k'oomata loytsa s'eellaade, «Hawekka aanana ittippe de'ee» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>P'es'iroosi k'ay, «Hanne mishirattee, taani Aa erikke» yaagi kaddeedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hara bitanii P'es'iroosa be'iide, «Neeni unttunttunna gatso de'aa» yaagina:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">P'es'iroosi k'ay, «Hawo bitanew, taani aanana gatso de'ikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Itti saate gidiyaawaa gam"iide hara bitanii k'onc'c'issiide, «I Galiilaa gade asaa gidiyaa diraw, ha bitanii aanana ittippe de'iyaawe tuma» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>P'es'iroosi k'ay, «Ha bitanew, neeni giyaawe ayentto taani erikke» yaageedda. He wodiyaan I birokka haasay de'ishshin, ellekka kuttuu waassi aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Goday guyye simmiide, P'es'iroosa s'eelleedda. P'es'iroosi Goday barena, «Hachche kuttuu waassana gakkanaw, heezzu gede taana kaddanaassa» geedda Godaa k'aalay aw k'ofetti aggeedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>P'es'iroosi dirssaappe kare kesiide, seelettiide yeekkeedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Yesuusa oyk'k'eedda Asay k'iliic'iinonne shoc'iino. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Aa ayfiyaa goozi bak'k'iide, «Neena bak'k'eeddawe oonee? Nabiyaa gidooppe neena dechchawaa ane oda» yaagiide Aa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>K'ay Aa hara c'ora boriyaa boreeddino.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Pirddaw Afeeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Sa'ay wonttina gadiyaa c'ima asatuu, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu, Yesuusa barenttu shiik'eeddasaa afiide, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>«Kiristtoosi neenee? Ane nu oda» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Shin I, «Taani hinttenttoo odooppe taana ammanikkita; <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>K'ay hinttentta taani oochchooppe odikkita; woy k'ashuwaappe taana billikkita. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Shin ha saatiyaappe doommina taani Asaa Na'ay, ha"ippe doommaade, wolk'k'aama S'oossaa ushechcha baggana uttana» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Unttunttu ubbay Yesuusa, «Yaatina neeni S'oossaa Na'ee?» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ikka zaariide, «Taani S'oossaa Na'aa gidowaa hinttenttu haasayeeddita» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Unttunttukka, «Nuuni nu huup'ew Aa doonaappe siseeddo; hawaappe sintsaw ay markkaa koshshii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">P'ilaas'oosi Yesuusa oochcheedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat. 27:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Hewaan shiik'eedda ubbatuukka ittippe denddiide, Yesuusa P'ilaas'oosakko afeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Unttunttukka, «Ha bitanii nu asaa baletsiide, Asay Roome biittaa kaatiyaa K'eesaraw giiraa immenna mala diggiide, k'ay, ‹Taani Kiristtoosa› yaagishin demmeeddo» yaagiide mootuwaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>P'ilaas'oosikka Yesuusa, «Hawo, Ayihudatuwaa kaatii neenee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesuusi zaariide Aa, «Neeni ga de'aassa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>P'ilaas'oosi k'eesatuwaa kaappatoonne asaw odiidde, «Taani ha bitaniyaa bollan ayinne iita oosuwaa demmabeykke» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Gidoppe attin unttunttu, «Ha bitanii Galiilaappe doommiide, haray atto hawaa gakkanawukka, Yihudaa gadiyaa ubbaa bare timirttiyaan k'aatsiidde de'ee» yaagiide minisi odeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Heroodisa Sintsa Shiik'eedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>P'ilaas'oosikka hawaa sisiide, «I Galiilaa asee?» yaagiide eranaw oochcheedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>P'ilaas'oosi Heroodise mooddiyaa gadiyaappe Yesuusi yeeddawaa ereedda wode, Heroodisekka k'ay he wodiyaan Yerusaalamen de'iyaa diraw, aakko Yesuusa yeddeedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Heroodise daro wodiyaappe doommiide Yesuusa be'anaw amotti de'iyaa diraw, Aa be'eedda wode daroppe nashetteedda. Yesuusa waariyaa siseeddawaa diraw, I ooratsabaa ootsishshin be'anaw hidootaan gam"eedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Heroodise Yesuusa darobaa oochcheedda; shin Yesuusi aw ayaanne zaaribeenna. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu hewaan ek'k'iide, Yesuusa loytsi mootiidde de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Heroodisenne Aa wotaadaratuu Yesuusa kad'iide, Aa bolla k'iliic'eeddino. Bonchchetteedda mayuwaa Aa mayzziide, P'ilaas'oosakko zaariide yeddeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Heroodisenne P'ilaas'oosi hawaappe kasenna morkkiyaan de'iino; shin he gallassi sigetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Hayk'k'ana Mala Mooteeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh. 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>P'ilaas'oosi k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaa, ayissiyaawanttanne hara c'ora asaa ittippe s'eesiide, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Hawaadan yaageedda, « ‹Ha bitanii asaa makkalatetsaw dentsetsee›, yaagiide taakko aheeddita; taanikka hinttenttu sintsaan bidda s'eellaade, hinttenttu shiishsheedda mootuwaan itti balaanne Aa bollan demmabeykke. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>K'ay Heroodisekka Aa bollan ayinne demmibeenna diraw, haa nuukko zaari yeddeedda; hinttenttu be'iyaawaadankka, ha bitanii Aa hayk'oo gatsiyaabaa ayinne ootsibeenna. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Hawaa diraw taani Aa muraade billana» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ha payduu, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«P'ilaas'oosaw Paasigaa Baalaa bonchchuwaa gallassaan itti uraa k'ashuwaappe billiyaa dooyay de'ee» yaagee. Shin, Dawurootsuwaa Geeshsha Mas'aafaa Ooratsa C'aak'uwaa gidduwaan ha payduu s'aafettibeenna gaasuu, hara Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwaa biletsatuwaan ubbatuwaankka s'aafettibeenna diraassa.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Asay ubbay ittippe gidiide, «Ha bitaniyaa yaa digga! Barbbaana giyaa Yesuusa nuw billa!» yaagiide c'abbotteeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barbbaan katamaan walassaa dentsiide, asaa wod'eedda diraw, k'ashetteeddawaa.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>P'ilaas'oosi Yesuusa billanaw koyyiide, asaw laa'entsuwaa gujjiide haasayeedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Shin unttunttu, «Mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishaade kak'k'a! Kak'k'a!» yaagi waasseeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>P'ilaas'oosikka heezzentsuwaa unttuntta, «Ayaw? Ha bitanii ootseedda iita oosuu ayee? Taani Aa hayk'oo gatsiyaa naak'uwaa ayinne aappe demmabeykke; hawaa diraw, Aa muraade billa yeddana» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Shin unttunttu barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, kak'ettanaadaan darii waasseeddino. Unttunttu waasuukka P'ilaas'oosa k'ofaa laammeedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Hawaa diraw, P'ilaas'oosikka unttunttu ooshay simmanaadan Yesuusa bollan pirddeedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Asaa makkalaw dentsetsiiddenne shemppuwaa wod'iide, k'ashetteedda bitaniyaa bilettanaadan unttunttu woosso diraw, he bitaniyaa billeedda. Shin Yesuusa barenttu sheniyaadan koyyowaa ootsana mala, aatsi immeedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Mask'k'aliyan Kak'etteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Mat. 27:31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Yesuusa oyk'k'i afiidde de'ishshin, Simoona geetettiyaa K'ereena bitanii heeraappe yiidde de'ishshin demmiide, mask'k'aliyaa toossiide Yesuusanna baana mala ootseeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Daro c'ora asaynne yeekkiyaa mac'c'awanttu guyyenna kaalliino. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesuusi guyye simmiide unttunttoo, «Hinttenoo, Yerusaalame mac'c'awanttoo, hinttenttu huup'ewunne hinttenttu naanaw yeekkiteppe attin, taw yeekkoppite; <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>‹Mantsa gideeddawanttunne yelibeenna uluu, d'antsibeenna d'antsay, anjjetteeddawantta› geetettiyaa wodii yaanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>He wodiyaan, ‹Zoozatoo, nu bolla woddite; zukkullatuwaakka, nuuna k'osite› yaaganita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Sas'. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Simmi k'ayye mitsaan hawaadan hanooppe, mela mitsaan waananawee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Yesuusanna ittippe kak'k'etana mala, iita oosuwaa ootseedda hara laa"u asatuwaakka afeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>K'eeraanew geetettiyaasaa gakkeedda wodiyaan, Yesuusa kak'k'eeddino. Iitaa ootsowanttakka, ittuwaa ushechchanna, yekkuwaa haddirssanna kak'k'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesuusi, «Ta Aabboo, unttunttu barenttu ootsiyaawaa erenna diraw, unttunttu nagaraa atto ga» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Unttunttukka Aa mayuwaa saamaa yegettiide gishetti akkeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Asay ek'k'i s'eellishshin, gadiyaa mooddiyaawanttu, «Harantta ashshee; S'oossaan dooretteedda Kiristtoosi Aa gidooppe, ane bare huup'iyaa ashshennee?» yaagiide k'iliic'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>K'ay wotaadaratuukka shiik'iide k'iliic'eeddino; c'ammeedda woyniyaa eessaa aw ahi immiide, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>«Hawo, neeni Ayihuda kaatiyaa gidooppe, ne huup'iyaa ashsha!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Huup'issannakka, «Hawe Ayihuda kaatiyaa» yaagiyaa s'aafuwaa s'aafeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Iitaa ootsiide kak'etteeddawanttuppe ittuu, boriiddinne toochchiidde, «Hawo neeni Kiristtoosa gidikkii? Ane Aa gidooppe, ne huup'iyaanne nuuna ashsha» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Yekkuu k'ay Aa, «Neeni hawaa malatiyaa pirddaa bolla de'aaddekka S'oossaw yayyikkii? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Nuuni kiitetteedda balaan muraa akkiidde de'eetto; nuw bessiyaa muraa bollan de'eetto; shin ha bitanii itti iitabaanne ootsibeenna» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>I Yesuusa, «Neeni ne kawutetsaa wolk'k'aan yiyaa wode, taana k'oppa» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesuusikka, «Taani new tumuwaa oday, hachche taananna ittippe gannatiyaan de'anaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>He wode usuppun saate gidiyaa keena; hewaappe udduppu saatiyaa gakkanaw, biittaa ubbaa bollan d'uma gideedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Awaykka bare poo'uwaa diggeedda; geeshsha golliyaa gaaridduukka peed'ettiide laa"uwaa keseedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesuusikka daro d'ok'k'u geedda k'aalaan waassiide, «Ta Aabboo, taani ta shemppuwaa ne kushiyaan aatsa immay!» yaagi simmowaappe guyyiyaan I hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>S'eetuwaa kaappuu haneedda yewuwaa be'eedda wode, «Ha bitanii tumakka s'illo asaa» yaagiide S'oossaa galateedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Hawaa be'anaw ittisaa shiik'eedda Asay ubbay haneedda yewuwaa be'iide, barenttu tiraa bak'k'iidde simmeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Yesuusa eriyaa Asay ubbaynne Galiilaappe doommiide Aa kaalleedda mac'c'awanttu hawaa s'eelliide, haakuwaan ek'k'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Moogetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Ayihuda shanggatuwaa gideeddawanttuppe ittuu, Yooseefo geetettiyaa lo"anne s'illo bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Ha bitanii shanggatuwaa mak'k'uwaanne unttunttu oosuwaan ittippetetsaa ootsibeenna. S'oossaa kawutetsaa yuussaa hidootaan naagiidde de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Yooseefokka P'ilaas'oosakko biide, Yesuusa anhaa akkanaw woosseedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Akkanaadan geetettowaappe guyye, anhaa bollappe wotsiide, lo"o mooguwaa mayuwaan s'aas'iide, shuchchaappe wooc'ettiide med'etteedda, ooninne kase moogettibeenna ollaa giddon wotseedda. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Gallassaykka sambbataa mokkanaw giigiyaa gallassaa; sambbataykka gelana hanee.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galiilaappe doommiide Yesuusanna ittippe yeedda mac'c'awanttu kaalliidde, duufuwaan Aa anhaa wootiide wotseeddinontto be'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Unttunttu hawaappe soy simmiide, shittuwaanne okkiyaawaa anhaw giigisseeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Higgiyaa maaraadan sambbata gallassi shemppeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Hayk'uwaappe Denddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Saaminttaappe koyro gallassaa, mac'c'awanttu giigisseedda shittuwaa oyk'k'iide darii guuriide duufuwaakko beeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Shuchchaykka duufuwaa doonaappe gonddorettina be'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Unttunttu duufuwaa garssa ollaa gelo wode, Godaa Yesuusa anhaa demmibeykkino. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Mac'c'awanttu sid'iidde de'ishshin, wac'iwac'iyaa mayuwaa mayyeedda laa"u asatuu, k'oppennaan unttunttu miyyiyaan ek'k'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Mac'c'awanttukka yashshaappe denddowaan sa'aa s'eelliidde de'ishshin, laa"u asatuu, «De'uwaan de'iyaawaa, Aa ayaw hayk'k'owanttu giddoppe koyyiitee? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6-7"/>I denddeedda; hawaan baawa. K'aykka Galiilaan de'iyaa wodiyaan, ‹Asaa na'ay nagaranchchatuwaa kushiyan aad'd'i imettanawaa; mask'k'aliyaa bollan kak'ettanawaa, heezzentso gallassi hayk'uwaappe denddanawaa› yaagettowaa k'oppite» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Mac'c'awanttukka he wode k'aalaa akeekeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Unttunttukka duufuwaappe simmiide ha ubbaa yewuwaa tammanne itti kiitettowanttoonne unttuntta kaalliyaawanttoo ubbatoo odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Hawaa Yesuusi kiittowanttoo odeeddawanttu: Magdalappe yeedda Mayraamo, Yohaanno, Yaak'ooba daayo Mayraamonne unttunttunna ittippe de'iyaa hara Mac'c'awantta. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Unttunttoo mac'c'awanttu odiyaa k'aalay k'aajjiyaawaa malatina ammanibeykkino.<verse eid="LUK 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Shin he wode P'es'iroosi denddiide duufuwaakko wos's'eedda. Yaa gakkiide hokki s'eelliyaa wode, garssan mooguwaa mayyo s'alalay de'iyaawaa be'eedda. Hano yewuwaankka maalalettiide, golle simmeedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emaahuusa Ogiyaan Yesuusi <optbreak/>Laa"u Asatoo K'onc'c'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Mar. 16:12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>He gallassi Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"u asatuu Yerusaalameppe laa"u saatiyaa haakkiyaa Emaahuusa geetettiyaa heeraa biidde; <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>ittuu ittuwaanna haneedda yewuwaa ubbaa haasay de'iino. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Unttunttu haasayiiddinne zorettiidde de'ishshin, Yesuusi bare huup'ew yiide unttunttu miyyiyaa shiik'iide unttunttunna biidde de'ee. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Shin unttunttu bare ayfiyaan s'eelliidde Aa gidiyaawaa shaakki eranaw danddaybbeykkino.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesuusi, «Hinttenttu ogiyaa bollan ittuu ittuwaanna haasayiyaawe ayee?» yaagi oochcheedda. Unttunttukka dagamaan lechchummiide ek'k'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu K'eliyoop'aa geetettiyaawe, «Ha gidduwaan Yerusaalamen hano yewuwaa erennawe ne s'alalay ha gadew imatsee?» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yesuusi, «I ayee?» yaagina, unttunttukka, «S'oossaa sintsaninne asaa ubbaa sintsan k'aalaaninne kiitaan mino nabiyaa gideedda Naazireetiyaa Yesuusabaa haasayeetto. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Aakka k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne nuuna mooddiyaawanttu hayk'uwaa pirddaw aatsi immeeddino; mask'k'aliyaa bollan wod'eeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Nuuni kasenna, ‹Israa'eeliyaa asaa wozanawaa› yaagi hidootowe Aa; shin ha yewuu hanettiide aad'd'oodeppe heezzu k'amma gideedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Nu giddoppe itti itti mac'c'awanttu nuuna maalalisseeddino. Unttunttu guuraan hini duufuwaa beeddino, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>shin Yesuusa anhaa unttunttu d'ayo wode shiretti simmiide, I denddeedda; yaagiyaawaa kiitanchchatuu odishin be'eeddo yaagi odeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Nu giddoppekka itti itti Asay duufuwaa biide unttunttu goowaadan hanina be'eeddino; shin Yesuusa anhaa demmibeykkino» yaageeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo, «Hinttenoo, akeekena asatoo, hinttenttu wozanaan nabatuu odowaa ubbaa elle ammanennawanttoo; <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kiristtoosi ha metuwaa akkanawunne bare bonchchuwaakko gelanaw bessennee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Hewaappe simmiide Yesuusi Muse mas'aafatuwaappenne Nabatuu s'aafeedda mas'aafatuwaappe doommiide, S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwaa ubbaan s'aafetteedda barebaa unttunttoo billiide odeedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Unttunttu bide'iyaa heeraa mateedda wode, Yesuusi harasaa biyaawaa malateedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>He wode unttunttu Aa, «Gallassay k'ammiidde de'iyaa diraw, omarssay mateedda; nuunanna ittippe ak'a!» yaagi minisi woosseeddino. Hawaa diraw, ikka unttunttunna ittippe ak'anaw geleedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Unttunttu ittippe gaytaan utteedda wode, daabbuwaa dentsiide anjjeedda; mentsiide unttunttoo immeedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Unttunttu ayfiikka Aa akeekaana mala dooyettina, Yesuusa gidiyaawaa ereeddino. Ikka unttunttu sintsaappe geemmeedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Unttunttukka ittuu ittuwaa, «K'ad'd'aan ittippe nu de'ishshin, nuuna I haasayissiyaa wodiyaaninne S'oossaa mas'aafatuwaakka nuw k'onc'c'issiide I odiyaa wodiyaan, nu wozanaa giddon tamaadan seellee gidennee?» geetetteeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33-34"/>He wodiyaankka denddiide Yerusaalame simmeeddino. Yesuusi kiitto tammanne ittatoonne unttunttunna ittippe de'iyaawanttoo, «Goday tumuwaakka denddeedda, Simoonawukka beetteedda» yaagiide hewaan ittippe shiik'i utteeddawantta demmeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:33-34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>He laa"atuu, k'ad'd'aan haneeddawaanne Yesuusi daabbuwaa mentsiyaa wode wooti Aa ereeddinontto unttunttoo odeeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Kaalliyaawanttoo Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kit. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Hawaa unttunttu haasay de'ishshin, Yesuusi unttunttu giddon ek'k'iide, «Sarotetsay hinttew gido» yaageedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Unttunttoo moyttilliyaa be'owaa malatina dagammiide, yashshaan kumeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ikka unttuntta, «Ayaw dagammiitee? Ayaa diraw hinttenttu wozanay sid'ii? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Taani Yesuusa gidiyaawaa eranaw, ane ta kushiyaanne ta gediyaa be'ite; taanan hinttenttu be'iyaawaadan, moyttillew ashuunne mek'etsay baawa. Ane taana hinttenttu kushiyaan oyk'k'i be'ite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Hawaa yaagi simmiide, bare kushiyaanne bare gediyaa besseedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Unttunttukka nashechchaappe denddowaan, ammanennaan maalaletti de'ishshin I, «Hawaan meetettiyaawe hinttenttoo de'ii?» yaagi unttuntta oochcheedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Unttunttukka, s'iis'etteedda moliyaappe laafa puruwaa aw immeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Ikka akkiide unttunttu sintsaan meedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Ikka, «Taani hinttenttunna ittippe de'aadde, ‹Muse mas'aafaan, nabatuwaa mas'aafaaninne k'aalaan s'aafetto mazimuretuwaan ta diraw s'aafetteedda ubbay polettanaw bessee› yaagaade hinttenttoo odeedda yewuu hawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>He wodiyaankka S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwan geetettowaa akeekaana mala, unttunttu wozanaa dooyyeedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Unttunttoo, « ‹Kiristtoosa metuu gakkanawaa; heezzentsiyaa gallassi hayk'uwaappe denddanawaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Aa Aa suntsan nagaraa paas'etsaynne maarotaa demussay Yerusaalameppe doommiide asaw ubbaw odettanawaa› yaagettiide s'aafetteedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>«Hinttenttukka hawoo markkatuwaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Ta hinttenttoo, Ta aabbu k'aalaa geleedda hidootaa yeddana; hewe gakkanawunne hinttenttoo wolk'k'ay saluwaappe imettana gakkanaw, Yerusaalame katamaan naagishshite» yaageedda.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Saluwaa Simmiide Beedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar. 16:19</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kit. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Hawaappe guyyiyaan, Biitaaniyaa geetettiyaa katamaa gakkanaw, unttuntta afeedda; bare kushiyaa mic'c'iide unttuntta anjjeedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Unttunttuppe shaakettiide, saluwaa beedda. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Unttunttu aw goyinniide, daro nashechchaan Yerusaalame simmeeddino. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>K'ay pac'c'ennan S'oossaa galatiidde, Geeshsha Golliyaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
